<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">NTOGOZI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ntog</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ntogozi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nchemo za Ntogozi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nchemo za</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ntogozi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zabuli ni mduganyo wa nchemo na malombezo. Mo ulosi wa Chiebulaniya zabuli ni nchemo ya kutunya chintu. Ichindedi ni kugamba Zabuli ni nchemo za kumtunya Chohile, mna iviya ziyuko nchemo ntuhu zihengi. Zimwenga ni nchemo za kulombeza wambizi kwa Chohile, zimwenga nazo ni nchemo za kuhongeza kulagisa chinyulu chikulu. Naho kuna za kumtogola seuta, izimwenga nazo ni nchemo za kuhinyiza wantu mwe mbuli za mizungu na ivo akunga Chohile na kujendeleza. Chitabu cha Nchemo chawandikagwa ni wantu walozize na kuduganywa kwa mihilimo ijinkile Magana. Izinchemo izimwenga ni za kale vitendese naho zawandikagwa mwe chipindi cha seuta Daudi. Mna ichikindedi Bibilia yagamba nchemo zilozize zawandikagwa ni seuta Daudi. Nchemo izimwenga zawandikagwa aho Waizulaeli wendaga wauya kulawa uko watahagwa kweisi ya Babeli. Wata kuwandika waloziz wawandika kugamba kuduganya izinchemo kwasilaga mwe kaline ya katatu na ya kane,( Yesu henati kwelekwa. BC). Mduganyo uno wo udumo watendaga Izinchemo zitende na vitabu gana dimwenga na milongo mishano vyepangile mwe vitabu vidodo vishano. Hata uneva ni kulombeza hegu ni nchemo, Nchemo zose ziwandikwa kwa mashaili. Kwa kukombaganya ludongo ushaili we Kiebulaniya neitende wambizimkulu kuzikombaganya Izinchemo. Kuwoneka kukulu ko ushaili we Kiebulaniya kwetangwa, Kuligana kwe misafa na mawandiko. Wata kuwandika si wazwela kuipanga misafa midi kwa hamwenga mwe Izinchemo. Saviya, msafa wa nkongo walonga mbuli niyo msafa wa kaidi waguha kintu kimwenga mwe sila ntuhu. Hamwenga yavuzagiza ifanyanyi idya ilongigwe kwa ulosi mtuhu kwa kuitenda iwoneke kugamba yalonga kintu sicho cha kubela, hegu du kugamba uguha fanyanyi ikuligana na idya yo msafa wa nkongo, hegu naho watambalisa ulosi wo msafa wa nkongo kwa kongezeza ayadya yalongigwe mo msafa wa nkongo. Nchemo ya gana na mlongo yajela moyo na ukuzi kwa kutambalisa ukwiza kwa Mkombola uyo akunga atende seuta na mlavyantambiko. Ivyo vili ivitabu vye Nchemo.</para>
  <para style="io">1 Chitabu cha nkongo cha Nchemo ni mwe isula ya nkongo kubula sula ya milongo mine na umwenga.</para>
  <para style="io">2 Chitabu cha kaidi cha Nchemo ni mwe isula ya milongo mine na midi kubula milongo mfungate na midi.</para>
  <para style="io">3 Chitabu cha katatu cha Nchemo ni mwe isula ya milongo mfungate na mitatu kubula milongo mnane na chenda.</para>
  <para style="io">4 Chitabu cha kane cha Nchemo ni mwe isula ya milongo chenda kubula gana dimwenga na mtandatu.</para>
  <para style="io">5 Chitabu cha shano cha Nchemo ni mwe isula ya gana na mfungate kubula gana na milongo mishano.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="s">Chinyemi cha chindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Chinyemi china yudya mntu hekutimila ulangilizi wa wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">hegu kwelunga mwe sila za wantu wata masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">hegu kwikala mwe chitala cha wata utilizi.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Mna elelwa kutimila sigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">uyo aifanyanya iyo isigilizi chilo na msi.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Mntu sauyo ni saviya mti uhandigwe hampezo he kakolongo ka mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">uwo weleka ntunda mo msimu wakwe naho amani yakwe hayakunyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Chila mbuli akudamanya achumilwa.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Mna wantu wata wavu sivyo ivyo weli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">Awo wesaviya lumpwimpwi lukufiliswa ni mpeho.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Elo, wata wavu nawakantilwe ni Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">wata masa nawasentwe hale na wantu wakanuni.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile alongoza sila za wantu wata uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">mna sila za wavu nazibalangwe.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s">Seuta asagulwe ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Kwambwani wantu wa si ntuhu waika myalo ya kudamanya yehiye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">Ni mbwani wantu wadamanya njama za bule?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Maseuta mwe isi wahituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">masekulu walafya yehiye hamwenga kumhiga Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">na yudya seuta asagule.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Wagamba, “Chiduile hale iminyolo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">chewambule mwe zisigi wachitalize.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Zumbe Chohile akwikala kulanga kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">awaseka na kuwatila.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Akaheza awakwamila kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">na kuwatisa kwa ukali wakwe akagamba,<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />“Simwika seuta nisagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">yudya akulongoza Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">lugulu lwagu lukukile.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Seuta agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">“Nevilikize lagizo dya Zumbe Chohile. Chohile kanigamba, ‘Weye wi mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">miye dyelo sitenda iso.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Nilombeza nahwinke izisi zose zitende ulisi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">ne isi yose itende ugoli wako.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Nowahonde kwa nkome ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">nowatule saviya nyungu!’”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Elo, nyuwe maseuta, jesezani umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">tegelezani idikanyo dino, nyuwe masekulu mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Msankanileni Zumbe Chohile kwa nkama na kusangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">mwelelwe kwa kuzingiza.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Mfikileni madi mwanawe ywa chilume kwa kuzingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">anase kwimukwa ni maya niyo mwabanika chipumpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">nyuwe masekulu mwe isi kwaviya maya yakwe yasunguza kwimuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Ujimbiko wi kwa wadya wakusumkila ugombezi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s">Malombozo ya mtondo kwachausa cha wambizi</para>
  <para style="d">(Nchemo ya Daudi umo amsumke Abusalomu.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wankondo wangu walozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:1">walozesa awo wakunebunga!<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Walozize wanilonga kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">“Chohile hamwambule mwa awankondo awo.”<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Mna weye, Weye Zumbe Chohile wi nchinga yangu ntendele zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">ni weye ukunitenda ning'ale no uhuda wangu.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Nakwilila Zumbe kwa izwi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">weye wanihitula kulawa kolugulu lwako lukukile.<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Nagona ntongo zeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">nenuka vituhu kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile wadima.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Saniyogohe maelufu milongo ya wankondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">wanizunguluke chila ntendele.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, inuka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Unambule, Weye Chohile ywangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Wavune izisaya awankondo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">watule ameno wantu wavu chani wasekunilumiza.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Zumbe Chohile ni weye ukukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">Ujimbiko wako utende mwa awantu wako.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s">Malombozo ya chisingi kwachausa cha wambizi</para>
  <para style="d">(Nchemo ya Daudi)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Weye Zumbe unihitule umo hakulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Weye Chohile ywangu ukunusiza mlema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Nonambize mwe izinkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">niwonela mbazi na kwiva idilombezo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Weyangu nyuwe namnibalangile ntunyo yangu kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Kubula ini namunge mbuli zo uhezi na kulonga udanti?<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Mmanye kugamba Zumbe Chohile kesaguila mkanuni kwachausa chakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Zumbe Chohile aniva chila hamwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Zingizani kwa nkama, naho msekukola masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">umo mkatenda mwe izisazi, mnyamale dwii mkafanyanya.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Lavyani ntambiko zikuwagila'</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">na kumwikiya msuhi Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Wantu walozize wauza, “Ni yuhi akudaha kuchidamanyiza mbuli zedi vituhu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Uchikaule kwa wedi, weye Zumbe Chohile!”<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Mna miye kuninka mbwedo ukuile mo umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">kujinka awo wata na ngano na divai ilozese.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Umo hagona nanipate ntongo kwa utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile ichedu ni weye ukunika mpeho.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya Kudimwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">tega gutwi wive imilosi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">wetegeleze ivyo huugula.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Tegeleza indilo yangu vileke unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">Seuta ywangu na Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">kwaviya weye ni weye hukulombeza.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">mavukuvuku wadiva idizwi dyangu, mtondo nakwigaila malombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">vikaheza nagoja unihitule.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Weye suyo Chohile ukubweda wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">mntu mta wavu mwako hakudaha kwikala.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Wantu wakweduvya hawakudaha kuchimala kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">weye wawehiwa wose wakudamanye yehiye.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Wawabalanga wose wakulonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">wawehiwa wakomi na wadanti.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Mna miye, kwa mbazi zako nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nanize mwe inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">kwa kunyanyahala nanifike madi kuhinga kwe Inyumba yako ikukile.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Nilongoza, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">mo ukuka wako, kwaviya wankondo wangu wekamba wanebunge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">ike isila yako mwazi kulongozi kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Mwe imilomo yawo hamna uchindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mwe myoyo yawo wamema ubanasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">chiya wakulonga ni udanti ukuhosa file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">ndimi zawo zalonga udanti.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, wavyalute kwa mlema wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">wagwe kulawana ne imyalo yawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">wabalaze kuse kwa masa yawo yalozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">kwaviya wakuhituka weye.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Mna welelwe wadya wose wakusumkila kwehonya kwako, wacheme kwa nchelegele mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Wadime wadya wakudyunga idizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">vileke watowe nchelegele kwachausa chako.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">wawajimbika wata kuwagila, wawadima kwa wedi wako saviya nchinga.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo mwe chipindi cha nkunto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, usekunikwahila mwa amaya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">hegu kunivyaluta mwe kwihiwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Nifila mbazi, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">kwaviya sibuntika, weye Zumbe unihonye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">kwaviya mavuha yangu yamema ulumi utendese.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Nangadika vitendese mo umoyo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Weye Zumbe Chohile nozigile kubula ini?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Nihitukila weye Zumbe Chohile, chani unambule, nambula kwachausa cha ungi wako mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Uko kwa wabanike hakuna mntu akukumbuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">Hahana akudaha kukuhongeza kweisi ya wabanike?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Sibuntika kwa kwila kwa chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">chilo pwi sibwekeza ulusazi lwangu kwa mesozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">sichabaza umto wangu kwa mesozi.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Ameso yangu yasokela kwa chihovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">yafifiya kwa kutumbwadiswa ni wankondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Halaweni hangu nyuwe nyose mkudamanya wavu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile keva indilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Zumbe Chohile keva idilombezo dyangu dyo kuwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">Zumbe kazumila lombezo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Wankondo wangu wose nawetuke na kwehelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">nawauye kunyuma kwa soni za chipumpa.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya mntu akunga uwagila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">Chohile ywangu nasumkila ugombezi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">unambule na wose wakunibunyanya vileke unihonye,<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />hegu sivyo nawanitatavule saviya simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">nawanisabantule vihande hande hasekutenda na mntu ywa kunambula. <verse eid="PSA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">hegu sidamanya ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">naho uneva nna mlema wa kudamanya yehiye,<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />naho hegu sidamanya wavu kwakwe uyo mta utondowazi na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">naho hegu simwebunga mnkondo ywangu hehena luhosa,<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />elo, mnkondo ywangu anitimile na kunigwila, ajatangile ujima wangu mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na kunasa kwa file ya soni.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Weye Zumbe Chohile inuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">kwa maya yako wahige awankondo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">Weye kulagiza uwagila udamanyike.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Wachisanye wantu we izisi ntuhu wakuzunguluke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">Uwalongoze kulawa kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wawakantila awantu we izisi ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">Weye Zumbe Chohile, nilagisa kugamba sina ubanasi kwaviya sina mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">kuligana no uwo uchumi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Weye Chohile mta kuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">ukuzuza fanyanyi na myoyo chinda ngavungavu za wata wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">na kuwateda wawagilwa wekale kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Chohile nuyo nchinga yangu, uyo awambula wachumi wa moyo.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Chohile ni mlamuzi mta kuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">awakantila wadya wakudamanya wavu.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Uneva wantu hawanahituile izisila zawo zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">Chohile nanole idibamba dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">nakwese na kufyusa uta wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Kamalanya viziha vyakwe vikukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">kaikoza moto imifulo yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Kaula ivyo mntu mwihi akufanyanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">kamema ubanasi na kudanta wantu.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Akusimba bome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">akaheza atolobela mo mwina.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Nkumbizi akuikonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">yamuwiya mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Nanimtunye Zumbe Chohile kwachausa cho uwagila wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">naho nanidichemele ntogozi idizina dya Zumbe Chohile Mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukuka wa Zumbe Chohile na ntunyo ya mntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, Zumbe ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">kaula ivyo ukulu wako umema mweisi yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Kwika ung'azi wako ubula kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Mwe imilomo ya wana wadodo na wakonka kwika ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">kwekiya nchinga mwa awankondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">chani uwanyamaze awankondo wako na wadya wakukuhiga.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Hazikaula izimbingu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">izo ni ndima za mikono yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">mnenge na ntondo izo wikiye uko,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />mntu ni chintu chani vikuleka umfanyanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">mwana mntu ni chintu chani chikuleka umtunduliye?<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Kubula wamtenda atende hadodo aligane na Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">Kumvisa ntunyo na ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />Kumwinka ukulu mwe ndima zako udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">ivintu vyose uumbile kuvika hasi ho udahi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />Ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">na wanyama wose wa kumbago,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />wadege wo ulanga na samaki wa mwebahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">na chila chintu chi mwe ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">zina dyako dikulisa dyatogolwa mwe isi yose!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s">Kumhongeza Chohile kwa uwagilwa wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile nahuhongeze kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:1">nanitamwile ntendwa zako zose zikwehela.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Nanelelwa na kukuchemela weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">weye Chohile Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">nanidichemele ntogozi idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Wize ulaile wankondo wangu wauyaga kunyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">kulogozi kwako wekobadika na kusilikila.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Kwaviya kugombela uwagila wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">no umwalo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kwikala mwe ichigoda chako cho uzumbe ukakantila viya vikuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Kuwakwahila awantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">na kuwakoma wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">amazina yawo kuyausa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Wankondo wetu wabindwa pele mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">imizi yawo kuibalanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">lukumbusa lwawo lusika.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Mna Zumbe Chohile alongoza mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">kekala mwe ichigoda chakwe cho uzumbe vileke akantile.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Chohile awakantile awantu mwe isi viya vikwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">alamula awantu mwe isi kwa ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Zumbe Chohileni sumkilo dya wantu wakuzilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">ni nchinga itogile chipindi cha nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Wose wamanyize idizina dyako wakwikiya msuhi weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile huwasize mpwii wakukulonda.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile ntogozi akulongoza uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">tambalisani mgati mwa awantu we izisi ntuhu viya adamanye,<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile alihiza chikoda kwa wakomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">hakujeza kujala ndilo ya wadya wakuzilwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">niwonela mbazi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">Kaula ivyo walozize awankondo wangu wakunisulumiza! Nambula kulawa mwe file,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />vileke nidahe kutambalisa ntogozi zako mwe izinchili za wantu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">na uko nibwede wambulwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Wantu we izisi ntuhu wagwela mwe bome wasimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">iviga vyawo vigwizwa mwe lwavu wafisize.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Zumbe Chohile kamanyika kwa uwagila wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">wantu wavu wagwizwa ni ntendwa zawo wenye.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Wantu wavu nawahele kwedibome hedine uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">heye wantu wose mwe izisi awo wakumjala Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Mna wachiwa hawajalwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">hegu msuhi wa wadya wakuzilwa hawage kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Weye Zumbe Chohile inuka usekumleka mntu akubele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">wachisanye wantu we izisi ntuhu uwakantile kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Weye Zumbe Chohile watende wazingize kwa nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">wantu we izisi ntuhu wamanye kugamba wowo ni wantu du.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwachausa cha uwagila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, ni mbwani wachimaila hale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Ni mbwani wefisa chipindi cha nkunto?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Mo wefenyi wakwe mntu mwihi amsulumiza mntu mchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">mna mchiwa agwizwa mwe wihi udamanywe ni mntu mwavu.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Mwavu eduvila tama zihiye zo umoyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">amligita na kumlemela Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Mntu mwavu mo kweduvya kwakwe afanyanya hahana Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">mwe izifanyanyi zakwe Chohile hanitende niwajike, hakujali.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Sila za mwavu zachumilwa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">eduvya ne izisinkanto zako zihale naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">awaseka ko ubezi awankondo wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Egamba mwenye, “Hahana chikunga chinisingise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">mazuwa yose nanitende na mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">sanijeze kutenda na nkunto mpwii.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Milosi yakwe imema maligito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">udanti na kutisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">lulimi lwakwe lwalonga milosi ikwihiza.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Wefisa mwe izikaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">wakagoja wakome wantu hewene lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">watenda chani wanyatile wantu hewene lema,<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />anyatila saviya simba ikongola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">Akweta agwile mntu ahwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">agwila na kuwabuluza mwe lwavu lwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Wasokezi wahondwa na kugwiswa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">wantu wahwele wagwizwa ni mntu mwavu mta guvu.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Mntu mwavu elongela mwenye, “Chohile kajala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">afisa uso wakwe naho hakona chintu.”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Inuka weye Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">Inuka uwakantile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">Usekuwajala wantu wakubunyanywa.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Weye Chohile kwambwani mntu mwavu akubele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">Kwambwani alonge mwenye, “Hanikantile?”<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Mna weye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">wawawona wantu wata nkunto na chihovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">kuzumila kuwakantila kwa mkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">msokezi asumkila kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">weye wi wambizi ywa wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Tula izinguvu za mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">mkantile uwavu wakwe wose usekutendeka vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Zumbe Chohile ni seuta kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">wantu we izisi ntuhu hewemmanyize yeye nawosike wamlawe mweisi yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">wahokela lombezo dya msokezi wamjela moyo na kumtegela gutwi.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />Nowajeseze uwagilwa wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">na wakubunyanywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">vileke wantu awo wombigwe ko ulongo du wasekogofya vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s">Kwika msuhi kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Kwa Zumbe Chohile nasumkila kwegombela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">haluselo wadaha zeze kunigamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">“Puluka saviya kadege kolugulu,<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />kwaviya, wavu wahinda nyuta zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wahasika imifulo mwe ingole yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wakatenda wemwechiza vileke wawalase wachumi wa myoyo.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Uneva ivyegamo vibalangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">mta uwagila adaha kutenda mbwani?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Zumbe Chohile emndani mwe Inyumba yakwe ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Zumbe Chohile emwe ichigoda chakwe cho uzumbe kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Asinya wantu kwa meso yakwe na kumanya chila mbuli wakudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Zumbe Chohile awajeza wata uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">mna aweihiwa vitendese wakudamanya wavu na unyakwili.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Wantu wavu nawanyeseze fula ya nkala za moto ukwaka na kulibula chola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">impungile yakwe naitende niyo inkanto yawo.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ni mta uwagila, aunga ntendwa za uwagila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">wantu wachumi wa moyo nawekale hamwenga naye.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kunga wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Zumbe Chohile sunguza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">kwaviya wakumvikila Chohile wosika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">wakanuni wosika mwa awantu.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Chila yumwenga amgambila udanti mnyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">walonga kwa udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">na kwa myoyo ya finju.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">ichinde imilomo iyo ikulonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">ne izindimi zimemile kweduvya,<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />wakagamba, “Kwa milosi yetu chachumilwa mwe chila chintu chikunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">chidaha kwefenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">naho hahana akudaha kuchichinda.”<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Mna Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Kwachausa cha wachiwa wakubunyanywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">na wadya wakuzilwa, haluse neza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">naniwadime na kuwenka wambizi udya wakunga.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Milosi ya Zumbe Chohile ni yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">saviya chumbu chichiligwe mwe tanuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">heye, saviya chumbu chifuligwe nkanana mfungate.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Weye Zumbe Chohile chamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">chike mpeho na kuchidima mwe icheleko chino chihiye.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Kwaviya wantu wavu waita wakeduvya chila hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">mna yudya ehise nuyo akutunywa mwa awantu.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s">Lombeza dya kwambulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nonijale kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Togola nonijale mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Nonefisize uso wako kubula ini?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Nanitende na nkama mwe iloho kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Nanitende na chinyulu mo umoyo chila zuwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Wankondo wangu nawajendele kunihuda kubula ini?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Nikaula vileke unihitule weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Chohile ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Yajele ulangazi ameso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">chani nisekugona ntongo za file.<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Usekuwaleka wankondo wangu wagambe, “Yuno chimhuda.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Wadya wakunisulumiza wanase kwelelwa umo hagwa.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Mna miye naikiya msuhi ungi wako hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">moyo wangu welelwa mo uwambulwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Nanimchemele Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">kwaviya kutenda ywedi kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s">Wavu wa wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Wapambavu wagamba mwe myoyo yawo, “Hakuna Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Wose wabanikilwa, ntendwa zawo zihisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">hahana hata yumwenga akudamanya yedi.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Zumbe Chohile awakaula wantu kulawa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">awone hegu weyuko wata akili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">hegu kuna yoyose akumlonda Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Wose wabanikilwa, wawola wose hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">hahana akudamanya yedi, heye hata yumwenga.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Togola, awo wakudamanya wavu hawamanyize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Wawadya awantu wangu saviya mikate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">naho hawakunilombeza miye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Mna wakaheza aho, nawazingize kwa nkama ikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">kwaviya Zumbe ehamwenga na wakanuni.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Nyuwe mkudamanya yehiye mwabalanga mizungu ya wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">mna Zumbe Chohile ni sumkilo dyawo.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Nahabesa wambulwa wa Izulaeli wezile kulawa Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Hadya Zumbe Chohile nawavuze awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Welekwa wa Yakobo nawelelwe, Waizulaeli nawatende na chinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s">Chintu akunga Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Zumbe Chohile ni yuhi akudaha kwingila mwe Inyumba yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Ni yuhi akudaha kwikala mo ulugulu lwako lukukile?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Ni yudya akumtunya Chohile mwe chila mbuli na mazuwa yose adamanya mbuli zikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">akulonga chindedi kulawa mo umoyo wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />ni yudya mntu hekusezenga mnyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">hekumdamanyiza vihiye mbuyaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">na hekumzigiliza mnyawe,<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />ni yudya akumbela mntu ehise, mna awatunya wadya wakumogoha Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">ni yudya mntu akutunduliya icheliso chakwe hata hegu alumila.<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />Hekukopesha hela zakwe kwa chongezeko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">hegu kuhokela fumbaso kulawa kwe mntu hena lema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Mntu akudamanya izimbuli izo hasingisike mpwii.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwikala mpeho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile unidime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">kwaviya nasumkila ugombezi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Namgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Weye ni weye Zumbe Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">weye hwihali sina mbuli yoyose yedi.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Wakuka we muno mwe isi nawo wakuwagila vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">kwikala nawo nicho ichinyemi changu chikulise.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Mna wakuvikila milugu mituhu nawapate masulumizo yalozize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Ntambiko zawo za sakame sanizijuluze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">hegu kutaja amazina ye imilungu yawo.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Weye Zumbe Chohile kunikiya chila chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">naho kuninka viya hunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">mbuli zangu zose kuzichumiza.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Kunihimila muntu mtana vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">chindedi ulisi wangu wawagila.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Namtogola Zumbe Chohile akunilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">hata nechilo untu wangu wanihinya.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Namwika Zumbe kulongozi kwangu mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">Kwaviya entendele yo mkono wangu wa kulume, sanisingisike.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Elo, moyo wangu welelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">no lulimi lwangu lwamtoila luchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">iviya miye nanikale mpeho,<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />kwaviya honase kwedibome hedine uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">naho honileke miye mkuka ywako niwone ubanasi.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Kunilagisa sila yo ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">nonimemeze chinyemi mo wiyaho wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">hamwenga na mbwedo wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya mntu hene mlema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, iva ukweila kwangu ko uwagila wive indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">tegela gutwi idilombezo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">hadikulawa mwe milomo yo udanti. <verse eid="PSA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Nkato yangu na ilawe kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">kwaviya weye kumanya mbuli ikuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Weye kumanyanyisa umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">kunizila nechilo na kunizuza, kunijezesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">na huwone wavu mndani mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">kwaviya silongile chintu chochose hechikuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Mwe ntendwa zikudamanywa ni wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">miye sitimila amalagizo yako senega sila za wantu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Mazuwa yose sitimila isila yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">naho siteile mpwii.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Nakwitanga weye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">kwaviya wanihitula, unitegele idigutwi dyako wive idilombezo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Lagisa ntendwa zako nkulu zikwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">weye ukwambula kulawa kwa awankondo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">wadya wakusumkila kwegombela kwako.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Unidime saviya mboni ye idiziso dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">unifise hasi hechizuli cha amawawa yako,<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />kulawa mwe wavu wakunebunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">kulawa mwe wankondo wakomi wanitandame.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Awo hawana mbazi zozose mwe myoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">milomo yawo imema milosi ya kweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Wanitimila na kunizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">haluse wanitandama, waninyatila wanigwise hasi.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Wemalanya kale saviya simba chani wanitatavule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">wesaviya mwana simba akongola.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Inuka weye Zumbe Chohile, higana nawo uwagwise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">nambula mwa watu wavu kwa bamba dyako.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Weye Zumbe kwa mkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">unambule mgati mwa awantu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wakungisa vintu vya muno mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Wamemeze ugoli wakuubesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">uwo wakuwasiza awana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">na ukusigala wawasiza awezukulu wawo.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Kwaviya miye ni mkanuni naniwone uso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">henuka nanelelwe hawona uso wako.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo yo uhuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Nakunga weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:1">weye wi nguvu yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Zumbe Chohile ni luwe lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">nchinga yangu na wambulwa ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Chohile ni luwe, uyo kwakwe nasumkila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Uyo ni nchinga na mpembe yangu ya wambulwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">na nchinga yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Namwitanga Zumbe Chohile akuwagila ntogozi anambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">miye nanambule kulawa kwa awankondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Mabwehwelo yakwigala file yanimela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">nkulujumbu yo ukomi nainebunga,<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />sigi za file zinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">na mitego ya file nainigwila.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Mwe nkunto zangu simwitanga Zumbe Chohile, simwilila Chohile ywangu anambize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Kulawa mwe Inyumba yakwe keva idizwi dyangu dyo kulombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">ndilo yangu ibula mwa amagutwi yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Vikaheza isi niyo yazingiza na kusingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">vyegamo vya amagulu viyuganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">vizingiza kwaviya Chohile nendile kehiwa.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Mosi ulawa mwe izimpula zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">moto ukutikimya ulawa mo mlomo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">makala ya moto yalawa mwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Katula imbingu niyo asela hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">maingu matitu nendile ye hasi he iviga vyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Kakwela chumbe china mawawa chikwitangwa kelubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">kapuluka kulanga kwa mawawa ya nkung'unto.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Kezungulusiza chiza ntendele zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">maingu yazamile yamemile mazi yamzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Lumwemwe lumulika kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">niyo kwalawa maingu ya fula ya mayuwe na makala ya moto. <verse eid="PSA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Zumbe Chohile kabuma kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">izwi dya Uyo Mkulu Vitendese divika.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Kalasa imifulo yakwe na kuwatimulaganya awankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">heye, kawabalaza kwa lumwemwe lwa mbaula.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Mzumilizo we ibahali ugubulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">vyegamo vye isi niyo vyawoneka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">Kwachausa cha izwi dyako dya kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">kwa muye wa makala ya moto ukulawa mwe izimpula zako. <verse eid="PSA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Zumbe Chohile kachulusa umkono wakwe kulawa kulanga niyo aniguha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">kanitoza na kunivulula mwe mazi yalozize.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Kanambula kulawa mwa awankondo wangu wata nguvu zitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kanambula kwa wadya wakuniihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kulawa mwe wankondo wangu wata nguvu zitendese kujinka miye.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Awo wanebungaga umo nendile mwe nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">mna Zumbe Chohile endaga wambizi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Kanileta na kunika hantu hatondowale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">niyo anambula kwaviya kawagilwa ni miye.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Zumbe Chohile kanidamanyiza vikuligana no uchumi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">kaninka jeleko kwaviya mikono yangu haina lema.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Kwaviya sitimila izisila za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">sidamanye wavu hamleka Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Sitoza amalagizo yakwe yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">silekile kutimila imiko yakwe yose.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Sitendile na mlema kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">miye sedima nisekukola masa.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Zumbe Chohile kaniliha kuligana no uchumi wangu, uyo kamanya kugamba mikono yangu haikoile masa.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wimkanuni welagisa kwa wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">kwa hene lema welagisa huna lema.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Kwa wadya wachumile welagisa kuchuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">mna kwa yudya mwavu weye watenda unyakwili.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Weye wawambula wakunyanyahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">mna wawaseleza wakweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wanilangaziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">wabalaza chiza kulongozi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Kwa wambizi wako nahuda fyoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">weye Chohile waninka nguvu za kuhuda mpingamizi.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Yuno Chohile ntendwa zakwe zichuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile uchuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">uyo ni nchinga kwa wose wakusumkila kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Kwaviya ni Chohile yuhi ukaleka Zumbe Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Ni luwe luhi lwa kusumkila kwegombela ukaleka Chohile ywetu?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Zumbe Chohile nuyo akuninka nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">nuyo akudima isila yangu. <verse eid="PSA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Viga vyangu kavitogeza saviya viga vya kapala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">anidahiza kuchimala ko lunenengwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Ahinya imikono yangu kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">imikono yangu yadaha kuhinda uta wa shaba.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Kuninka nchinga yako ya kwedima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">mkono wako wa kulume wanegamiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">ukunyanyahala kwako kunitenda nitende mkulu. <verse eid="PSA 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Kwangamula isila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">vileke viga vyangu visekutela.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Siwagwa mnyuma awankondo wangu niyo nawabwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">siwiye kunyuma kubula siwakomwa.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Siwatowa niyo wagwa hasi vyaleka wadunduga kwinuka vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">wagwa hasi he iviga vyangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Kuninka nguvu za kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">kuwatenda awankondo wangu wafike madi he iviga vyangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Kuwatenda awankondo wangu wahituke na kusumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">wadya wose wanihiwe siwakoma.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Waguta lukunga walombeze wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">mna hahendaga na mndosa ywa kuwambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">wamwilila Zumbe mna hawalandule.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Siwahonda niyo watenda saviya lumbi dikufiliswa ni mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">siwajatangila saviya ntagata mwesila.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Kunambula kulawana na kwebungwa ni wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">kunitenda chilongozi ywa wantu wa si ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">wantu samanyaga wanisankanila.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Ahadya weze weve uhuda wangu niyo wazitimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">wajeni wayanyahala kulongozi kwangu,<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />wajeni wose watigintika, wafosa wasa izingome zawo wakazingiza.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Zumbe Chohile ni mjima! Atogolwe Luwe lwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">Atogolwe Chohile Mwambula ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Uyo nuyo Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">awanyanyahaza wantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">hasi hangu. <verse eid="PSA 18:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />Kanambula kulawa kwa awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">kaninka uhuda mwa awo wakunihiga, kanambula kulawa mwe wantu manyakwili.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Elo, nahutogole mwa awantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">weye Zumbe Chohile nanidichemele ntogozi idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Chohile amwinka seuta ywakwe uhuda mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">alagisa mbazi kwa uyo asagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">amlagisa mbazi Daudi na awelekwa wakwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Chohile mo kuumba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Imbingu yatambalisa ukulu wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:1">ulanga wabunkula ndima ye imikono yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Msi waugambila mbuli msi ukutimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">chilo chagambila chilo chikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Hahana ulongi hegu milosi yakujeseza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">naho hahana izwi dikwivika,<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />mna izwi dyawo dizagala mwe isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">milosi yawo yenela kubula uhelo we isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Chohile kaika wikazi wa zuwa ko ulanga,<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />idyo dyasomwela saviya msozi akufosa kwe ichumba chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">dyelelwa saviya mkankalu dyelelwa kutimila isila yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Dyasomwela ntendele imwenga ye imbingu na mzunguluko wakwe kubula ntendele ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">hahana chikudaha kwenega ifukuto yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Sigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile ichinta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">yamwinka mntu ujima mhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">imiko ya Zumbe Chohile ichuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">yamwinka ubala mntu mhezi.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Malagizo ya Zumbe Chohile yawagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">ayo yabwedeza moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">imiko ya Zumbe Chohile yalangaza, yadahiza meso kuwona.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Kumogoha Zumbe ni mbuli yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">uko kwekala mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Imiko ya Zumbe Chohile ni ya chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">naho yose yawagila vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Ina yombe kulu kujinka zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kujinka zahabu ntana vitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">Ina mwile kujinka uchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kujinka uchi kulawa mwe chivuna.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Izo yanihinya miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">ukazitimila wenkigwa jeleko kulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Ni yuhi akudaha kubunkula ubanasi wakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">Weye Zumbe Chohile, nilekeila wavu wangu siumanyize.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Nidima miye mndima ywako na masa ya kasidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">ayo yasekunilongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">Aho nanitende sichuma, Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">sina mlema hegu ubanasi mkulu. <verse eid="PSA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Milosi yo umlomo wangu ne izifanyanyi zo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">vipate kuzumilwa kulongozi kwako, weye Zumbe Chohile, Weye Zumbe Chohile, luwe lwangu na mwambula ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza uhuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Zumbe Chohile akuhitula umo ukatenda mwe nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:1">zina dya Chohile ywa Yakobo ditende nchinga yako.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Akutumile wambizi kulawa mwe Inyumba yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">akwambize kulawa kolugulu lwa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Akumbuke amalavyo yako yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">azumile ntambiko zako zose zo kutikimya.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Akwinke viya ukunga mo umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">achumize imizungu yako yose.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Nachitowe nchelegele kwa mbwedo kwachausa cho uhuda wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">nachinule bendela zetu kwa zina dya Chohile ywetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">Zumbe Chohile nakwinke viya vyose ukunga.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Haluse simanya kugamba Zumbe Chohile namwambize seuta asagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">namhitule kulawa hakukile hakwe kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">kwa mkono wakwe wa kulume namwinke uhuda mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Watuhu weduvila malingisha ya nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">watuhu falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">mna suwe cheduvila zina dya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Awo nawekobadike na kugwa hasi, mna suwe chenuka na kuchima chigunge.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, mwinke uhuda seuta! Umo chikakwitanga chihitule.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa chausa cha kupata uhuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, seuta abweda izinguvu zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">Abwedesa kwa uhuda ukumwinka.<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Kumwinka viya akunga mo umoyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">naho huchindile idilombezo dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Kumgoneka na kumjimbika kwa ujimbiko mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">na kumvisa chilemba cha zahabu ntana mo mtwi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Nakakulombeza ujima weye niyo wamwinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">kumwinka ujima mtali hewine udumo.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Kwa wambizi wako umwinkile katenda mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">kwaviya kumwinka kutogolwa na ntunyo.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Wamwinka ujimbiko wako mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">wambwedeza kwa uwiyaho wako.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Kwaviya seuta kaika msuhi wakwe kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">kwa ungi mkulu wa Zumbe Chohile natende mpeho.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Mkono wako nauwagwile awankondo wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">mkono wako wa kulume naumgwile wose wakukwihiwa.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Umo ukeza nowakome saviya tanuli dya moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">Zumbe Chohile nawabinde kwa amaya yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Nowakome awelekwa wawo kulawa mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">lweleko lwawo halusigale mwa awantu we isi.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Hata hegu nawakwekambile yehiye na kutunga mizungu ihiye, hawadahe kuchumilwa mpwii.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Kwaviya weye nowataile mifulo kulawa mo uta wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">nowatimulaganye kwa nguluko.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Weye Zumbe Chohile utunywe kwachausa che izinguvu zako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">Nachicheme na kutogola izinguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo yo usungu na nchemo ya ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Chohile ywangu, Chohile ywangu, ni mbwani kunasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Ni mbwani wi hale na miye chani udahe kunambiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Wihale na indilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Weye Chohile ywangu, naila nomsi mna hukunihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">nechilo naguta mna sikupata luhulwila.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Hataivyo weye wi Mkuka ukwikala mwe ichigoda cho Uzumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">ukulongoza na kutogolwa ni wantu wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Wadalahala wetu waikaga msuhi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">weye niyo wawambula.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Wakwilila weye niyo wawambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">waika msuhi kwako niyo hawengile soni.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Mna miye sina yombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">sihufywa na kubelwa ni wantu.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Wose wakuniwona wanitila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">wanijela mishu na kusingisa imitwi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Wagamba, “Nakamwikiya msuhi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">elo hegu Zumbe Chohile amuwagila namwambule.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">Uneva Zumbe Chohile amuwagila namwambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">elo namwambule.<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Mna ni weye unilavize mwe inda ya mame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">kunika mpeho umo nichei katiti honka amatombo ya mame.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Sikwikiya msuhi weye kukongela ukwelekwa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">kukongela kwe inda ya mame kutenda Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Usekutenda hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">kwaviya nkunto ihaguhi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">naho hahana ywa kunambiza.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Wankondo walozize wanizunguluka saviya njeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">wanitandama saviya njeku nkali za Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Saviya simba zikubuma zikatatavula maingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">zigubula imilomo yawo chani zinebunge miye.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Sijuluzwa saviya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">mavuha yangu yose yafosa mwe ivitago vyakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">Moyo wangu uhituka utenda nta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">ulujuka mndani mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Nguvu zangu zinyala saviya zae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">lulimi lwangu lutozana no ujeje lo umlomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">kwaviya kunasa mwe lumbi dya file.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Sizungulukwa ni bunga dya makuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">bunga dya wehi dinitandama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">wanigwila imikono ne iviga.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Sisigala mavuha ayodu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">wankondo wangu wanisinya na kuntila.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Wasangilana izisuche zangu wenye kwa wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">na kutoila tegatega inkazu yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Mna weye, weye Zumbe Chohile usekwikala hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">weye wi nguvu zangu sunguza wize unambize.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Honya uwikazi wangu kulawana na bamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">ambula uwikazi wangu mwa amakombe ya amakuli ayo.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Nambula kulawa mwe mlomo wa simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">nambula kulawa mwe mahembe ye izimbogo izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">kuhitula idilombezo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Naniwatamwile walukolo wangu izintendwa zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">nahutogole weye mwe imidugano yawo.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile nyuwe nyose mkumvikila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Nyuwe welekwa wose wa Yakobo mtunyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mvikileni Chohile nyuwe welekwa wose wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Kwaviya uyo hahufise hegu kubela masulumizo ya akuzilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">naho hakwefisa uso wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">mna amwetegeleza indilo yakwe vileke amwambize.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Kwachausa chako nahutunye mwe midugano mikulu ya wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">nanichintize nazili zangu kulongozi kwa wadya wakukuvikila weye.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Wachiwa nawadye na kwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">wadya wakumlonda Zumbe Chohile nawamtogole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">Chohile awenkeni ujima mwikale mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Uhelo wose we isi naukumbuke na kumhitukila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">na amakabila yose mwe izinkolo zose za awantu we izisi ntuhu nawamwetegeleze.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Kwaviye Zumbe Chohile ni seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">uyo alongoza mwe izisi.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Wata ugoli wose mwe isi nawafike madi kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">wose wakubanika nawafike madi kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">hamwenga na wadya hewekudaha kutunduliya ujima wawo.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Cheleko nachimsankanile uyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">vyeleko navigambilwe izimbuli atendile Zumbe Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />nawatambalise ntendwa zakwe za wambula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">Wantu hewenati nawagambilwe ntendwa zakwe za wambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nuyo adamanye ivyo.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe nuyo umdimi ywangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Zumbe Chohile nuyo mdimi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">elo, sanihungukilwe ni chintu.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Anigoneza mwe luwala lwa mani maisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">anilongoza hampezo he mazi yalenguke,<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />naho anivuziza nguvu uhya untu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">Anilongoza mwe izisila zikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">kwachausa che idizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Hata hegu hajinka mwe kolongo dina ziza dya file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">sanogohe mabuli yakutisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile wihajihi na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">ngoda yako ne inkome yako vyanidima.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Kumalanya nkantamiti kulongozi kwa wankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kunihaka mavuta komtwi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">chikombe changu kuchimemeza chetika.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Chindedi wedi wako na mbazi zako navitende hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">na miye mazuwa yose yo ujima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">nami nanikale mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Isi ne ivintu viyumo mndani ni vyakwe Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">si na wose wakwikala mndani mwakwe ni ugoli wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Kwaviya kaika ivyegamo vyakwe mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">iyo aidindimaza mlanga mwe mito ya mazi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Ni yuhi akudaha kulukwela ulugulu lwa Zumbe Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Ni yuhi akudaha kuchimala ahantu hakwe hakukile?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Ni yudya mta ntendwa zedi na moyo wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">ni yudya hekuhingiza umoyo wakwe mwe uhezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">hegu kwelisa kwa udanti.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Uyo nahokele ujimbiko kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">na nkanto ikuwagila kulawa kwa Chohile mwambula.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Awo nawo icheleko cha wantu wakumlonda Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">wakwiza ko uwiyaho wako, Weye Chohile ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Inulani imitwi yenyu, nyuwe nyivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">vugukani nyuwe nyivi za chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">chani Seuta akukile engile.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Uyo Seuta akukile ni yuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Ni Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">ni Zumbe Chohile mkankalu ywa nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Vugukani nyuwe nyivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">vugukani nyuwe nyivi za chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">chani Seuta akukile engile.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Ni yuhi uyo Seuta akukile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Ni Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">uyo nuyo Seuta akukile.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza ulongozi na wamizi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Kwako weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:1">naonyekeza untu wangu,<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />ni weye hwikiya msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">Weye Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">usekunileka ningile soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">naho usekuleka wankondo wangu welelwe umo wakanihuda.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Usekumleka hata yumwe akwika msuhi kwako engile soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">mna nawajelwe soni wadya wakukulemela kasidi.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Nilagisa izisila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">nihinya nidamanye viya ukunga.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Nilongoza mwe ichindedi chako na kunihinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">kwaviya weye wi Chohile Mwamula ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">msuhi wangu wi kwako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Kumbuka mbazi zilozize na ungi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">kwaviya vyendaga kukongela chikale.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Usekukumbuka masa yo ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">hegu sila zangu za wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">nikumbuka kuligana no ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile wi ywedi.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Zumbe Chohile ni ywedi naho kachuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">elo, awahinya wata masa izisila zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Awalongoza wakunyanyaha mwe uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">uyo awahinya awo izisila zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Sila zose za Zumbe Chohile ni za ungi no ukanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">kwa wadya wakutoza indagano na amalagizo yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, kwachausa che idizina dyako, unilekeile amasa yangu, kwaviya ikulisa.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Chila mntu akumvikila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Zumbe Chohile namhinye isila yo kujinkila.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Mntu uyo nachumilwe mo wikazi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">na awelekwa wakwe nawalisi isi.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Zumbe Chohile awalongoza wadya wakumogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">uyo awagambila yadya yakungwa mwe idilagano dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Meso yangu yamkaula Zumbe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">uyo ichedu nuyo navyambule iviga vyangu mwe mtego.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Nihitukila weye Chohile, uniwonele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">kwaviya miye nichedu naho nabunyanywa.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Nusiza kwangadika mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">nambula kulawa mwe izinkunto zangu.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Ukaule amasulumizo yangu ne izinkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">na unilekeile amasa yangu yose.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Kaula awankondo wangu ivyo walozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">naho kaula ivyo wakunihiwa waunga wanilumize.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Dima uwikazi wangu na kunambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">usekunileka ningile soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">kwaviya sisumkila ugombezi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Wedi no ukanuni vinidime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">kwaviya msuhi wangu wi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Weye Chohile wambule awantu wako wa Izulaeli kulawa mwe izinkunto zawo zose.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mntu ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile nigombela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">kwaviya nadamanya yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">naho sikwikiya msuhi weye hehena kudegadega.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Weye Zumbe nijeza na kunihima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">uzuze umoyo wangu ne izifanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Kwaviya ungi wako wi kulongozi kwangu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">nami nekala kulawana no ukanuni wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Sikwikala hamwenga na wantu wakulonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">naho sikutimilizana na wantu wakusezenga.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Nehiwa mabunga ya wantu wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">naho nalemela kwikala hamwenga na wavu.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Elo, nasunta imikono yangu kulagisa kugamba sina mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">na kusogela hajihi ne imazabahu yako, weye Zumbe Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />chani nitambalise kukuhongeza kwa izwi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">na kutamwila ntendwa zako zose zikwehela.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nayungisa inyumba yako hantu ukwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">hantu hakwikala ukuka wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Usekunikoma hamwenga na wantu wata masa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">naho usekunidula hamwenga na wakomi,<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />wantu awo ntendwa zawo ni wavu mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">wantu wamemile kufumbaswa.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Mna miye nekala wikazi hewine mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">niwonela mbazi naho unambule.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Miye sichimala hantu hakulumbale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">nahutogole Zumbe Chohile mwe bunga dikulise.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya Ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Zumbe Chohile ni ulangazi wangu na wambulwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">nimogohe yuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Zumbe Chohile ni nchinga yo ujima wangu sanogohe mntu yoyose. <verse eid="PSA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Wehi wananebunga na kujeza kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">awo awahigani na wankondo wangu nawekobadike na kugwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Hatahegu bunga dya wagomba nkondo dinanebunga ntendele zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">moyo wangu hawogohe chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">hata nkondo ikanilaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">aho hose nichei na msuhi kwa Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Mbuli imwenga humlombeza Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nayo niyo hulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nidahe kwikala mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile mazuwa yose yo ujima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">niwone utana wakwe Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na kumlonda mwe Inyumba yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Mwe zuwa dya nkunto nanifise mo wikazi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">nanifise mwe idihema dyakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">nanike mpeho mlanga mwe luwe.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Elo, kwa uhuda naniwahude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">awankondo wangu wanizunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">mo wikazi wakwe nanilavye ntambiko kwa nchelejele za mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nanimchemele na kumtogola Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Unive, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">umo hakwilila niwonela mbazi na kunihitula.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Umoyo wangu wanigamba, “Soo umlonde Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Elo, neza kwako weye Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Usekunifisiza uso wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Usekunilemela kwa maya miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">weye kutenda wambizi wangu mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Usekunidula hegu kunasa weye Chohile Mwambula ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Hatahegu welesi wangu wakanidula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">Zumbe Chohile nanihokele.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Nihinya isila yako, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">unilongoze mwe sila ichumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">kwachausa cha wankondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Usekunileka wankondo wanitende viya wakunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">kwaviya waukuzi wo udanti waninukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">walonga mbuli za udanti waunga wanilumize.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Miye nichei na uno umsuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">naniuwone wedi wa Zumbe Chohile mwe isi ya wata ujima.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Mwikiye msuhi Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Udindimale, moyo wako utoge!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Heye mwikiye msuhi Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s">Lombeza dya wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Nakwitanga weye Zumbe Chohile weye luwe lwa ugombezi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">usekutenda saviya hukuniva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">hegu sivyo huna nambize</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">nanitende mwa wadya waseile kale kwedibome dya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Tegeleza indilo yangu unifile mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">hakwitanga kwachausa cha kunga wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">henula mikono yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">kuhinga hantu hako he Inyumba Ikukile.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Usekunikantila hamwenga na wantu wehi wakutenda wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">wantu wakulonga na weyawe mbuli za utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">mna mwe myoyo yawe wamema wihi.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Wakantile kuligana ne izintendwa zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">kuligana na ntendwa zawo zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">walihe kuligana ne izitendwa ze imikono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">walihe viya vikuwawagila.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Kwaviya hawakutunya izindima za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">hawakukombaganya mbuli atendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">elo, kwachausa icho nawakome mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">kwaviya keva lombezo dyangu dya kunga wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Zumbe Chohile aninka nguvu na kunidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">namwikiya msuhi wo umoyo wangu wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Kanambula moyo wangu umema mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">nanimhongeze kwa nchemo ya chinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Zumbe Chohile awenka nguvu awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">uyo amdima na kumwambula seuta ywakwe asagule.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wambule awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">wajimbike wano awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">tenda mdimi ywawo na kuwegamiza mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s">Izwi dya Chohile dyaluluma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Mtogololeni Zumbe Chohile nyuwe vyumbe vya kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">tunyani ukulu wakwe ne izinguvu.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Ditogoleni idizina dya Zumbe Chohile dikulisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">Mvikileni Zumbe Chohile mwa ahantu hakwe hakukile.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dyevika mlanga mwe mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Chohile mng'azi alulumiza mbaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dyevika mlanga mwe mazi yalozize.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dina nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dimema ung'azi.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dyatula miti ya myelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">Zumbe Chohile atula vihanehande imiti ikwitangwa myelezi ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Apilisa amagulu ya Lebanoni saviya ndama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">naho atenda ulugulu lwa Helimoni lupilike saviya mwana mbogo.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dyalavya lumwemwe.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dyasingisa jangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">Zumbe Chohile asingisa Jangwa dya Kadeshi. <verse eid="PSA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Izwi dya Zumbe Chohile dyasingisa miti ya mivule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">dyahanyula mani ye miti kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">mwe Inyumba yakwe wose wagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">“Ung'azi kwa Zumbe!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Zumbe Chohile alongoza mlanga mwe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">Zumbe Chohile alongoza saviya seuta mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Zumbe Chohile awenka nguvu awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">Zumbe Chohile awajimbika wantu wakwe kwa kuwenka utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kumhongeza Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nakuhongeza kwaviya kunambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">huwalekile awankondo wangu wedvye.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">nasikwitanga unambize, weye niyo wanihonya. <verse eid="PSA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Weye Zumbe Chohile kunambula kulawa mwe mbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kuninka ujima vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kunilavya mwa wadya wakwita kwedibome hedine uhelo.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Mchemeleni ntogozi Zumbe Chohile nyuwe wakanuni wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">kumbukani ukuka wakwe na kumhongeza.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Kwaviya maya yakwe hayakwikalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">mna ungi wakwe wekalisa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">vyadahika kucheleze ndilo chilo pwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">mna mtondo kwatenda na mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Nize nichumilwe niyo nagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">“Sanihudye mpwii”<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wize unidamanyize wedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">kunidindimaza saviya lugulu lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">mna wize wefise hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">niyo nafa chevu.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Sikwitanga weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">heye sikulombeza weye Chohile ywangu unambize.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />“Togola, nopate chibwani umo miye habanika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Nopate chibwani umo nnasela kwedibome dya awantu wabanike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Togola, malumbi nayakutogole?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Togola, nayatambalise ichindedi chako?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Weye Zumbe Chohle unive na kuniwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Weye Zumbe Chohile tenda mwambizi ywangu.”<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Kuhituila kulomboleza kwangu kutenda kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">kunusiza chinyulu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">niyo wanivika mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Elo, miye nahutogole saninyamale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">Chohile ywangu nahutogole mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nasumkila ugombezi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">usekunileka ningile soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">mo ukanuni wako unambule.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Nitegela gutwi dyako, sunguza wize unambule!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">Utende luwe lwa wambizi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">nchinga itogile ya kunambula.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Weye wi luwe lwangu na nchinga yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">nilongoza na kunidima kwachausa che idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Nihonya ne imitego wanitegele chinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">kwaviye ni weye sumkilo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Iloho yangu naika mwemikono yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">weye Zumbe Chohile unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile mkanuni.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Nawehiwa wakuvikila matukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">miye namwikiya msuhi Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Nanitowe nchelejele na kwelelwe kwa ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwaviya weye wawona nkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">ulumi mo umoyo wangu kuumanya.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Weye huninkize mwe imikono ya awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">mna kunichimalisa hantu hatondowale.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile niwonela mbazi, kwaviya nimwe nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">ameso yangu yahwa kwa kwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">nguvu zinisila mo mwili na mwe loho kwa tumbwaziko.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Ujima wangu usokela kwa mesozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">heye, mihilimo yangu kwa kwila kwa ulumi utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">nguvu zangu zasila kwachausa cha masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">hata amavuha yangu yanyuluka.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Sibelwa ni wankondo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">vitendese wadya wehajihi hangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">Wambuya zangu wanehelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">wakaniwona mwe sila wanisumka.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Sijalwa saviya mntu abanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">sitenda saviya nyungu itulike.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Siva wantu watakalisana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">wanitisa chila ntendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">woga wanizila chila nkanana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">waika myalo wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Mna miye msuhi wangu nawika mwako weye Zumbe Chohile uyodu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">nagamba, “Weye wi Chohile ywangu.”<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Wikazi wangu wi mwemikono yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">unambule mwemikono ya wankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">na awo wakunisulumiza.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Nikaula kwa wedi miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">nambula kwa mbazi zako.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Usekunileka ningile soni, Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">kwaviya nakulombeza weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">mna wehi wajelwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">na kwagila kwedibome hedine uhelo wanyamale dwii.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Nyamaza imilomo ya awantu wakulonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">wakulonga kwa wefyenyi mwa wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">kwaviya weduvya ko ubezi.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Kaula ivyo wili mkulu uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">kuwekiya mpamba wadya wakukuvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">wakusumkila ugombezi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">wawenka yedi wantu wose wakasinya.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Weye wawafisa hantu hatondowale aho wili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">hale na mizungu ihiye ya wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">wawaika mpeho mwe wamizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">hale na uhigani wa awankondo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">kwaviya kanilagisa ungi wakwe ukwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">umo nendile sitandamwa ni wankondo.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Miye nasogoha na kufanyanya kugamba kunidula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">kumbe kwiva indilo yangu umo hakwitanga unambize.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Mungeni Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe wakuka wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Zumbe Chohile awadima wantu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">mna awakantila vikuwagila wakweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Mtende wakankalu na kudindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">nyuwe nyose mkumwikiya msuhi Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s">Kweila na kusizwa masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Mbwedo wakwe mntu yudya alekeilwe masa yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">mntu yudya amasa yakwe yauswa.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Mbwedo mwa yudya mntu Zumbe Chohile hakumwaziza masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">naho mntu hena mlema mo umoyo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Umo nesinati kutambalisa amasa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">nasibuntika kwa kwilwa msi mjima.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Msi na chilo kunikantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">sifyoswa izinguvu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">saviya mnyuzu mwe fukuto.<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Haheza niyo nalavyanya amasa yangu kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">naho sifisize wihi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Sigamba, nanilavyenye uwavu wangu kwa weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">aho weye niyo wanilekeila amasa yangu yose.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Elo, chila mntu mkanuni akulombeze weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">kwaviya wapatikana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">chindedi nkulujumbu ya mazi ikeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">haimbwile umntu uyo.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Ni weye nchinga yangu ya kwefisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">weye wanidima mwe nkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">na kunizungulusiza nchemo zo uhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">kwachausa cha wambulwa.<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Nahuhinye na kukulagisa sila nohinge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">Nahulangilize na kukutunduliya.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Usekutenda hezi saviya falasi hegu nyumbu hezine akili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">izo zaungwa zitalizwe nila na nkamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">hegu sivyo hazikusogeile.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Mntu mwavu ana nkunto zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">mna ungi wa Zumbe Chohile hewine udumo wamzunguluka akumwikiya msuhi.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Bwedani na kwelelwa kwa ivyo Zumbe Chohile adamanye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">Chemani nyuwe nyose wachumi wa myoyo.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya Ntogozi kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Towani nchelejele kwachausa cha Zumbe Chohile nyuwe mkumogoha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">Kwaviya awagila kumtogola ni wadya wachumile moyo.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile kwa malimba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">na zeze dina nyaya mlongo.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Mchemeleni nchemo mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">towani visindamgunda malimba vinamwile, towani nchelejele za mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile ni wachindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">ne izintendwa zakwe zose nizo ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Zumbe Chohile aunga uchindedi na uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">isi imema ungi wakwe hewine udumo.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Ulanga umbwa kwa ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">ne ivintu vyose viyumo vilawana no umuye wo umlomo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Kachisanya mazi ye ibahali saviya mwe nyungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">mizumilizo ye ibahali kavika mwe msungi.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Isi yose wamogohe Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">Wekazi wose mweisi wamtunye!<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Kwaviya Chohile alongaga isi niyo yatendeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">kalavya lagizo niyo yadindimala.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Zumbe Chohile achinda mizungu ya wantu we izisi ntuhu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">na kuhituila fanyanyi zawo.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Mna mizungu ya Zumbe Chohile yekala mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">viya akunga vyekala vyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Mbwedo ni kwe isi idya Chohile ywawo ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">wantu awo asagule watende ulisi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Zumbe Chohile akaula hasi kulawa kwe imbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">na kuwawona awantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Kulawa kwe ichigoda chakwe cho ukuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">awakauka awekazi wakwikala mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Uyo adamanya imyoyo ya wantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">uyo akaula chila chintu wakutenda.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Seuta hakudaha kwambulwa kwa ukulu wa bunga dya awagomba kondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">hegu mkankalu hakuhuda kwa nguvu zakwe zitendese.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Falasi ya nkondo haikuwagila chintu mwe kupata uhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">nguvu zakwe zitendendese hazikudaha kumwambula mntu.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Zumbe Chohile akaula wadya wakumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">wadya wekiye msuhi wawo mwe ungi wakwe hewine udumo.<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />Uyo awambula mwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">awasigaza wajima mwe chipindi cha gumbo.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Suwe chamgoja Zumbe Chohile kwa msuhi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">Uyo ni wambizi wetu na nchinga yetu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Heye chelelwa kwachausa chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">china msuhi mwe idizina dyakwe dikukile.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Ungi wako hewine udumo wikale mwetu, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">kwaviya msuhi wetu chiwika kwako.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa wedi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Nanimhongeze Zumbe Chohile mihililimo yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:1">sanileke mpwii kuzilonga izintogozi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Miye nefenya viya Zumbe Chohile atendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">wasokezi weve na kwelelwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Miye hamwenga na nyuwe chimtogoleni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">chimwinke ntunyo chahamwenga idizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Nasimlombeza Zumbe Chohile, niyo anihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">na kunusiza izinkama zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Wadya wakumkaula Chohile nawelelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">nanywi hamjelwe soni mpwii.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Yuno mchiwa kamwilila Zumbe Chohile, uyo kamwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">na kumwambula mwe izinkunto zakwe zose.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile awadima wose wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">na kuwambula mwe nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Jezani muwone kugamba Zumbe Chohile ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">mbwedo wi kwa yudya mntu akusumkila ugombezi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Mvikileni Zumbe Chohile nyuwe wakuka wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">kwaviya wadya wakumvikila hawahungukilwe ni chintu chochose.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Hata wana simba wahungukilwa na kuwona sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">mna wadya wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile hawakuswesa chochose chedi.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Soni nyuwe wana mnitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">miye naniwahinyeni kumvikila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Togola, waunga mbwedo mo wikazi wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">Togolani maunga mwelelwe na wikazi mtali?<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Elo, leka kulonga yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">na kulonga udanti.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Kwenege wavu, damanya yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">londa utondowazi na kuutozesa.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Zumbe Chohile awakaula wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">etegeleza viya wakulombeza,<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />mna awahiga wantu wakudamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">ivyo, wanabanika wasunguza kujalwa mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Wakanuni wakamwilila Zumbe Chohile, uyo aweva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">na kuwambula mwe izinkunto zawo zose.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Zumbe Chohile ehajihi na wafile chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">awambula wazize lunda vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Masulumizo ya mkanuni yaloza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">mna Zumbe Chohile amwambula mwe yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Adima ivitago vyo umwili wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">hahana hata vuha dyakwe dimwenga nadivunike.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Wihi wawegaila wavu file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">wankondo wa wakanuni nawakantilwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Zumbe Chohile ambula wandima wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">wadya wose wakusumkila ugombezi kwakwe hawakantilwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, wahige wadya wakunihiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">towana na wadya wakutowana na miye.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Guha ingao yako ne inchinga yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">wize unambize.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Inula idiguha dyako ne isime yako mwa awo wakunitimila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">Ugambile untu wangu kugamba nonambule.<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Wahayuse na kuwajele soni wadya wakulonda ujima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wadya wakulafya kunikoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wavuzwe kunyuma kwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Watende saviya makanka yakufiliswa ni nkung'unto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">kuno wabalazwa ni mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Sila yawo itende chiza na utelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">wakabalazwa ni mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Siwadamanye dyodyose nawanitegela mitego hehena luhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">wanisimbila bome hehena mbuli yoyose.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Wasunguze kugwelwa ni mabuli wowo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">wagwizwe mwe mtego wawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">wagwele mwe idyo idibome kwa file yawo.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Aho miye nanelelwe kwachausa cha Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">nantowe nchelejele kwaviya uyo kanambula.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Nanimgambe Zumbe Chohile kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">“Weye Zumbe Chohile hahana akwinga weye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Weye wawambula wasokezi kulawa mwe mikono ya wata nguvu kujinka wowo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">mchiwa na hene chintu kulawa mwe wadya wakuwahoka.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Wantu wavu waninukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">waniziga mbuli sizimanyize.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Waniliha wihi kwa wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">na kuwasa untu wangu mwe chiholozi.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Mna umo wendile wanyonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">navalaga majuniya kulagisa chihovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">sesulumiza kwa kuleka nkande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">Senamiza umtwi wangu hasi umo havika,<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />saviya namwilila mbuyangu hegu mlukolo ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">sikwela hasela uko na uko kwa chihovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">saviya akulomboleza file ya nine.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Mna miye nize nekobadike, wechisanya wanisezenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">wanebunga chahamwenga miye simanyize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">Wanebunga hehena udumo.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Saviya wantu hewekumvikila Chohile wanitila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">wanilumila memo kwa maya.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Weye Zumbe Chohile nokaule kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Nambula uwikazi wangu no kunebunga kwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">nambula ujima wangu kulawa mwe izisimba izo!.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Aho miye nahutunye kulongozi kwe mdugano mkulu wa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">nahutogole kulongozi kwa wantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Usekuwaleka awankondo awo wakunitila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">awo wakunihiwa vya bule welelwe kwa masulumizo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Milosi wakulonga siyo yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">watula mabuli yo udanti mwa awekazi wakwikala mwe isi kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Wanilaha kwa izwi wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">“Heye chiviwona kwa meso yetu wenye ivyo udamanye!”<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Mna weye Zumbe Chohile vino kuviwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">usekunyamala, weye Zumbe Chohile usekutenda hale na miye.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Weye Zumbe Chohile inuka unigombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">wize weye Zumbe Chohile ywangu ukaule imbuli yangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Weye Zumbe Chohile nikantila viya vikukuwagila, kuligana no uwagilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">usekuwaleka wanisezenge.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Usekuwaleka wafanyanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">“Chichumilwa mwe viya chungile!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">“Yuno chimdaha.”<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Wajelwe soni na kwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wose wakwelelwa izinkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wahayuswe na kuhuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Wose wakwewona ni wedi kujinka miye.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Mna wadya wakuniwona sina mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">watule lwasu kwa chinyemi mazuwa yose wagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">“Zumbe Chohile kakulisa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">Awagizwa ni kuchumilwa kwa mndima nywakwe.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Aho miye nanitambalise ukanuni wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">nanilonge ntongozi zako msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s">Wavu wa wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Masa yalonga na mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">kundani vitendese mo umoyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">mbuli ya kumvikila Chohile haimuli mo umomoyo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Kwaviya mwavu etogolesa mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">afanyanya kugamba wavu wakwe haubunkulwe na kuligitwa.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Milosi ye imilomo yakwe ni wavu naho yo udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">kaleka kujeseza ubala na kudamanye yedi.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Afanyanya kudamanya wihi, hata akatenda mo lusazi lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">ejela mwe sila ya masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">hakulemela dihiye.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wedi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Weye Zumbe Chohile ungi wako wabula kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">ukanuni wako wabula ko ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Uwagilwa wako ni saviya magulu makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">nkanto zako ni saviya mzumilizo mtali vitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">Weye Zumbe Chohile wawadima wantu na wanyama.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Ungi wako hewine udumo ni wa yombe kulu vitendese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">Wantu wasumkila hechizuli cha amawawa yako.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Webwedeza mwe ulozo we ivintu vya mnyumba mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">weye nowanywese mo umto wo uwedi wako.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Ni weye nkongelo yo ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">kwachausa cho ulangazi wako chawona ulangazi.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Jendeleza ungi wako kwa waya wakumanyize weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">uwagila wako kwa wadya wachumile moyo.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Usekuzumila wata kweduvya wanebunge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">hegu wantu wavu wanibalaze.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Kaula ivyo wantu wehi wagwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">wadulwa hasi, hawakudaha kwinuka!<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s">Uhelo wa wantu wedi na wantu wehiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Usekutumbwazika kwachausa cha wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">usekuwadila finju wantu wakutenda yehiye,<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />kwaviya, nawasunguze kunyala saviya mani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">nawasunguze kubanika saviya mani maisi.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Ika msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile na udamanye yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">vileke wikale vyedi mwe isi na kwikala kwa kwenenwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Mbwedo wako ulondele kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">uyo nakwinke yadya ukunga mo umoyo wako.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Mwinke Zumbe Chohile izisila zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">mwikiye uyo msuhi na uyo nakwambize,<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />nadamanye uwedi wako umweke saviya mmweko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">na ukanuni wako saviya zuwa dya msi.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Tondowala kwa Zumbe Chohile, mgoje kwa kujijimiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">usekwetumbwadisa na wantu wakuchumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">hegu awo wakuchumilwa kwa mizungu ihiye.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Leka maya naho usekwihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">usekutumbwazika, kwaviya nayakulongoze kwe wihi.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Kwaviya wantu wakudamanya mbuli zihiye nawabindwe pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">mna wakumwikiya msuhi Zumbe Chohile nawalisi isi.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Chisigala chipindi chijihi, wakudamanya yehiye nawasunguze kwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">hatahegu nowalonde howawone.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Mna wakunyanyahala nawailisi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">naho nawabwede utondowazi ulozese.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Mwavu awafungila njama wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">waluma imilomo kwa maya,<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />mna Zumbe Chohile awaseka wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">kwaviya kamanya zuwa dyawo dyo kukantilwa dyeza.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Wantu wavu wasomola izisime zawo na kukwesa nyuta zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">vileke wawakome wachiwa na hewene chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wawachinje wadya wakwikala ko ukanuni,<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />mna izisime zawo nazitunge imyoyo yawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">ne izinyuta zawo nazivunwe vunwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Viwagile ugoli mjeche wa mntu mkanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">ukaleka ugoli ulozize wa wantu wavu,<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />kwaviya nguvu za wavu nazivunwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">mna Zumbe Chohile namdime mkanuni.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Zumbe Chohile adima wikazi wa wantu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">na ulisi wawo wekalisa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Mazuwa ya nkunto hawangadike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">mazuwa ya gumbo nawatende na nkande ilozize,<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />mna wavu nawakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">wankondo wa Zumbe Chohile nawosike saviya maluwa kwenkonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">nawosike saviya mosi.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Mntu mwavu akopa naho hakuliha deni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">mna mkanuni alavya kwa chisekwesekwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Wadya wajimbikwe ni Zumbe Chohile nawailisi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">mna wadya akuwaligita nawakomwe wamlawe mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Uneva Zumbe Chohile anawagizwa ni mijendele ya mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">atogeza izinkacho za uyo mntu,<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />hata akekobadika hakugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">kwaviya Zumbe Chohile amwinula kwa mkono wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Nendaga mbwanga haluse sidalahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">mna sawonaga mpwii mkanuni akasigwa ni Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">hegu wanawe wakalombeza nkande.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Nkanana zose awantu awo wana chisekwesekwe wakopesha hehena kutigiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">wana wawo wajimbikwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Leka wihi damanya yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">weye nowikale mweisi mazuwa yose,<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />kwaviya Zumbe Chohile awaunga wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">uyo hawaleke awakanuni wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">Nawadimwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">mna cheleko cha wantu wavu nawakomwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Wakanuni nawailisi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">nawekale umo mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Mntu mkanuni alonga milosi yo ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">na ululimi lwakwe lwalonga milosi ikuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Atoza sigilizi ya Chohile ywakwe mo umoyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">hakutela mo ulujendo lwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Mntu mwavu amnyatila mntu mkanuni vileke ajeze kumkoma,<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />mna Zumbe Chohile hawaleke mwe imikono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">naho hawaleke wakantilwe kugamba ni wabanasi umo wakalahwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Ika msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile na kutoza isila yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">uyo nakutunye na ulisi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">umo wavu wanakomwa noviwone ivyo.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Nawonaga mntu mwavu naho ni nyakwili vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">akachumilwa saviya mti wa mwaloni wa Lebanoni,<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />mna niyo asunguza kusika naho hawoneke vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">hata nize nimlonde simuwone.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Wakaule wantu wedi na wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">wakaulise wantu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">mntu akunga utondowazi achumilwa,<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />mna wakudamanya masa wose nawakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">na kuchumilwa kwawo nakusigwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Zumbe Chohile awambula wantu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">na kuwadima chipindi cha nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Zumbe Chohile awambiza na kuwambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">awambula kulawa mwe wantu wavu na kuwadima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kwaviya wasumkila ugombezi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s">Malombbezo ya mntu akusulumizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, usekunikwahila kwa amaya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:1">usekunifinyankiza kwa maya yako.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Misale yako inilasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">mkono wako unikantila.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Kwachausa cha amaya yako, nimwe masulumizo yatendese, mwili wangu wose waluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwachausa cha amasa yangu,<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Sigubikwa ni masa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">saviya mbundu uzamise mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Makwenje yangu yawola na kununka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">kwachausa cho uhezi wa amasa yangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Sinamizwa hasi na kuselezwa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">msi mjima nakwela hasela nalomboleza.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Mgongo wangu umema ulumi ukoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">hamna luhulwila mo mwili wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Sitigintika na kusokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">nasulumila mo umoyo kwa ulumi mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, kuvimaya viya hunga vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">ivyo hunga vyose havikufisika kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Moyo wangu watuntisa, nguvu zangu zinisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">hata ameso yangu yengila luzuyu.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Wambuya na weyangu wanenega kwachausa cha amasulumizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">wehajihi hangu wekala hale na miye.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Wadya wakunga wanikome wenika mitego yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">wadya wakunga nilumile wanitisa kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">walafya yehiye msi mjima.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Miye ni saviya chiziwi, hekudaha kwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">ni saviya chimumu, hekudaha kulonga chintu.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Sitenda saviya mntu hekwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">uyo mlomo wakwe haukudaha kuhitula chochose,<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />mna miye nakugoja weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu nonihitule.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Nakulombeza usekuwaleka wankondo wangu welelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">naho wasekweduvya mwangu umo hagwa,<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />kwaviya nihaguhi na kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">no ulumi wangu wanebunga chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Neila uwavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">kwaviya natumbwadiswa na amasa yangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Wankondo wakunihiwa hehena luhosa waloza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">awo hewekununga vya bule hawakuwazika.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Awo waliha wihi kwa wedi nidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">wanihiga kwaviya nadamanya yedi.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Weye Zumbe Chohile usekunasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">usekutenda hale na miye, weye Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Sunguza wize unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">weye Zumbe Chohile, Mwambula ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s">Kweila kwa mntu akusulumizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Nasilonga, “Nanidime uwikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">na kuchinda ululimi lwangu, nnasekukola masa kwa kulonga kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">Nanigubike umlomo wangu chipindi chose wavu wakatenda hajihi na miye.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Nasitenda saviya chimumu silongile chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">nasinyamala mna sipatile luhulwila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">Ulumi wa amasulumizo yangu wongezekela,<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />kwangadika kwangu kunilumiza umoyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">Ivyo nijendeleze kufanyanya nivyo nangadike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">aho niyo nalonga imilosi ino,<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />“Weye Zumbe Chohile nigambila udumo wo wikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">mazuwa yangu yo ujima yasigala mengahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">ninka kumanya uwikazi wangu ivyo ukusunguza kujinka.”<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Wikazi wangu kuutenda mjihi saviya muye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">wikazi wangu sicho chintu kulongozi kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">Wikazi wa chila mntu ni saviya muye du,<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />chila mntu ajinka saviya chizuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">kuhikiliza kwakwe kose ni bule du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">achisanya ugoli ulozize, mna hammanyize uyo akunga aupate.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Mna haluse Zumbe Chohile nilonde chibwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Msuhi wangu wi kwako weye.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Nambula mwa amasa yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">usekuzumila wahezi wanitile.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Nasinyamala dwii, sikulonga chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">sigubule mlomo wangu kwaviya ni weye udamanye yano.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Usekunikantila vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">kwaviya nihaguhi na kubanika kulawana ne izinkanto zako.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Wakwahila na kukantila wantu kwachausa cha amasa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">wabalanga ugoli wawo saviya mswa ukubalanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">chindedi chila mntu ni saviya muye du!<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wetegeleze amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">tegeleza indilo yangu unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">usekunyamala umo haila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Kwaviya miye ni saviya mjeni akujinka du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">ni mtafi saviya wendaga wakale wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Leka kunisinya vileke nelelwelwe hadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">sinati kubanika nisekutendeka mwe isi vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Nasimgoja Zumbe Chohile kwa kujijimiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:1">niyo anihitukila na kwiva indilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Niyo anusa kwe idibome dyo ubanasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">kanusa mwe ntagata na utelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">niyo anichimalisa mlanga mwe luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">na kudindimaza hadya nichimale.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Kanihinya nchemo mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">nchemo ya ntogozi kwa Chohile ywetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">Wantu walozize nawawone na kogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">nawaike msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Kajimbika mntu yudya akwika msuhi wakwe kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">mntu hakwehanga na wantu wakweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">wantu wagile kwa kuvikila milungu yo udanti.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu, kuchidamanyiza mbuli zilozize hazikuwazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">kudamanya mbuli zikwehela zilozoze mwetu, hahana akudaha kuzichinda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">nanitambalise na kuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">mna zilozesa kuzitamwila.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Weye hukunga ntambiko hegu malavyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">ntambiko za kutikimya na za kusa masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">mna kuninka magutwi vileke hwive.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Naho nigambile, “Miye nihano siza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">kwaviya yadya hungwa nidamanye yawandikwa mwe ichitabu che isigilizi.”<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nabesa nidamanye viya ukunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">sigilizi yako imndani mo umoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Sitambalisa mbuli yedi yo ukombola wako kulongozi kwe lukudidi lwa wantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">Saviya umanyize weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">miye silekile kuitambalisa imbuli yako mwa awantu.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Sifisize wambula wako uninkile mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">mazuwa yose sitambalisa ukanuni wako ne ichindedi chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">Sifisize kulonga uwagila wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">ne ichindedi chako kulongozi kwe bunga kulu dya wantu.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Weye Zumbe Chohile usekuninyima mbazi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">ungi wako ne ichindedi chako vinidime mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kunga wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Kwaviya sizungulukwa ni nkunto hezikuwazikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">masa yangu yanigubika sikuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">yaloza kujinka izifili momtwi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">miye sifa chevu mo umoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Weye Zumbe Chohile unge kunambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">weye Zumbe Chohile sunguza wize unambize.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Wose wakulonda ujima wangu vileke wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wajelwe soni na kuhuza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">Awo wakujelejeza miye nikomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wavuzwe kunyuma kwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Wadya wakunisezenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">wahuze kwa soni zawo.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Mna wadya wose wakukulonda weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">watowe nchelejele na kwelelwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">Wakunga wambula wako mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wagambe, “Zumbe Chohile Kakulisa!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Miye ni mchiwa naho ni msokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">mna weye Zumbe nifanyanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Weye nuyo mwambizi ywangu na Mwambula ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">sunguza wize, weye Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mntu mnyonje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Kajimbikwa yudya mntu akuwaunduguza wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:1">Zumbe Chohile namwambule chipindi cha nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Zumbe Chohile namdime na kumwambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">uyo nachumilwe mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Zumbe Chohile hamleke mwe imikono ya wankondo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Zumbe Chohile namwambize umo akatenda mnyonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">namhonye unyonje wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nihonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">“Weye Zumbe Chohile niwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">kwaviya sikukola masa weye.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Wankondo wangu wanilonga vihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Nabanike ini ne idizina dyakwe dyagile chakumbago?”<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Chila mntu akwiza kunikaula, alonga milosi yo udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">wachisanya mbuli za kuniziga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">wakaheza wazibwelekeza kuno na kuno.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Wankondo wangu wose watakalisana mwa miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">wanifanyanyiza yehiye,<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />wagamba, “Apwata unyonje udya wamkoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">mudya mo lusazi lwakwe hakuhona.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Hata mbuyangu ywa hajihi, nikiye msuhi mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">hudya naye nkande yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">kanihituka na kunebunga.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Weye Zumbe Chohile niwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">ninka luhulwila vileke niwalihize chikoda.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Simanya kugamba wawagilwa ni miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">kwaviya wankondo wangu hawanihude.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Weye wanambiza kwaviya nadamanya yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">wanika kulongozi kwako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">kukongela chikale na chikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">Taile! Taile!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mnyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Saviya mpala ikubesa soko ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:1">nivyo nami hukukumeila mate weye Zumbe Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Nna nchilu ya Chohile ywangu mta ujima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">Nanibule ini kwakwe niwone uso wakwe?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Naila chilo na msi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">mesozi yatenda niyo inkande yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">kuno wantu wanuza chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">“Chohile ywako ekuhi?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Mbuli zino nazikumbuka kwa chinyulu mo umoyo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">Ivyo nendile na lukudidi lwa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">hawalongoza kwita kwe Inyumba ya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">wakatowa nchelejele za kumhongeza Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Ni mbwani nangadika savino mo umoyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Ni mbwani natumbwazika mndani mwangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Nanike msuhi wangu kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">kwaviya nanimtogole vituhu Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">uyo ni wambizi wangu na Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Simemwa ni chihovu mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">elo, nahukumbuke weye Chohile kulawa kweisi ya Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">mwa amagulu ya Helimoni na Mizali.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Mto una mzimilizo wetanga mtuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">neva izwi dya mazi ya bohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">mabohwelo ya mazi na mawimbi yako yanididimiza.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Zumbe Chohile naniwonele mbazi zakwe nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">miye nanimchemele nchemo ya ntogozi nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">nilombeze kwa Chohile ywangu akuninka ujima.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Namgambila Chohile ywangu akunidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">“Ni mbwani kunijala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Ni mbwani nitumbwazike halomboleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">kwachausa cha kubunyanywa ni mnkondo ywangu?”<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Silumizwa kwa mahuluto yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">chila zuwa wanuza, “Ekuhi Chohile ywako?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Ni mbwani nangadika savino mo umoyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Ni mbwani natumbwazika mndani mwangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Nanike msuhi wangu kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">kwaviya nanimtogole vituhu Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">uyo ni wambizi wangu na Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s">Lobezo dya kwambulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile lagisa kugamba sina mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">nigombela mbuli yangu mwa wantu wehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">nambula mwe wantu wadanti na wavu.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Nasumkila ugombezi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">kwambwani kunidula hale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Kwambwani nangadike halomboleza, kwa kubunyanywa ni mnkondo ywangu?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Igala ulangazi wako ne ichindedi chako vinilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">vinigale kubula kolugulu lwako lukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">ko wikazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Aho weye Zumbe Chohile nanite kwe mazabahu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">nanize kwako weye Chohile mbwedo wangu mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">Nahutogole kwa zeze weye Chohile, Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Ni mbwani nangadika savino mo umoyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Ni mbwani natumbwazika mndani mwangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Nanike msuhi wangu kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">kwaviya nanimtogole vituhu Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">uyo ni wambizi wangu na Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kudimwa ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile suwe chiva kwa magutwi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">watati zetu wachigambila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">yadya udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">mbuli udamanye mwe ichipindi chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">heye, mbuli zote utendile aho kale.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Kwamkono wako mwenye kuwabalaza wantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">mwe ino isi na ahantu hawo niyo wawenka awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">kuwakantila awantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">na kuweka kuchumilwa watati zetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Wantu wako hawaguhile isi kwa viziha vyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">hegu hawapatile uhuda kwa nguvu zawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">mna kuwagombela kwa udahi wako mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kwa kuwalangaziza uso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kwaviya wawaunga.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Weye wi seuta ywangu na Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">kuwenka uhuda awelekwa wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Kwa udahi wako chawahuda wankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">kwa zako chawajata wadya wakuchibela wetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Miye sikuwikiya msuhi uta wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">hegu sime yangu haikudaha kunambula,<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Mna ni weye ukuchambula kulawa kwa awankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">kuwazaganya wadya wakuchihiwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Mazuwa yose chakutogola weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">weye Chohile, nachikulavize ntogozi kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Mna haluse kuchasa na kuchileka chihudye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">naho hukujesanya na awagomba nkondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Kuchitenda chiwasumke awankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">awo niyo wataha ugoli wetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Kuchitenda saviya ngoto zikwigalwa kwe kuchinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">kuchizagaza mwe izisi ntuhu.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Kuwataga awantu wako kwa hela njeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">naho hungile yombe kulu.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Wehajihi hetu wawona ichisimo udamanye mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">haluse wachitila na kuchiseka.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Kuchitenda chibelwe ni wantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">wajeni wasingisa imitwi yawo kwa kuchibela.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Msi mjima simemwa ni kuhuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">uso wangu umema soni,<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />kwa milosi no ubezi wa wantu wakunihuluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">kwachausa cha wankondo wangu na wakuniihiwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Mbuli zose izo zichigwela suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">hata hegu hachikujaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">hegu kuvuna idilagano dyako.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Mna suwe hachikuhituke weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">hegu kuleka izisila zako.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Mna kuchasa chibuntika mgati mauzi ya kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">kuchasa mwe ziza.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Hegu chakwasize weye Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">na kuvikila mnungu ywa udanti,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />weye Chohile nakuimanya kale imbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">kwaviya weye kumanya mbuli zefisize mwe imyoyo.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Mna kwachausa chako chakomwa chila nkanana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">chawazwa saviya ngoto zikwakuchinjwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Inuka weye Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Ni mbwani wagona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Chimala! Hampu usekuchidula kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Ni mbwani wafisa uso wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">na kujala izinkunto na amasulumizo yetu?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Chigwa hasi ho msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">chilagala chifudifudi mwedilumbi.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Inuka wize uchambize!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">Uchikombole kwachausa che izimbazi zako.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ngasu ya chiuseta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Moyo wangu umema fanyanyi ntana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">namtungila seuta nchemo ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">lulimi lwangu ni saviya kalamu ya mta kuwandika adahise.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Weye wi mtana kujinka wantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">milosi yako ni mbazi izodu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">Kwaviya Chohile kakujimbika mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Kwenyinye isime yako weye mkankalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">weye wimkuka na mta ugoli.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Ukulu wako wenele utende mhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">ukatende kukwela falasi ulagise ukanuni, kunyanyahala na kudima uwagila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">Umkono wako wa kulume udamanye mbuli nkulu.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Mifulo yako yakolesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">naho yalasa imyoyo ya awankondo wa seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">wantu we izisi ntuhu wagwa hasi he iviga vyako.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Weye Chohile chigoda chako cho useuta chidindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">nachikale mazuwa yose saviya Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">Nkome yo ulongozi wako yalongoza awantu wako kwa uwagila.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Waunga ukanuni na kwihiwa wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">elo, Chohile, Chohile ywako kakusagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">na kukwinka mbwedo kujinka wambuyazo.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Iziuche zako zapwepweleka mavuta na udi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">wachemi wakuchemela mwe mazumba yahambigwe kwa ugoli wa ntembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">maizwi ya mazeze ya nyaya yakutenda ubwede.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Mgati mwa wakudamanya ndima mwe idizumba dyako dye ichiseuta ni wachiche wa maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">malikiya naye kachimala kulume kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">kavala mahambo ya zahabu ntana ilaile Ofili.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Tegeleza weye mchiche, ufanyanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">Tega gutwi dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">jala awantu wako na awantu we ikaya yako ya tati yako.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Utana wako wamtamila seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">uyo ni mgosiwo. Mtunye uyo.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Wachiche wa Tilo nawakwigaile majeleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">wagoli nawaunge wahingizwe ni weye.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Mchiche ywa seuta engila uyo ni mtana vitendese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">Isuche yakwe isumwa kwa uzi wa zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Engila akatenda kavala suche ya langi zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">alongozwa kwa seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">kuno ajesanya na wambizi wakwe wachiche weyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">iviya nawo wegalwa kwa seuta.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Nawengizwe mndani kwa nchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">wabula uko wakatenda na chinyemi na mbwedo wengila mwe idizumba dya seuta.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Weye seuta nopate wana walozize wakunga walongoze hantu ha wakale wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">nowatende walongoze mweisi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Naniditende idizina dyako dikumbukwe mwe ivyeleko vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">elo, wantu we izisi zose nawakutogole kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s">Chohile ehamwenga na suwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Chohile ni sumkilo dyetu na nguvu yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">uyo ni mwambizi ywetu mazuwa yose chipindi cha nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Elo, hachogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">hata hegu isi ikazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">na amagulu yakasingiswa kulawa kwe ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />hata hegu amazi ye ibahali yakajumbwanika kwa mawimbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">na amagulu nayo yanazingiza kwa nkulujumbu yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Kuna mto amazi yakwe yaubwedeza umzi wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">wikazi ukukise wa Chohile Mkulu Ekulanga Vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Chohile eyumo mndani mo umzi, uwo haukudaha kusingiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">Chohile nawambize mtondo chilochilo.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Wantu we izisi ntuhu wogohesa na seuta nazisingisike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">Chohile analonga, isi yalujuka.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu zose ehamwenga na suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Chohile ywa Yakobo ni sumkilo dyetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Soni muwone ntendwa za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">kauloni chilozo adamanye mweisi.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Achindiza nkondo hohose mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">avunavuna myuta na maguha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">atikimya nchinga kwa moto.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />Agamba, “Nyamalani naho mmanye kugamba miye ni Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">Miye natunywa mwe izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">miye natogolwa mweisi yose.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose ehamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Chohile ywa Yakobo ni sumkilo dyetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s">Chohile Seuta ywe isi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Nyuwe wantu wose, towani magasa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:1">Mtogoleni Chohile kwa maizwi ya mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">Uyo ni Seuta mkulu ywe isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Kachidahiza kuwahuda awantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">kachitenda chilongoze mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Kachisaguila isi ino itende ulisi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">ugoli wa Yakobo uyo akumunga.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Chohile kakwela kulanga na nchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">Zumbe Chohile aita kwe chigoda chakwe cho useuta kwa izwi dya magunda.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Mchemeleni ntogozi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">mchemeleni kwa kumhongeza Seuta ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Mchemeleni ntogozi Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">kwaviya uyo ni Seuta ywe izisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Chohile alongoza mwe izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">kekala mwe ichigoda chakwe cho useuta chikukile.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Vilongozi wa awantu we izisi ntuhu wechisanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">hamwenga na awantu wa Chohile ywa Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">kwaviya Chohile ana nguvu kujinka amaseuta wose mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">uyo kakulisa.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s">Sayuni mzi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Zumbe Chohile kakulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:1">awagila kutogoleswa mo umzi wa Chohile ywetu, mo ulugulu lwakwe lukukile.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Lugulu lwa Sayuni ni lutali naho lwawagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">nkongelo ya mbwedo mweisi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">Ulugulu lwa Sayuni lwaliganywa na amagulu ya Sofani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">ni wikazi mkulu wa Seuta Mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Chohile nuyo izingome yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">elagisa saviya mwamizi ywakwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Maseuta wechisanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">niyo waita hamwenga wakuwebunga Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Mna weze wauwone umzi wa Sayuni, niyo wehelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:5">na kwingilwa ni nkama wasumka.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Nkama nkulu iwatoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">niyo watozwa nusungu saviya mvyele akwefungula,<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />kuwabalanga saviya meli za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">zivunigwe ni nkung'unto ya ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Mbuli zose chivile chiziwona wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">momzi wa Zumbe Chohile ywetu, Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">Chohile nautogeze mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Chikatenda mwe Inyumba yako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">weye Chohile, chafanyanya izimbazi zako,<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Weye Zumbe saviya idizina dyako dikutogolwa chila hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">ntogozi zako zabula uhelo weisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">Mkono wako walongoza kwa uwagila,<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Lugulu lwa Sayuni lwelelwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">Imizi ya Yuda nawatowe nchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">kwachausa che izinkato zako.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Talamkilani uko Sayuni, mkauzunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">wazani iminala yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Vikauleni iviwambaza vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">zikauleni izingome zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">vileke mdahe kuvitamwila vyeleko vikwiza kugamba,<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />“Yuno Chohile, ni Chohile ywetu kale na kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">Natende chilongozi ywetu kale na kale.”<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s">Uhezi wa kwegamila ugoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Iveni imbuli ino nyuwe wantu wose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:1">Tegelezani nyuwe wantu wose mkwikala mweisi ino,<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />tegelezani nyose, wakulu kwa wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">wagoli na wachiwa kwahamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Milosi yangu naitende ikuhinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">miye nanilonge mbuli zo ubala.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Nanitege gutwi netegeleze vyelongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">nanitambalise lufyambo kwa zeze.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Sanogohe mazuwa yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">umo hatenda sizungulukwa ni wavu wa awankondo,<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />mna wantu wavu wegamila ugoli wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">na kweduvila vintu vilozize wananavyo.<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Mna hahana mntu yoyose akudaha kumwambula mnyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">hegu kumwinka Chohile maliho kwachausa cho ujima wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />kwaviya maliho yo ujima wa mntu yakulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">hahana maliho yoyose yakwenela,<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />yamdahize ajendeleze kwikala mweisi kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">asekuwona file.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Chila yumwenga awona kugamba hata wata ubala wabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">mahumbwinya iviya hamwenga na wantu wahezi wafa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">Wose awo wawasiza ugoli wawo watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Izimbila zawo nazitende ni izinyumba zawo kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">ni wikazi wawo vyeleko kubula vyeleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">hata hegu aho nkongo nendile wana migunda yawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Mna mntu, hatahegu atunywiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">hekale nabanike saviya mnyama.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Uno nuwo udumo wa wadya wakweduvya chihezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">na uhelo wa wadya wakuzumila kutimila imilosi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Walongozwa saviya ngoto kubula kwedibome hedine uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">file naitende mdimi ywawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">Nawasele ulo na ulo kwe izimbila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">Imili yawo naiwoile uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">isi ya wabanike naitende wikazi wawo hale ne izinyumba zawo ze ichigoli.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Mna Chohile nanambule ujima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">nanikombole kulawa mwe nguvu za file.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Usekwehelwa mntu akatenda mgoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">hegu ugoli wakwe ukajenyelesa,<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />kwaviya haguhe chochose umo akabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">ugoli wakwe hawite hasi hamwenga naye.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Hatahegu mo wikazi wakwe kewona kabweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">na kutogolwa ni wantu kwachausa cha kuchumilwa,<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />nelunge hamwenga na wakale wakwe wamlongoile kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">awo hawawone vituhu ulangazi.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Mntu akutunyiswa hena umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">esaviya mnyama akukomwa.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s">Mviko wa chindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Chohile Mta Nguvu, Zumbe Chohile kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">kawetanga awekazi we isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">kulawa ulailo wa zuwa kubula uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Kulawa Sayuni, mzi mtana vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">Chohile elaviza na kulangaza.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Chohile ywetu neze, hanyamale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">Moto ukutikimya naumlongoile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">kazungulukwa ni nkung'unto ikulise.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Kulawa kwembingu netange imbingu ne isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">ziukule umo akawakantila awantu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Chohile agamba, “Wachisanyeni awantu wangu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">wadamanye lagano na miye kwa ntambiko!”<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Izimbingu zatambalisa ukanuni wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">kugamba Chohile mwenye ni mkanta.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />Naho agamba, “Tegelezani nyuwe wantu wangu, icho hulonga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Weye Izulaeli nalavya ukuzi mwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Miye ni Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Sikukukwahila kwachausa che izintambiko zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">hegu malavyo ya kutikimya ukunilaviza chila nkanana.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Ichindedi sikunga ugoli we ididewa dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">hegu vulata mo umungo wako,<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />kwaviya wanyama wose kumbago ni wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">na amafyo ye izing'ombe kulanga kwa amagulu ni zangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Wadege wose wa kumbago siwamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">ne ivyumbe vyose vikwezinkonde ni vyangu.”<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />“Hegu nendile na sala sakugambile weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">kwaviya isi yose ne ivintu viyumo ni vyangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Togola wafanyanya miye nadya nyama za njeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">hegu kunywa sakame ya mbuzi?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Ntogozi itende nuwo umviko wako kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">chintiza izinazili zako kwa Chohile ekulanga vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Nitanga mwe zuwa wimwe nkuto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">miye nahwambule, weye nonitunye.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Mna Chohile amgamba mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">“Wazitajizani izisigilizi zangu vyabule?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">Kwambwani walonga ukalanga idilagano dyangu?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Weye wayehiywa amahinyo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">naho hukunga kutimila imilosi yangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Ukawona mbavi wajesanya naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">welunga hamwenga na wachilanga.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Mlomo wako waujeseza kulonga mbuli zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">ndima yo ululimi lwako nikulonga udanti.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Wasika dindili wawalongalonga walukolo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">na kuwazigiliza weyawo.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Kujesa izimbuli zose izo miye sinyamala dwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">togola wafanyanya miye niseivyo weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Mna haluse nahukwahile na kukulaha mo lumpe.”<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />“Fanyanyani vyedi izimbuli zino, nyuwe mkumjala Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">hegu sivyo naniwakomeni hahatende na ywa kuwambulani.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Akulavya ntambiko ya ntogozi anitunya miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">akutimila izisila zangu uyo nanimwambule.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s">Lombeza kulekeilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Weye Chohile, niwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kuligana no ungi wako hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kuligane ne izimbazi zako zilozize nusiza ubanasi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Unisunte umlema wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:2">unisunte amasa yangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Nazumila pwilili ubanasi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">mazuwa yose nayawona amasa yangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Sikubalanga weye ichedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">sidamanya mbuli zihiye kulongozi kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">Elo, viya ukulamula viligana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">nkonto zako hazina mlema.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Chindedi miye ni mbanasi kukongela kwelekwa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">mta masa kukongela mwe inda ya mame.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Weye waunga ukanuni ukulawa mndani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">elo nihinya ubala.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Unisunte kwa kahuto ka hisopo, nami nanikuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">unisunte miye naning'ale chwee saviya sufi.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Ninka mbwedo na chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">nibwedeza vituhu, miye mavuha uhondile hondile.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Usekukaula amasa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">usa umlema wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Weye Chohile numbiya moyo wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">idamanye uhya iloho yangu na ya ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Usekunidula hale na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">usekunusiza iloho yako Ikukile.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Nivuziza vituhu umbwedo wo wambulwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">ninka moho wa kunyanyahala unidindimaze, unijendeleze husankanile.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Aho naniwahinye wabanasi izisila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">na wata masa nawakuwiye weye.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Weye Chohile, Chohile ukunambula,,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">nambula mwe mlema wa kwitila sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">miye nanicheme kwa izwi dya chinyemi, kwachausa cho uwagila wako.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, nidahiza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">vileke nitambalise ntogozi zako.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Weye hukuwagizwa ni ntambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">kona sivyo miye nasikwigaila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">Weye hukubweda malavyo ya kutikimya.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Ntambiko yangu kwako weye Chohile ni loho yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">weye Zumbe Chohile hukulemela moyo uchumile na ukunyanyahala.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, unge kuutendela yedi umzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">uzenge uhya iviwambaza vyo umzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Aho nahatende na ntambiko zikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">malavyo ya kutikimya na ntambiko za kutikimya vijima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">naho njeku nazilavigwe mwe imazabahu yako.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s">Nkanto na mbazi za Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Weye mkankalu kwambwani weduvya wihi wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">Mna ukanuni wa Chohile ni wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Chila nkanana wamalanya ubanasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">lulimi lwako ni saviya wembe ukukola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">Lwalonga mbuli zo udanti uwodu.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Weye waungisa wihi ukaleka wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">waungisa kulonga udanti ukaleka kulonga ichindedi.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Waungisa milosi ikubalanga wantu, waungisa lulimi lukolonga udanti.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Mna Chohile nakuseleze hasi kwa ubanasi wa kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">nakupempule na kukusa chinguvu kulawa mwe inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">nakuse mwe isi ino wakwikala wata ujima.<verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Wantu wata uwagilwa nawawone na kogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">nawamseke wakagamba,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Kaula yano yambwile yudya mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">hemwikiye msuhi Chohile atende ngome yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">mna keikiya msuhi mo ugoli wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">endaga chobala ywa kukoma weyawe.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Mna miye ni saviya mti wa mzaituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">ukutima mwe Inyumba ya Chohile. Nanikiye msuhi mbazi zakwe kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Nahutogole kale na kale kwa mbuli utendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">nanikiye msuhi idizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">kwaviya zina dyako ni dyedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">Nahutogole kulongozi kwa wantu wako.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s">Mntu hekumvikila Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Wahezi welongela mwe imyoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">“Hakuna Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">Wose wabanikilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">wadamanya mbuli za kwihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">hahana hata yumwenga akudamanya yedi.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Chohile awakaula wantu kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">awone hegu kuna mta ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">akumlonda Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Mna wose walemela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">wose chahamwenga wabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">hahana hata yumwenga akudamanya yedi.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Chohile auza, “Togola wakudamanya mbuli za wavu hawana fanyanyi,?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Wawadya awantu wangu saviya mikate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">naho hawakunivikila miye Chohile.”<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Ivyo nawengilwe ni nkama ikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">nkama hawajezaga kuiwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwaviya Chohile nachakule amavuha ya awankondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">awo nawahuze kwaviya Chohile kawalemela.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Nahabesa wambulwa wa Izulaeli wezile kulawa Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Chohile, ivyo ichinyemi nachitende mwa awantu wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">umo Chohile nawavuze awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">wendile watahwa, welekwa wa Yakobo watowe nchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Waizulaeli welelwe vituhu!<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kudimwa kulaila mwe wankondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Weye Chohile nambula kwa zina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:1">nigombela nkanto kwa udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Weye Chohile wive amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:2">tegela gutwi chiya hulombeza kwako.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Kwaviya wajeni wanebunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wantu manywakwili walonda wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wantu hewekukunga weye Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Mna simanya kugamba Chohile nuyo akunambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">Zumbe Chohile nuyo akunidima.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Chohile wakantile wihi wawo wenye wadya wakunizigiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">wabalange kwaviya weye wi mkanuni.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Zumbe Chohile, nahulavize ntambiko za kweungila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">nanitogole idizina dyako kwaviya wi ywedi.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Kwaviya kunambula kulawa mwe nkunto zangu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">miye siwona mwenye kwa chinyemi awankondo wangu wakahudwa.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mntu ahitukwe ni wambuyaze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Weye Chohile, tegeleza amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:1">naho usekubela imilosi yangu!<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Unive naho unihitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">kwaviya nangadiswa ni fanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />Nna nkama kwa vitiso vya wankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">na kwa kubunyanywa ni wantu wata wavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Wantu wavu wanitumbwadisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">kwa maya wanidamanyiza wihi.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Moyo wangu umema chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">nkama ya file inebunga.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Nazingiza kwa nkama itendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">sebungwa ni kutiswa kutendese.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Hegu nendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">na mawawa saviya kasuwamanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">Nasipuluka nite hale hatwete.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Nasitamba hale vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">na kwika wikazi kwedijangwa.<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Nasisumkila hantu he ugombezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">hale na nkung'unto na luzimu.<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wazaganye wavu wasekwivana mwe idilonga dyawo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">Nawona unyakwili na nkumbizi mo umzi.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Chilo na msi vyazunguluka mwe iviwambaza vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">wavu na ubunyanyi wimndani mwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Ubanasi umema chila hantu mo umzi navyo havyusike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">kutisana no udanti havikusila mwe izinkwikwi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Hegu mnkondo ywangu anihulute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">nasijijimiza, hegu mhigani ywangu anibeile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">nasefisa hale naye.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Mna kumbe ni weye mbuyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">ni weye mbuyangu na mnjama mnyangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Suwe nachizwele kutamwila chimbuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">umo nachikaita mwe bunga dya wantu nachilongozana kwita kwe Inyumba ya Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Leka file isunguze kuwalaila awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">wasele hasi kwedibome hedine uhelo wachei wajima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">kwaviya wavu uwamema mgati mwawo.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Mna miye nanimwitanga Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">uyo Zumbe Chohile nanambule.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Nafuzuma na kwila chisingi na mtondo na msi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">uyo neve idizwi dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Nanambule nikale mpeho mwe inkondo imalanywe kwachausa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">hata hegu wantu walozize wanihiga.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Chohile hekuhitukila akulongoza mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">naweve na kuwakantila, wantu hewekuhituila izisila zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">naho hawana nkama ya Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Mnyangu awebunga wambuyaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">naho atula idilagano dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Milosi yakwe ideleka kujinka mabongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mna fanyanyi zakwe zegala nkondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">Milosi yakwe itondowala saviya mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mna yasenga saviya bamba dikukolesa.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Mwasize Zumbe imizigo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">uyo nakudindimaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">hamleke mpwii mkanuni ywakwe ahundwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Mna weye Chohile, nowaseleze wavu kwedibome dyo ubanasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Wantu awo wakomi na wadanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">awo hawabule inusu yo uwikazi wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Mna miye nahwikiye msuhi weye Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza msuhi kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Weye Chohile, niwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">kwaviya wantu wanebungisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">Msi wose wankondo wangu wahikiliza kunisulumiza.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Wadya wakuniziga wanibasa msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">awo wakunebunga chihigane walozesa.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Weye Chohile Mkulu, hengilwa ni woga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">msuhi wangu naika kwako weye.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Sika msuhi wangu kwa Chohile na kutogola ulosi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">sika msuhi kwa Chohile, sanogohe chintu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Mntu akugojwa ni file nanitende mbwani?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Msi wose wahituila imilosi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">mizungu yawo yose ni kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Wadugana kumalanya na kuninyatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">wazuza chila mbuli hudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">waninyatila vileke wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Weye Chohile walihe kuligana no wihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">wagwise kwa maya yako.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Weye kumanya ukwiingwaingwa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">waika lukumbusa lwa amesozi yangu yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Togola mbuli zose gamba ziwandikwa mwe ichitabu chako?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Umo halombeza wambizi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">wankondo wangu wavuzwa kunyuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">Simanya chindedi Chohile entendele yangu.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Naika msuhi kwa Chohile na kutogola ulosi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">Naika msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile na kutogola ulosi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">naika msuhi kwa Chohile uyo hutogola ulosi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Naika msuhi kwa Chohile sikogoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">Mntu akugoja file nanitende mbwani?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Weye Chohile nanchintize inazili yangu kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">nahulavize ntambiko za ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Kwaviya kunambula kulawa mwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">kunidima nisekwebaja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">nisekugwa hasi, vileke nikale kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">weye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">mwe ung'azi wo ujima.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Uniwonela mbazi, weye Chohile niwonela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">kwaviya nasumkila kwako nikale mpeho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">Mwe ichizuli cha amawawa yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">nanisumkile kubula ubanasi ujinke.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Namwitanga Chohile mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Chohile akuchintiza viya akunga kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Nanigaile wambizi kulawa kwembingu na kunambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">nawajele soni awo wakuhikiliza kunegona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">Chohile nanilagise mbazi zakwe no ukanuni wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Miye sitandamwa ni wankondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">wata sala saviya simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">meno yawo yesaviya maguha na mapelege,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">malimi yawo nisaviya bamba dikukolesa.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Weye Chohile utogolwe kulanga kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">ung'azi wako wenele mweisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Wankondo wahinda lwavu vileke wanigwize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">miye nasungulumanya kwa chinyulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">Wanisimbila bome mwesila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">mna watolobele wowo wenye.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Weye Chohile, moyo wangu udindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">heye moyo wangu udindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">nahuchemele na kukutogola weye.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Inuka weye moyo wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Inukani nyuwe vilangu na mazeze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Naniyasetule amachelo.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Weye Zumbe nahutogole mwa awantu we izisi izintuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">nahuchemele ntogozi mwa awantu we izisi izintuhu.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Kwaviya ungi wako wenela kubula kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">ukanuni wako ubula ko ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Weye Chohile utogolwe kulanga kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">ung'azi wako wenele mweisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantile wata masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Nyuwe masekulu, togolani chindedi mwakantila vikuwagila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">Togolani mwakantila wantu vikuligana?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Bule! Mwe myoyo yenyu mwatula lulimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">nyuwe mwadamanya yehiye na unyakwili mweisi.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Wantu wavu wabanikilwa kukongela kwelekwa kwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">ni wadanti, wagilwa kukongela mwe izinda za wamami zawo.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Wana usungu saviya usungu wa nyoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">wasita amagutwi yawo saviya myomb usitile amagutwi,<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />uwo haukwiva hata chivugo cha mlaguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">hegu lungole lwa mgangana.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Weye Chohile watule ameno yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">weye Zumbe Chohile, ng'ola amahasaga yawo.<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Wagile saviya mazi yakunywela mwe isanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">wakakwesa imisale yawo itende butu.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Wosike saviya kove dikunyuluka dikajenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">watende saviya mwana abanikile kundani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">wasekujeza kuwona zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Umo izinyungu hezinati kukola moto we izinkuni ze imiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">zikatenda zinyala hegu mbisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">Chohile napempule inyungu nkande heinati kwiva.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Wakanuni nawelelwe umo wakawona wavu wakakantilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">umo wakajata mwe sakame ya wantu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Wantu wose nawagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">“Taile wakanuni nawenkwe jeleko!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">Chindedi kuna Chohile, akuikantila isi!”<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kudimwa ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Weye Chohile, nambula kulawa mwa awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:1">unidime kulawa mwa awo wakunebunga!<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Unikombola na awantu wakudamanya yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">unambule mwa awo awakomi!<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Kaula ivyo waninyatila vileke wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">wantu awo manyakwili wechisanya hamwenga wakamba wihi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">miye sibalange hegu kukola masa,<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />miye sibalange, mna wekamba wanebunge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Inuka unambize, uwone ivyo nikailwe vihiye.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, Mta Nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Chohile ywa Izulaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Inuka uwakantile awantu awo hewekumanyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">usekuwaleka awo wakudamanya wihi.<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Chila chisingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">wauya wakabuma saviya makuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">wakachochola mo umzi.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Tegeleza chiya chikulawa mwe imilomo yawo ni mahuluto du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">milosi yawo yasenga saviya sime ikukolesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">naho wafanyanya hahana akuweva.<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Mna weye Zumbe Chohile, wawaseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">wawatila awantu awo wose hewekumanyize.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Weye wi nguvu yangu nahugoje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">kwaviya weye Chohile, wingome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Chohile ywangu anungisa neze kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">nonitende niwawone wankondo wangu wakahudwa.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Mna weye Chohile usekusunguza kuwakoma awankondo chani awantu wangu wanase kujala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">mna wangadise kwa udahi wako na kuwaseleza hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">Weye Zumbe niweye nchinga yetu.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Awo wegaila masa wenye kwe imilosi wakulonga kwa milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">waleke wagwizwe mo kweduvya kwawo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">Kwachausa cha maligito yawo no udanti wawo wakulonga,<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />wabalangwe kwa maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">wabalangwe wasekutendeka vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">vileke wantu wamanye kugamba weye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">walongoza welekwa wa Yakobo kubula uhelo we isi.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Chila chisingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">wauya wakabuma saviya makuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">wakachochola mo umzi.<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Wadwangaya wakalonda nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">wacheleza kubuma hawanegute.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Mna miye nanicheme ntogozi ze izinguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">mtondo nahutogole kulanga ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">kwaviya weye kutenda ngome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">na sumkilo dyangu mwe izinkunto zangu.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Weye wi nkongelo ye izinguvu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">nahuchemele ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">mtondo kwa mbazi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">kwaviya weye Chohile wi ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Chohile ukunungisa.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kwambulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Weye Chohile kuchilemela na kuchihonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">kuchifila maya, haluse hampu chivuze kwako.<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Kusingisa isi na kuitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:2">haluse sita amawawi yakwe chani isekubogozoka.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Kuwajela mwe nkunto awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">chayumbadika enga chikolwa.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Wenke chilagiso wadya wakukiya msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">vileke wenege ubanasi.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Chambule na kuchambiza kwa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">chani wadya ukungisa wadahe kwambulwa.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Chohile kalonga kulawa ahantu hakwe hakukile akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">“Haluse naniisange Shekemu kwa mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">na kuhima Idikolongo dya Sukosi.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Isi ya Giliyadi ni hantu hangu, na Manase ni yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">Manase ni nkofiya yangu ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">na Yuda ni nkome yangu ya kulongozeza.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Moabu ni champa changu cha kunawila mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">idikwapa dyangu nanididule Edomu chani niiguhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">nanitowe hugu dya uhuda mwa Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Ni yuhi akunga anigale komzi una ngome?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Ni yuhi akunga anilongoze kubula Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Weye Chohile, togola kuchilemela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">Weye hukujesanya vituhu na wagomba nkondo wetu?<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Chambize vituhu mwa awankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">kwaviya wambizi wa wantu ni wabule.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Kwaviya chinatenda hamwenga na Chohile nachipate uhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">uyo nawahude awankondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo kudimwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Weye Chohile wive indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:1">tegeleza amalombezo yangu!<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Kulawa uhelo we isi nahwitange weye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">Nakwitanga kuno hatenda sifa chevu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">Nilongoza kulanga koluwe lukulise,<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />kwaviya weye kutenda sumkilo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">nchinga yangu idindimale mwa awankondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Nalombeza nikale mwe Inyumba yako kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">na kupata wikalo hasi ha amawawa yako.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Weye Chohile, kwaviya kwiva izinazili zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">kuninka ulisi wa wadya wakukuvikila weye.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Mwongeze seuta mazuwa matali mo wikazi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">mihilimo yakwe itende ya vyeleko vilozize.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Uyo alongoze kale na kale kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">weye Chohile mdime kwa mbazi zako no ukanuni wako vimdime.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Elo, nahuchemele nchemo za ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">na kuchintiza nazili zangu chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s">Chohile nuyo akunidima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Namgoja Chohile uyodu kwa kutondowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:1">wambulwa wangu walawa kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Uyodu nuyo luwe lwangu na wambulwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">uyo ni ngome yangu sanijeze kusingisika.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Namnebunge kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">Togolani mwaunga mnikome kubula ini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">miye sikala saviya lukwikwi lwiname,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">saviya chiwambaza chikubogozoka?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Mwekamba mnigwise kulawa ahantu hangu he ntunyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">mbwedo wenyu ni kulonga udanti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">Mwalonga milosi ikutamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">mna mwe myoyo mwaligita.<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Namgoja Chohile uyodu kwa kutondowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">kwaviya msuhi wangu nawika kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Uyo ichedu nuyo uluwe lwangu na wambulwa ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">uyo ni ngome yangu sanijeze kusingisika.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Wambulwa wangu na ntunyo yangu vyalawa kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">kwaviya luwe lwangu lukulu na sumkilo dyangu ni Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Nyuwe wantu ikani msuhi kwa Chohile mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">mgambileni Zumbe yadya yemwe myoyo yenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Chohile nuyo sumkilo dya ugombezi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Wantu wose ni saviya muye du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wose hawakwikiwa msuhi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">Naho, hata ukawahima hawakubula chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wose chahamwenga wahuha kujinka muye.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Msekwegamila mwe kubunyanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">msekweduvila ugoli wo ubavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">hata ugoli wako ukajenyela usekuwikiya msuhi.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Chohile kalonga ulosi umwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">miye simwiva nkanana mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">kugamba nguvu zose ni zakwe Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />naho mbazi ni zakwe Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">weye wamliha chila mntu kuligana ne izintendwa zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s">Nkwina ya kutenda na Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Weye Chohile, weye wi Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">miye nakulonda kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">loho yangu ikalukwa saviya mntu akalukwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">sikalukwa saviya sanga inyaile heina mazi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Sikuwona ahantu hako hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">niwone inguvu yako no ung'azi wako.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Kwaviya ungi wako ni wedi kujinka ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">kwa chausa icho miye nahutogole kwa mlomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Nahutogole mazuwa yose yo ujima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">naninule imikono yangu halombeza kwako.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Loho yangu nayelelwe enga sivavula nkande ya ngasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">kwa lungole nanichema ntogozi zako.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Hatenda molusazi nahukumbuke weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">chilo chose nahufanyanye weye,<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />kwaviya weye ni weye wambizi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">hasi he ichizuli cha amawawa yako nanicheme kwa mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Loho yangu yatimilana na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">mkono wako wa kulume wanidindimaza.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Mna wadya wakunga wanikome nawatolobele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">nawaselezwe hasi kowikazi wa wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Nawakomwe kwa bamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">nawatende nkande ya mauzi.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Mna seuta nelelwe kwa chausa cha Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">wadya wose wakwelisa kwa zina dya Chohile nawamtogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">mna milomo ya wadanti nainyamazwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kudimwa ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Weye Chohile, unive amavuzumo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">dima uwikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">kwaviya wankondo wanitisa.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Nidima kulawa mwe injama za wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">kulawana na mabunga ya wantu wehiye.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Wanola izindimi zawo saviya bamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">wafyusa milosi ikulasa saviya misale.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Wadula misale kulawa uko wefisize wamwebunga mntu mkanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">wamwebunga chipumpa hawekogoha.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Watintisana mwe imizungu yawo ihiye wakunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">wevana ivyo nawafise imtego yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">Wagamba, “Hahana nadahe kuiwona.”<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Wadamanya njama zihiye wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">“Chifanyanya mwalo uchumile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Ni yuhi nabunkule umwalo wetu?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Mwalo wa chinyele ufiswa mwe moyo wa mntu.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Mna Chohile nawalase kwa misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">na kusunguza kuwalasa.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Nawabalange kwachausa che imilosi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">chila nawawone nasingise umtwi kwa chihovu,<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />na wantu wose nawogohe. Nawatambalise izimbuli adamanye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">na kusungulumanaya izintendwa zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Wakanuni nawelelwe kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">na kusumkila ugombezi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">wata myoyo ichumile nawamtogole uyo.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Weye Chohile wawagila ntogozi uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:1">wantu nawachintize izinazili zawo,<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />kwaviya weye weva amalombezo yetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">Wantu wose naweze kwako.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Chikazamilwa ni masa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">weye mweye wachilekeile.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Ujimbiko wi mwe wadya awantu usagule na kuwegala hajihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">wekale mwe izinyuwa zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">Suwe cheguswa ni wedi we inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">wedi we Inyumba yako ikukile.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Wachihitula kwa ntendwa zikwehela zikuwagila na kuchambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">weye Chohile mwambula ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">ni weye msuhi we ivyumbe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">mweisi yose na wakwikala ntendele ya kaidi ye ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Kusika amagulu ahantu yeli kwa udahi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">Weye walagisa izinguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Wanyamaza mjubwaniko we bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">na msindo wa amawimbi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">wachinda ngavungavu za wantu.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Wantu wose mweisi wehelwa ni izintendwa zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">Wahosa mbwedo chila hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kukongela ulailo wa zuwa kubula uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Weye watalamkila isi kwa kuinyeseza fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">wainka ulozo na kuitondowaza, mto wako umema mazi ndwaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">waidahiza isi na kuinka ulozo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Ivyo nivyo uidahize isi,<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />kwigala fula nkulu kwezinkonde na kuzichabaza kwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">isanga waitohola kwa mawaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kuijimbika imimea isuke.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Mhilimo wose wawinka yedi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">chila hantu ujinkile hajimbikwa.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Madimilo yamema wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">magulu nayo yamema mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Madimilo yamema ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">mabwandasi yamema ngano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">Chila chintu chelelwa kwa mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogola Chohile kwa wedi wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Nyuwe wantu wose mkwikala mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:1">mtogoleni Chohile kwa nchelegele!<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Chemani ukulu we idizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">mwinkeni ntogozi!<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Mgambeni Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">“Ntendwa zako zehela vitendese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Udahi wako ukulisa, vyaleka awankondo wako wafika madi kulongozi kwako kwa nkama.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Chila mntu mweisi akuvikila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">wakuchemela ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">wadichemela ntogozi idizina dyako.”<verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Soni mkaule mbuli atendile Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">katenda mbuli za kutisa mwa awantu.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Ahituilaga ibahali kutenda hantu hanyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">wantu niyo wamboka umo lwa viga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Suwe niyo chatowa nchelegele kwachausa cha ntendwa zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Alongoza kale na kale kwa udahi wakwe mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">meso yakwe yasinya wantu wose mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">Hasekutenda na mnkani yoyose akumhiga.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Mtogoleni Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">nyuwe wantu wose mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">tambalisani ntogozi zakwe vileke zivike.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Uyo kachinka ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">naho hachilekile chigwe.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Weye Chohile kuchijeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">kuchisunta mwe moto saviya mayuwe ya chumbu.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Kuchihosa chigwizwe mwe lwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">kuchitwisa nkunto zizamise.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Kuwaleka awankondo wetu wachijate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">chijinkila mwe moto na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">mna haluse kuchileta hantu he ulozo.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Nanize mwe Inyumba yako na amalavyo yo kutikimya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">na kuchintiza izinazili zangu kwako,<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />nilongile na kwelisa miye mwenye umo nendile mwe nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Nahulavize ntambiko za kutikimya zidamanise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">na ntambiko kutikimya za ndolome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">nahulavize ntambiko za ng'ombe na mbuzi.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Soni mwetegeleze nyuwe nyose mkumvikila Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">miye naniwagambileni viya anitendele.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Kwa izwi nasimwilila wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">ntogozi zakwe nendile zimolulimi lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Hegu nafisize wihi mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Zumbe Chohile nendile hanitegeleze.<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Mna chindedi Chohile kaniva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">heye, ketegeleza imilosi ya amalombezo yangu niyo anihitula.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Atogolwe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">kwaviya halemele amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">hegu kusa ungi wakwe kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Chifile mbazi weye Chohile na kuchijimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:1">chilangazize ung'azi wo uso wako kwa wedi,<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />vileke wantu wose mweisi wamanye izisila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">wantu mwe izisi zose wamanye udahi wako wo kwambula.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Elo, wantu wose wakutunye weye Chohile na kukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">wantu wose nawakutogole.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Wantu we izisi zose nawelelwe na kuchema kwa mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">kwaviya wakantila wantu kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">na kulongoza isi.<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Elo, wantu wose wakutunye weye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">wantu wose wakutogole.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Isi ilavya ulozo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">na Chohile, Chohile ywetu kachijimbika.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Chohile ajendeleze kuchijimbika, wantu wose mweisi wamtogole uyo.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Chohile enuka, na wankondo wakwe watimkana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">wakumwihiwa wasumkila hale naye.<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Saviya mosi ukufiliswa ni mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">seivyo uwafilise hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">saviya nta ikulujuka mwe moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">seivyo wavu nivyo wakubanika kulongozi kwa Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Mna wata kuwagila nawelelwe umo Chohile akeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">watowe nchelegele na kuchema kwa mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Mchemeleni Chohile, ditogoleni idizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">mdamanyizeni isila yakwe akukweila kwamaingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">Zina dyakwe ni Zumbe Chohile, elelwani kulongozi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Chohile akwikala ahantu hakwe hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">ni tate ywa wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">na mdimi ywa wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Chohile awenka wachiwa wikazi wa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">afungula wafungwa na kuwenka kuchumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">mna wadya wakulemela kutimila yadya akulagiza nawekale mwesi inyaile.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Weye Chohile umo wawalongozaga awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">umo watambaga kudya kwedijangwa,<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />isi naisingisika, ulanga niyo wanyesa fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">kulongozi kwa Chohile wo Ulugulu lwa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">kulongozi kwa Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Weye Chohile kunyesa fula itendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">kuyavusa isanga yo ulisi wako yendile inyalisa.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Wantu wako waikaga wikazi wako uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">kwa wedi wako niyo wawenka wachiwa viya wakunga.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Zumbe nakatambalisa lagizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">niyo, wavyele walozize watambalisa ulosi uwo,<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />“Maseuta na wagomba nkondo wawo niyo wasumka!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">Niyo wavyele kwezinyumba wasangilana viya watahile,<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />hatahegu wagona mwe madewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">weye wi saviya matukulu ya wasuwamanga yahakigwe chumbu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">mazoya yawo yahamwa kwa zahabu ikung'ala.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Umo Zumbe Chohile mta Nguvu Zose awatimulaganye amaseuta mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">vyendaga saviya balafu igwele kulawa kulanga kolugulu lwa Salimoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Weye luguluu lwa Chohile, lugulu lwa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">weye lugulu lwa vinenengwe vilozize, lugulu lwa Bashani!<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Ni mbwani wauwonela finju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">ulugulu asagule Chohile ekale mlanga mwakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Zumbe Chohile nekale uko kale na kale!<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Akatenda na fyo dikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">na maelufu ya malingisha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Zumbe eza hakukile hakwe akalawa Sinai.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Wakwelaga kulanga na kuguha watahigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">wahokelaga majeleko kulawa kwe wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">hata kwe wantu wahitukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">vileke weye Chohile wikale uko.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Chohile mwambula ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">akuchinuila imizigo yetu chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Chohile ywetu ni Chohile akwambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">Zumbe Chohile nuyodu akuchikombola mwe file.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Chindedi, Chohile nahonde imitwi ya awankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">wadya wose wakutimila sila zawo zihiye za masa.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Zumbe alongaga, “Naniwavuze awankondo wenyu kulawa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">naniwavuze kulawa kwe imizumilizo ye ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />chani usunte iviga mwesakame ya awankondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">makuli yako yadye fungu dyawo.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Weye Chohile lukudidi lwako lo uhuda luwoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">ludongo lwa Chohile ywangu, seuta ywangu, kubula hakukile hakwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Kulongozi weyuko wachemi, kunyuma weyuko wavini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">hagatigati hana wachiche wakutowa wagoma.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Mtogoleni Chohile momdugano wa awantu wano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile nyuwe bunga dya Waizulaeli!<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Ywa nkongo ni Benjamini, mdodo mwa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">vikaheza vilongozi wa Yuda ne idibunga dyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">vikaheza wakulu wa Zabuloni na Nafutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Weye Chohile, lagisa inguvu yako nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">no ukulu wako ujeseze kwachausa chetu,<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />kulawa kwe Inyumba yako Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">uko maseuta nawakwigaile majeleko yawo.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Wakwahile wadya awanyama wakwila kwamani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">fyo dya mavulata na majeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">kubula awantu awo we izisi ntuhu wakwinke ntunyo na kodi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Wamwaganise awantu awo wakungisa nkondo!<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Wasigilwa naweze kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">wantu wa Kushi nawenule imikono yawo wakamvikila Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Nyuwe seuta za mweisi, mchemeleni Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">mchemeleni Zumbe nchemo za ntogozi,<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />mchemeleni ntogozi uyo akwikala mwe imbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">kukongela chikale na kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">Mwetegelezeni akabuma kwa mbumo mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Ivilikizani inguvu nkulu ya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">uyo alongoza mwa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">udahi wakwe wabula ko ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Chohile atisa umo akeza kulawa hakukile hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">uyo ni Chohile ywa Izulaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Awenka awantu wakwe nguvu na udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Atogolwe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo ya kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Weye Chohile, nambula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:1">Kwaviya mazi yabula mwesingo.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Nadidimila mwe mzumilizo wa ntagata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">hahana hantu he kujata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Sididimila mwe mzumilizo wa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">nakunkuswa ni mawimbi.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Sihwa chaka kwa kulombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">inkongomelo yangu ikaluka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">Meso yangu yana luzuyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">hakugoja weye Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Wantu wakunihiwa vya bule walozesa kujinka izifili momtwi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Wadya wakulonda wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">wanilongela mbuli zo udanti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Wanikunduganya nivuze chintu sibaile.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Weye Chohile kumanya uhezi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">masa yangu hayakwefisa kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Weye Zumbe, Chohile mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">usekuleka wakukwikiya msuhi wengile soni kwa chausa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">wakukuvikila wasekuhayuswa kwachausa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">weye Chohile ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Kwaviya sijijimiza soni kwa chausa chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">uhuza ugubika uso wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Sitenda saviya mjeni mwa walukolo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">sitenda mnyika mwa wantu we ikaya yangu mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Kuvika mwe Inyumba yako kwanoka saviya moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">mahuluto ya wadya wakukuhuluta weye yanigwela miye.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Nanyanyahala na kufunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">mna wantu wanihuluta mwe ivyo hudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />Umo navalaga majuniya nilomboleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">wantu niyo wanibela.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Wadya wakwila mwezinchili wanitila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">sihituka nchemo ya wakozi.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Mna miye nahulombeze weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">nizumila idilombezo dyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">mwe chipindi chako usagule nonihitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">nonambule kwa chausa cho ungi wako mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Kwaviya weye Chohile wambula wako ni wo ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Nambula, usekunileka nididimile mwe ntagata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">nambula mwe awo wakunihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">nihonya kulawa mwe mizumilizo ya amazi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Usekuleka nkulujumbu ya mazi inizole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">hegu nididimile mwe mizumilizo ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">hegu nigubikwe mwe bome.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Weye Chohile nihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">kwa wedi na ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">kwa mbazi zako zilozese nihitukila!<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Usekufisa uso wako kwa mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">sunguza kunihitula, kwaviya nimwe nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Soo hajihi vileke unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">nikombola kulawa kwa awankondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Kuvimanya ivyo hubelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">neivyo huhayuswa na kujelwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">wankondo wangu wose kuwamanya.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Mahuluto yaniholoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">naho sifa chevu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">Silonda ywa kunitondowaza simpatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">ywa kunihoza, mna siwone mndosa.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Umo nendile na sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">waninka nkande ijeligwe sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">umo nendile na nchilu wanijeila sungwi mwa amazi.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Ngasu zawo zitende mtego mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">chinyemi cha amalavyo yawo chitende tasi na kuwagwiza.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Watule ameso yawo vileke wasekuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">vuna imigongo yawo igonje ulo na ulo.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Walagise ukwihiwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">maya yako yatendese yawagwele.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Ahantu hawo hahituse mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">hasekutendeka na mntu yoyose akwikala mwa amahema yawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Kwaviya wawasulumiza wadya uwakantile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">wawongezeza nkwenje wadya ulumize.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Wakantile kwa mbuli zo uwavu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">usekuwaleka wehange mo uwambula wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Usa amazina yawo kulawa mwe ichitabu cho ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">wasekudongelekwa hamwenga na awantu wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Weye Chohile ninula kulanga unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">kwaviya miye sihwa naho nalumwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Nanimtogole Chohile kwa nchemo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">miye nanimtunye kwa ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Mbuli ino yamuwagila vitendese Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">ukaleka kumlaviza malavyo ya ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">ukaleka kumlaviza njeku njima.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Umo wachiwa wanawona izimbuli izo nawelelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">wadya wose wakumvikila Chohile nawajelwe moyo.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Zumbe Chohile aweva awantu mwe viya wakunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">naho hakujala wantu wakwe watahigwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Mtogoleni Chohile, nyuwe mbingu ne isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">bahali ne ivyumbe vyose vikwikala umo.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Kwaviya Chohile naikombole Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na kuizenga uhya imizi ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">Vikaheza awantu wakwe naweilisi na kwika wikazi wawo umo,<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />lweleko lwa awandima wakwe nawailisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">wadya wose wakudyunga idizina dyakwe nawekale umo.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Weye Chohile! Sunguza wize unambule!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:1">Weye Zumbe sunguza wize unambize.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Wadya wose wakunekambila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">chani wanikome wajelwe soni na kuhuza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">Wadya wakubesa nilumile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wavuzwe kunyuma kuno wahuza.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Wadya wakunisezenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">wakangawale na kuya kunyuma kwa chausa cha soni zawo.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Mna wadya wose wakukulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">welelwe na kutowa nchelegele kwachausa chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">Wakuunga uwambula wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">mazuwa yose wagambe, “Chohile ni mkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Miye ni mchiwa na msokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">weye Chohile sunguza unibase!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Ni weye wi mwambizi ywangu na mwambula ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">weye Zumbe Chohile sunguza usekukawa.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kudimwa na wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, sigulukila kwako unidime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">usekunileka mpwii ningile soni.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Kwaviya wimta kuwagila, nihonya na kunambiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">Nitegeleza na kunambula.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Utende luwe lwangu lwa kusumkila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">hantu nanisumkile chila nkanana, lagiza nambulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">kwaviya weye wi luwe lwangu na ngome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Chohile ywangu, nambula kulawa mwa awantu wehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">kulawa kwe manyakwili na wantu wehise.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Weye Chohile, msuhi wangu naika kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">sikwikiya lunda weye kukongela ubwanga wangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Sika lunda kwako kukongela kwelekwa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">kunidima kukongela idizuwa nelekwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">Mazuwa yose nahutogole weye.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Wikazi wangu utenda chilozo kwa wantu walozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">kwaviya weye wisumkilo dyangu ditogese.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Msi wose nahutogole weye na kutambalisa ung'azi wako.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Usekunileka mo udalahala wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">usekunasa hahungukilwa ni nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Kwaviya wankondo wangu waunga wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">wanisezenga na kudamanya mbuli zihiye.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Wagamba, “Chohile kamwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">elo mgulukileni mumgwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">kwaviya hahana ywa kumwambula.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Weye Chohile, usekutenda hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">Chohile ywangu sunguza wize unambize!<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Wose wakunihiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">wajelwe soni na kukomwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">Wase wakunga wanilumize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">wengile soni na kuhuza.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Mna mazuwa yose nanike msuhi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">nahutogole weye nkanana kwa nkanana.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Naniwagambile wantu uwagilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">msi wose nanilonge wambula wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">nanijendeleze kukutogola ulo na ulo.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">nahutogole kwa ntendwa zako nkulu udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">nanitambalise uwagilwa wako uwodu.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Weye Chohile kunihinya kukongela nichei mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">kubula dyelo natambalisa mpituko zako.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Haluse miye sidalahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">fili zangu zina fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">weye Chohile ywangu usekunasa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">Tenda hamwenga na miye umo hatambalisa inguvu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">no udahi wako mwe ivyeleko vyose vikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">ntendwa zako zo uwagilwa zibula kulanga kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Kudamanya mbuli zikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">hahali akwinga weye.<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Hata hegu kuhosa nkunto mwangu na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">mna nonitogeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">noninke ujima vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">noninule vituhu kulawa hasi he isanga.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Nojenyeze intunyo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">nonijele moyo vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Weye Chohile ywangu, nahutogole kwa malimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">kwachausa cho ukanuni wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">Kwa limba dyangu nahuchemele ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">weye Mkuka ichedu ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Nailonge kwa izwi kulu dya mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">umo hakuchemela ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">kwaviya kunambula.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Nanitamwile ntendwa zako zo uwagila msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">kwaviya wadya wose wongile wanilumize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">wajelwa soni na kuhuza.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s">Kumlombezeza seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Weye Chohile, mhinye seuta akantile kwa uwagilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">mwinke mwana seuta ukanuni wako,<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />vileke akantile wantu wako kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">na kulongoza wachiwa kwa ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Magulu nayegale kuchumilwa kwa awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">wagulu wameme ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Seuta awagombele wachiwa mgati mwe wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">ambize wana wa wasokezi na kubalanga wantu wabunyanyi.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Seuta nekalise wikazi mtali saviya zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">na saviya zuwa mwe ivyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Seuta atende saviya fula ikunya mwe nkonde ifyekulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">saviya mawaga yakunyunya mwe isanga.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Ukanuni naudindimale mowikazi wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">kuchumilwa nakutendeke saviya mnenge ukulangaza.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Alongoze kulawa kwebahali kubula kwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">kulawa komto wa Efulate kubula uhelo weisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Wantu wa amakabila yakwikala kwedijangwa nawamfikile madi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">wankondo wakwe nawename walambite malumbi.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Maseuta wa Talishishi na wa mpwani za hale nawamwigaile kodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">maseuta wa Sheba na Seba nawamwigaile majeleko.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Maseuta wose nawafike madi kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">wantu wose mweisi nawamsankanile.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Kwaviya amwambula msokezi akumlombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">na mchiwa hene ywa kumwambiza.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Nawafile mbazi wasokezi na wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">nambule wikazi wa wata nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Nawambule kulawa mwe wihi wa unyakwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">kwaviya wikazi wawo una yombe kulu kulongozi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Seuta ekalise wikazi mtali!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Ahokele majeleko ya zahabu kulawa Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">wantu wamlombezeze kwa Chohile mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na kumjimbika msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Isi yose yeleke mpuluzi zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">wagulu wameme ulozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">sayadya yeisi ya Lebanoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Wantu wa kwemizi watime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">saviya mani kwenkonde.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Zina dya seuta dikalise kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">ntogozi zakwe zikalise saviya zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Wantu wose mwe izisi ntuhu nawajimbikwe kwachausa chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">awo nawamwitange mjimbikwa.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">Uyo ichedu adamanya mbuli za mpituko.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Zina dyakwe dikukile ditogolwe kale na kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Ung'azi wakwe umemeze isi yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Taile! Taile.<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Uno nuwo udumo wa amalombezo ya Daudi mwana ywa Yese.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="s">Uwagilwa wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Chindedi Chohile ni ywedi kwa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">kwa wadya wata myoyo ikukile.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Mna miye hadodo nekobadike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">bwene nteleze,<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />kwaviya nahabesa kutenda sawadya wakweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">umo niwone kuchumilwa kwa wata wavu.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Wantu awo hawakupatwa ni masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">mili yawo idindimala naho itoga.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Hawana nkunto zikuwapata wantu watuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">naho hawakusulumba saviya wantu watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Elo, kweduvya kutenda enga mkufu mwe izisingo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">wevika nkumbizi saviya suche,<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />wavu walawa mwe imyoyo ya awo wajimbale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">wamalanya myalo ihiye mwe iziakuli zawo.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Wawatila wantu watuhu na kuwalonga vihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">weduvya wakapanga mizungu ihiye.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Wamlonga mbuli zihiye Chohile kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">kwa milosi yawo walongoza isi,<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />elo, wantu wa Chohile wawatimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">hawakuwona chochose chihiye mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">na kuzumila chila wakulonga.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Wagamba vino, Chohile namanye vivihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Togola Uyo Ekulanga Vitendese ana umanyi?<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Nivyo weli wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">mazuwa yose hawakuvisinya, wafanyanya kujenyeza ugoli.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Chindedi sekukiza umoyo wangu vya bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">sisunta imikono yangu vya bule sine mlema.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Msi wose natumbwazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">na chila mtondo nasulumizwa.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Hegu nalongile mbuli seizo wakulonga wantu wehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">nasiwahituka awelekwa wa awantu wako.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Umo najezaga kukombaganya izimbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">zitendesa ndala kwangu kuzikombaganya,<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />mna nize nite kwe Inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">aho niyo nabunkula uhelo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Chindedi nowaike hantu hakutela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">nowagwise hasi wabanikilwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Ivyo wakusunguza kubalangwa chipumpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">wabindwa pele kwa kutiswa,<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />awo wesaviya sozi ikutazuka kukacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">umo ukenuka weye Chohile nowatazule saviya sozi.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Umo umoyo wangu wendile na chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">ne iloho yangu ipatile usungu,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />nasitenda saviya hezi simanyize chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">nanisaviya mnyama du kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Mna nichei hamwenga na weye mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">kunitoza mkono wangu wa kulume.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Wanilongoza kwa ulangilizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">vileke mo udumo uningize mo ung'azi.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Ni yuhi mtuhu ninanaye kwembingu ukaleka weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Isi haina chochose hunga ukaleka weye.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Mwili no umoyo wangu vyadaha kudunduga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">mna weye Chohile wi nguvu yo umoyo wangu na fungu dyangu kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Kwaviya wadya wakwesunga hale na weye nawagile hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">nowakome wadya wose sawo wakanuni kwako.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Mna kwangu miye ni vyedi hatenda hajihi na Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">Zumbe Chohile, simtenda nuyo sumkilo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">miye nanitambalise ntendwa zakwe zose.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi isi yambulwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Weye Chohile, ni mbwani kuchidula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Togola nowafile maya awantu wako mwenye kale na kale?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Kumbuka awantu wako usagule mwenye chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">kabila wambule ditende ulisi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">Kumbuka ulugulu lwa Sayuni uko wekalaga.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Jinka mlanga mwa amahame yano ya chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">ubanasi wose uno uhoswa ni mnkondo mwa ahatu hakukile.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Wankondo wako wabumo uhuda mwe Inumb yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">waika izibendela zawo zitende vilagiso vyo uhuda.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Wadamanya saviya wantu wenule hoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">chani wakante imiti mwa amasaka yose.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Watula ivintu vyose vye izimbawo kwa hoya na nyundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">nyivi idolonywe vyedi.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Wahatimpa moto ahantu hako hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">wahajela uzavu ahantu hako ukuvikilwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Welongela mwe imyoyo yawo kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">“Nachiwabinde pele!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">Chila hantu akuvikilwa Chohile mwe isi wahoka.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Hachilagiswe vilagiso vya mpituko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">hahana muoni asigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">naho hahana hata yumwenga amanyize vino naviheze ini.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Weye Chohile, wankondo nawatile kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Togola wankondo nahulute idizina dyako kale na kale?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Ni mbwani walemela kuchambiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Nimbwani hukuchulusa umkono wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Ulavye kulawa uko uukunjize vileke uwakome<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Hata ivyo, Chohile ni seuta ywangu kukongela chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">wegala wambula mweisi.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Weye kuipanga ibahali haidi kwa udahi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">kutula imitwi ya makala makulu yakutisa mwe ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />ni weye uhondile imitwi ya Lewiatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">kumhitusa nkande ikudingwa ni vyumbe vya kwedijangwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Ni weye udamanye izisoko za amazi ne mito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">weye kunyaza imito yendile ikagulusa mazi heyekunyala.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Msi ni wako chilo nacho ni chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">kwika zuwa na mnenge.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Ni weye wikiye imhaka yose ye isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">kwika chizuwa na masika.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Zumbe Chohile, kumbuka izimbuli izo mnkondo akutile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">ivyo wantu wahezi wabeile idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Usekwinkiza ujima wa kasuwamanga kako kwa makala ya kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">usekujala ujima wa awachiwa wako wakusulumizwa kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Kumbuka idilagano dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">kwaviya chila hantu hechiza mweisi hamema wavu.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Usekuwaleka wakubunyanywa wajelwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">wadahize wachiwa na wasokezi watogole idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Chohile inuka ugombele ichindedi chako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">Kumbuka ivyo wahezi wakukuhuluta msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Usekubela ulwasu lwa awankondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">ngavungavu za awankondo wako zikujendeleza.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa wedi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Chohile, chakutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">chatambalisa ukulu we idizina dyako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">Na kutamwila mwe izintendwa zako nkulu.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Chohile kugamba, “Sisagula chipindi chesimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">naho nanikantile kwa uwagila.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Isi ikazingiza na vyose viyumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">ni miye huzegamiza izinguzo zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Siwagambila wadya wakweduvya waleke kweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">na wata wavu waleke kwefenya.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Msekwewona mwi wantu mkuwagilisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">hegu kulonga milosi ya kweduvya.”<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Hahana yoyose akulawa ulailo wa zuwa hegu uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">hegu kulawa kwedijangwa akudaha kumkweza mntu,<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />akukantila ni Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">wamwenga awaseleza hasi na awatuhu awakweza kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Zumbe Chohile katoza chikombe mo mkono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">chimemile divai ikulawa chivulo chihangane na maya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">Uyo achijida wantu wose wehi mweisi wanywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">kubula twentwe dyo udumo.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Mna miye nanitambalise mbuli zako kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">nanicheme ntogozi kwa Chohile ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Nguvu zose za hewene uwagila nazibinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">mna nguvu za wata uwagila nanizitogeze.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s">Chohile ni mhuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Chohile kamanyika mwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:1">zina dyakwe ni kulu mwa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Idihema dyakwe diyuko Salemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">wikazi wakwe ni Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Uko nuko afyoile imifulo ikupulika ya awankondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">ne izinchinga zawo ne izisime hamwenga na viziha vyose vya nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Weye wapulika kwa ung'azi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">Wisaviya mkankalu akulawa kwe magulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">yana ugoli wa wanyama nyika.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Wagomba nkondo wawo wakankalu watahigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">wagona ntongo fofofo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">hahana hata mgomba nkondo yumwenga akudaha kwinula imikono yakwe atowane.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Kwakuwakwahila kwako weye Chohile ywa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">falasi na amalingisha yawo vinyamala dwii.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Weye ichedu ni weye ywa kogohigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">Hahana akudaha kuchimala kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">umo weye wihiwe.<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Kutambalisa nkanto kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">isi niyo yogoha na kunyamala dwii,<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />umo weye Chohile winuke kukantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">kuwambula wadya wose waziligwe mweisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Kwaviya kuweihiwa kwako awantu nakukutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">wadya wachulupuke mwa amaya yako nawambulwe.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Mchintizeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenu viya mlongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">nyuwe mwihajihi mwinkeni majeleko Chohile akogofya,<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />uyo akanta loho za vilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">ogohigwa ni maseuta mwe izisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s">Kujelwa moyo chipindi za nkunto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Nasimwilila Chohile vileke anambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">nasiwilila vileke anive.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Nasimlonda Zumbe umo nendile mwe nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">nechilo sichulusa mikono hehena kusokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">mna moyo wangu ulemela kuhozwa.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Umo nongile nimkumbuke Chohile nasungumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">nafanyanya kubula iloho yangu yafa chevu.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Kuleka ameso yangu yasekugubika chilo chijima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">siwona nkama niyo nadunduga kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Sifanyanya mbuli zomboke chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">mihilimo ilozize ijinkile.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Nechilo nakumbukaga nchemo zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">nafanyanya mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">neuza mwenye mwe iloho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />“Togola! Chohile nachilemele suwe kale na kale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">Togola hachitendele yedi vituhu?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Ungi wakwe hewine udumo usila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Togola hachintize vituhu ndagano yakwe alongaga?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Togola Chohile kajala mbazi zakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">Kachinda mbazi zakwe kwachausa cha amaya yakwe?”<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Vikaheza niyo nafanyanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">“Chino nicho chikunilumiza umoyo wangu, ni kugamba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Chohile Mkulu kahituka hakuchitwndela chintu kwachausa chetu!”<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Nanikumbuke ntendwa za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">heye nanikumbuke mpituko zako udamanye chikale.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Nanizifanyanye izindima zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">na kulungumula izintendwa zako zikulise.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Chila chintu udamanye weye Chohile chikuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">Ni yuhi mnungu mkulu akwinga weye Chohile ywetu?<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Weye wi Chohile ukudamanya mpituko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">ukulagisa udahi wako mwa awantu we izisi ntuhu.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />Kwa udahi wako kuwambula awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">lweleko lwa Yakobo na lweleko lwa Yusufu.<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Mazi yeze yakuwone weye Chohile niyo yogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">ne imizumilizo ye ibahali niyo yazingiza.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Maingu niyo yanyesa fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">izimbingu niyo zalavya mwemwe na milulumo ya mbaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">misale ya mamuli yapulika chila ntendele.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Milulumo ye izimbaula zako zivika mwe nkung'unto ya luzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">lumwemwe lupulika mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">isi niyo yazingiza na kusingisika.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Sila yako ijinkila mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">kujinkila mwe mizumilizo ya mazi yalozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">hataivyo lwayo lwako haluwoneke.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Kuwalongoza awantu wako saviya bunga dya ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">kwa ulongozi wa Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s">Chohile na wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Nyuwe wantu wangu, tegelezani amahinyo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">tegelezani imilosi hulonga.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Nanilonge kwa milosi ya lufyambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">nanilonge mbuli zefisize, mbuli za chikale,<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />mbuli chivile na kuzimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">ziya chigambilwe ni wakale wetu.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Mbuli izo hachiwafise wenetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">nachiwagambile awelekwa we icheleko chikwiza ntendwa zikuwagila ntogozi za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">udahi wakwe na mpituko adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Kalavya malagizo kwa awantu wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">na sigilizi kwa awelekwa wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">Kawalagiza awakale wetu wawahinye awana wawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />chani cheleko chikwiza chizimanye, hamwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">na awana wakunga welekwe, vileke awo nawo wawagambile awana wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Mwe isila iyo nawaike msuhi wawo kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">vileke wasekujala viya adamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">mna mazuwa yose watimile izisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Ivyo hawaligane na wakele wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">awo wendaga hewekwiva na wankani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">moyo yawo yendaga midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">awo loho zawo hezendaga na ukanuni kwa Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">hatahegu wendaga na mita na mifulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">wasumkaga zuwa dya nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Hawatozize idilagano dya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">walemela kutimila izisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Wajala ayo adamanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">mpituko wawone akadamanya.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Umo Chohile akadamanya mpituko wakale wawo wawona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">uko kwe idibwandasi dya Soani mweisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Katula ibahali haidi na kuwombosa wajinke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">kayatenda amazi yachimale lujunju saviya chiwambaza.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Nomsi kawalongoza kwa ingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">na nechilo kawalongoza kwa lumuli lwa moto.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Katula luwe kwedijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">na kuwenka mazi yalozize saviya bahali.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Kahosa soko za mazi zilawe mwe luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">na kulavya mazi yalozize saviya mto.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Mna wajendeleza kumdamanyiza mbuli za masa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">uko kwedijangwa wamhituka Uyo Ekulanga Vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Wamdamanyiza kasidi wamjeza Chohile mwe imyoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">wakaunga nkande ziya wakunga wowo.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Walonga milosi mwa Zumbe Chohile wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">“Togola, Chohile adaha kuchinka nkande kweidijangwa?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Eze atowe uluwe mazi niyo yalawisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">wamto niyo waguluka mazi yalozize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">Mna togola adaha kuchinka nkande chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">na nyama suwe wantu wakwe?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Elo, Chohile eze aweve, niyo ehiwa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">kawaselezeza moto uwatikimye awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">maya yakwe yawemukila Waizulaeli,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />kwaviya nendile hawana uzumizi kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">hegu kwikiya msuhi wambulwa wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Hata ivyo kalagiza maingu ya kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">niyo avugula izinyivi za kwembingu,<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />kawalagaziza nkande ikwitangwa mana vileke wantu wadye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">kawenka ngano ya kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Ivyo, wantu wadya mkate wa wandima wa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">kawegaila nkande ikudaha kuwegusa.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Kahosa nkung'unto kulawa ulailo wa zuwa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">na kulongoza nkung'unto ya kwamwenyemzi kwa udahi wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />na awantu wakwe kawaselezeza nyama ilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">wadege walozize enga msanga wa mpwani.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Chohile katenda awadege wagwele mgati mwe izinkambi zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">kuzunguluka amahema yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Wantu wadya na kusigaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">kwaviya kawenka chiya nawakabesa.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Mna umo hewenati kubinda ukudya chiya nawakabesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">wachei kutafuna mwe imilomo yawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />maya ya Chohile niyo yawemukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">vyaleka awakoma wadya wendaga na nguvu kujinka awatuhu mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">kawagwisa hasi awabwanga wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Hamwenga ne izimbuli zose izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">wajendeleza kudamanya mbuli za masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">naho hawazumile izintendwa zakwe za mpituko.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Elo, niyo ahosa amazuwa yawo yasile saviya muye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">ne imihilimo yawo mwe nkama ikutisa.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Umo Chohile ahosaga awamwenga wawo wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">wasigaile wamhitukila, weila na kulombeza kwa kuhikiliza.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Wakumbukaga kugamba Chohile ni luwe lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">kugamba Chohile Ekulanga Vitendese endaga mwambula ywawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Mna imilosi yawo yose yendaga ya udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">walonga mbuli zo udanti,<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />myoyo yawo yendaga haichumile kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">naho wendaga sawo wakanuni mwe idilagano dya wowo na Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Mna, endaga na mbazi, kawalekeila uwihi wawo naho hawakomile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">Chila nkanana kachinda amaya yakwe naho hasongile amaya yakwe yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Akumbukaga kugamba awo ni wantu du wata kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">saviya mpeho ikujinka heikuya vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Nkanana nyingahi wakale wetu wamhituka Chohile kwedijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">nkanana nyingahi wamjela chinyulu kwenyika!<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Wamjezaga Chohile nkanana zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">wamjelaga maya Uyo Mkuka ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Wajala udahi wakwe mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">ne idizuwa diya awakombolaga kulawa mwa awankondo wawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />zuwa alagise vilagiso vyakwe vya kwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">uko kwedibwandasi dya Soani mweisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Kahitula amazi mwe imito yawo yatenda sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">Wamisili niyo waswesa mazi ya kunywa.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Awegailega mafyo ya si niyo yawaluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">na majula yavavagala mwe isi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Niyo egala sije zidye viya wahandile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">na fyasa kubalanga izinkonde zawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Kabalanga imizabibu yawo kwa fula ya mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">ne imikuyu yawo kwa fula ihangane na mabalafu.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Ng'ombe zawo kazileka zinyelwe ni fula ya mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">amabunga ya awanyama wawo kayatowa kwa lumwemwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Kawemukila kwa ukali wa maya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">kewemukila maya, chinyulu na unkondo hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">saviya bunga dya wandima wa kwembingu wakubalanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Kayalekeila amaya yakwe yajendeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">hawenegeze na file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">mna kawakoma kwa unyonje wa tauni.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Akomaga awelekwa wa nkongo wose wa chilume mweisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">malimbulo ye izinguvu zawo zo ubwanga mwa amahema ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Akaheza niyo awasamiza enga ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">kawalongoza kwedijangwa saviya fyo dya ludimo.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Kawalongoza mpeho, naho hawogehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">mna ibahali iwafinangiza awankondo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Elo, niyo awegala kubula komhaka we isi yakwe ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">kolugulu ludya atahile mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Niyo awabalaza awantu we izisi ntuhu kulongozi kwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">na kuwasangila izisi zawo zitende ulisi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">kawasangila isi amakabila ya Izulaeli na kuwaika mo wikazi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Mna wowo niyo wamjeza Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">na kumhituka Uyo Ekulanga Vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">naho hawazitimile izisigilizi zakwe,<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />mna wahitukilaga saviya wendaga wakale wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">hawendaga wachumi hegu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">niyo wenga saviya uta uvunike hewikwambiza chintu.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Wamjela maya Chohile kwa muntu mwawo mwinukile mwa kuvikila milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">wamwihiza kwa amatukulu yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Chohile eze aweve niyo ehiwa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">elo niyo awalemela awantu wakwe pwilili.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Niyo adileka idihema dyakwe komzi wa Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">uko aikaga wikazi hamwenga na suwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Niyo adigala ko utumwa Idishanduku dye izinguvu zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">ung'azi wakwe mwe imikono ya awankondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Kaweihiwa awantu wakwe mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">niyo awalavya wakomwe kwa mabamba.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Wabwanga wawo watikimya ni moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">na wachiche wawo waswesa ywa kuwasola.<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Walavyantambiko wawo wakomagwa kwa mabamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">mna wavyele wawo wasize hawajezize kwila.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Aho, Zumbe niyo enuke saviya mntu akusetuka mwe ntongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">enga mkankalu asangalazwe ni divai.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Awatowaga na kuwahuda awankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">niyo awajela mwe soni za kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Mna kawalemela awelekwa wa Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">hadisagule idikabila dya Efulaimu,<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />mna kasagula idikabila dya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">Ulugulu lwa Sayuni ulo aungile.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Kazenga ahantu hakwe hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">saviya aho akwikala uko kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">engaviya atogeze isi kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Niyo amsagula Daudi mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">na kumlavya mwe ndima ya kudima ngoto,<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />Kamlavya mwe ndima ya kudima ngoto na wana ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">vileke atende na ndima ya kudima awantu wa Yakobo wantu wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">Awadime Izulaeli wantu wa Zumbe Chohile mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Dadi niyo awadima kwa uchumi wa moyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">na kuwalongoza kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya mbazi mwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Chohile, wantu hewekumanyize wayebunga isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">wajela uzavu mwe Inyumba yako ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">na kuutenda mahame umzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Ivimba vya awantu wako wavileka vitende nkande ya magushu ya mo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">imili ya awakuka wako itende nkande ya makala ya kumbago.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Wetila isame yawo saviya mazi komzi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">wagonezwa umo naho hahana ywa kuwahamba.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Chitenda chintu cha soni mwa wetu wakuchizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">wachibela na kuchitendela utilizi.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Weye Zumbe, mbuli zino zaheza ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Togola nowihiwe kale na kale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Maya yako nayake saviya moto kubula ini?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Maya yako yawemukile awantu we izisi ntuhu hewekumanyize weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">mwe iziseuta hewedimanyize idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />Kwaviya wawakoma awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">naho waibalanga isi yako.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Usekuchikantila kwa chausa cha wavu wa wakale wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">Mbazi zako zisunguze kuchizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">kwaviya chife chevu vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Chohile Mwambula ywetu chambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwachausa cho ukuka we idizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">chihonye na kuchilekeila amasa yetu.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Kwambwani watu mwe izisi ntuhu wagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">“Chohile ywenyu ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Chidahize chiwone ukawalihiza awantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">ukomi wa awandima wako.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Tegeleza indilo ya wadya wafungigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">na kwa udahi wako mkulu wafungule wadya wakantilwe kukomwa.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Zumbe walihize chikoda awantu we mnkanda mwetu nkanana mfungate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">kwa chausa cha amahuluto wakuhulute weye Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Aho, suwe awantu wako, ngoto ukudima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">nachikutogole kale na kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">Ntogozi zako nachizitamwile cheleko kwa cheleko.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya kuhonywa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Mdimi ywa Izulaeli, tega gutwi dyako, ukuwalongoza welekwa wa Yusufu enga bunga dya ngoto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">Weye ukwikala mlanga mwe vyumbe vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi, chilangazize,<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />kulongozi kwa amakabila ya Efulaimu na Benjamini na Manase.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">Chilagise izinguvu zako wize uchambule.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Chohile, chivuzize udahi wa nkongo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">Chilagise mbazi zako, vileke chambulwe!<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">kubula ini nofile maya amalombezo ya awantu wako?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Mesozi kuyatenda nayo inkande yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">kuchinywesa mesozi yalozize.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Kuchitenda chibelwe niwantu we mjihi na suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">wankondo wetu wachitila.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose, chivuzize udahi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">Chilagise mbazi zako vileke chambulwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Kuleta mzabibu kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">kuwabalaza awantu we izisi ntuhu niyo wauhanda mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Kufyekula nkonde kwachausa chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">maizi yakwe niyo yadindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">niyo watantamka mwe isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Magulu nayagubikwa kwe ichizuli chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">amatambi yakwe niyo yagubika imiti ye mielezi mikulu.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Matambi yakwe yatima kubula kwebahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">suko yakwe ibula Komto.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Ni mbwani kubogozola iviwambaza vyakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">Wose wakujinka watunde izizabibu zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Maguluwe mbago yaubalanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">na wanyama wa kwezinkonde wedila du.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Weye Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose chiwiye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">Chikaule kuno hasi kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">so uchambule tunduliya umzabibu wako,<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />wamile umosa uhandile kwa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">mwana chilume uleile kwachausa chako mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Mzabibu ukantwa na kuitimpwa moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">wasinye awankondo chimayamaya na kwabalanga!<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Mkono wako wikile mlanga mwa yudya mntu usagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">uyo umjeile nguvu kwachausa chako mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Suwe hachijeze kuya kunyuma kukwasa weye vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">chinke ujima, suwe nachikutogole.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">chisinye kwa wedi wako, vileke chambulwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ngasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Mchemeleni kwa chinyemi Chohile eli nguvu yetu, uyo akuchidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:1">mchemeleni ntogozi Chohile ywa Yakobo!<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Chemani, towani miluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">towani magunda na mazeze kwa lungole lwedi.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Towani magunda ya mahembe ya ndolome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">umo mwezi ukatontomoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">na umo ukatenda mkungilo mwe idizuwa dye ingasu yetu,<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />ino ni sigilizi kwa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">lagizo dya Chohile ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Awalagizaga awantu wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">umo wamlawaga mweisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">uko chevaga izwi hechidikombaganye,<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />“Susa imizigo mwa amayega yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">siwausizani ntangulu zizamile mwe imikono yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Mwe izinkunto zako wanitangaga miye niyo nakwambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nakuhitulaga mwe maingu yana mlulumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nakujezaga kwa amazi ya Meliba.<verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Nyuwe wantu wangu, tegelezani miye naniwafundeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">navitende vyedi hegu mwanitegeleze nyuwe Waizulaeli!<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Asekutendeka mwako mnungu mtuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">msekuvikila mnungu ywa chijeni.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Miye ni Zumbe, Chohile ywako hulavize kweisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">Gubula umlomo wako miye nahwankize.”<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />“Mna awantu wangu hawaungaga kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Waizulaeli hawakunitunya miye.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Elo, niyo nawaleka wasigane no unkani wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">watimile viya wakunga wenye.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Navitende vyedi hegu awantu wangu wanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">hegu awantu wangu watimile izisila zangu,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />nasisunguza kuwahuda awankondo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">nasichulusa umkono wangu kuwatowa wadya wakuwabunyanya.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Wadya wakumwiihiwa Zumbe Chohile nawawanyanyahale kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">nkanto yawo naitende ya kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Mna nyuwe Waizulaeli namliswe ngano ntana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">na kuwegusani kwa uchi ukulawa mwe luwe.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s">Chohile nuyo chilongozi Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Chohile achimaila ichitala chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">akantila he mdugano wa milungu.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Namkantile kwa kubunyanya kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">Na kulagisa kuwahingiza wantu wehiye?<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Wagombeleni wasokezi na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">tunduliyani uwagilwa wa wachiwa na wakubunyanywa.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Mwambuleni msokezi na mchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">wakomboleni mwe imikono ya wantu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Hawamanyize chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">hawakukombaganya chochose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">Wajenda mwe chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">vyegamo vye isi vyose visingisika.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Miye sigamba, “Nyuwe mwi milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">nyuwe nyose mwi wana wa Chohile Ekulanga Vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Mna nambanike saviya wakubanika wantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">wikazi wenyu naudume saviya sekulu mtuhu yoyose.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Chohile, uchimale uikantile isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">kwaviya izisi zose ni ugoli wako.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo mwe wankondo wa Izulaeli wahudwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Chohile usekunyamala dwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:1">usekunyamala weye Chohile naho usekutongomala.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Kaula! Wankondo wako wajesa ngavungavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">wadya wakukwiihiwa wenuila imitwi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Wadamanya mizungu mwa awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">walafya mwa wadya ukungisa.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Wagamba, “Soni chiwakome awantu we isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">chani idizina dya Izulaeli disekukumbukwa vituhu.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Wevana kwa moyo umwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">waika cheliso mwako,<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />wantu Waedomu na Waishimaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">na Wamoabu na Wahagali,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Wagebeli na Waamoni na Waamaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">na Wafilisiti hamwenga na wantu wa Tilo.<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Iviya Wasiliya walungana nawo vileke wawambize awelekwa wa Lutu.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Wadamanye saviya uwadamamanye awantu wa Midiani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">nasaviya uwatendile Sisela na Yabini komto wa Kishoni,<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />awo wakomigwe uko Endoli niyo watenda saviya mazagalika mwe isanga.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Watende amasekulu wawo saviya uwatendile Olebu na Zebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">wahude ivilongozi wawo saviya uwahudile Zeba na Zalumuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />awo wagambaga, “Nachiitahe isi ya Chohile itondowale.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Chohile ywangu, wafilise saviya malumbi ya luzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">saviya makanka yakufiliswa ni mpeho.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Saviya moto ukutikimya mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">hegu saviya myali ya moto ikoka magulu,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />nivyo nowabalaze awo kwa nkung'unto yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">na kuwasokeza kwa nkomano yako.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Gubika izinyuso zawo kwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">chani wamanye izinguvu zako weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Awo wajelwe soni na kuhayuswa kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">awo wakomwe kwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Wamanye kugamba weye, ukwitangwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">ni weye ichedu wi Kulanga Vitendese mweisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s">Nkina ya kuvika mwe Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:1">wikazi wako ni mtana vitendese!<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Miye nahaungisa nitendeke umo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">Najelejeza nitende mwe izinyuwa ze Inyumba yako weye Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">Umoyo wangu no umwili wangu vyamwilila Chohile Mta Ujima.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Hata nofi zizenga masasa mwe Inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">wambayumbayu wazenga masasa ya kuwanguila machinda yawo hajihi ne imazabahu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">Weye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">seuta na Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Wajimbikwa wadya wakwikala mwe Inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">mazuwa yose wakuchemela weye ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Wajimbikwa wadya izinguvu zawo zikwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">ne izisila zikuhinga Sayuni zimwe imyoyo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Wakajinka mwe idikolongo dinyaile dya Baka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">dyahitukila kutenda na soko za mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">iviya fula za vuli zadimemeza kwa maloko.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Wajendeleza kukula na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">kubula chila yumwenga abule kulongozi kwa Chohile uko Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">unive amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">nitegela gutwi weye Chohile ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">mjimbike seuta ywetu, seuta usagule.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Zuwa dimwenga kwikala mwe Inyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">ni vyedi kujinka mazuwa elufu imwenga hantu hatuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">vyawagile nitende mwamizi mwe izinyuwa ze Inyumba ya Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">ukaleka kwikala mwe mahema ya watu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ni mwamizi ywetu seuta akuchilangaziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">Zumbe alavya wedi na ntunyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">hahana chintu chedi akuwanyima wadya hewene mlema.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">kajimbikwa yudya akwika msuhi mwako.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo isi ichumilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Zumbe Chohile walagisaga wedi mwe isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">wamvuzizaga Yakobo ujimbikwa wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Walekeilaga uwavu wa awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">na kugubika amasa yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Waikaga amaya yako yose hankanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">naho kuhituka na kuleka ukali wo ukwihiwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Chohile mwambula ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">uchiwiye vituhu, usa amaya yako mwetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Togola, nochihiwe kale na kale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Maya yako nayajendeleze mwe ivyeleko vyose?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Chwiye vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">suwe awantu wako nachikutogole.<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Chilagise ungi wako hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">Weye Zumbe Chohile, chinke wambulwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Nanitegeleze chiya akulonga Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">kwaviya alongaga mbuli ya utondowazi kwa awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">uneva hawanawiye uhezi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Chindedi wambula wakwe wihajihi na wadya wakumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">vileke ung'azi wakwe usigaile mwe isi yetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Ungi na ukanuni vyadugana hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">uwagilwa na utondowazi vyahampikana.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Ukanuni nausuke kulawa mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">uwagilwa wa Chohile nausele hasi kulawa kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Heye, Chohile nachinke chintu chedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">isi yetu nailavye ulozo ulozese.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Uwagilwa naulongole kulongozi kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">na kudamanya sila kwachausa che izinkacho zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Zumbe Chohile nitegela gutwi, unihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">kwaviya miye ni mchiwa na msokezi.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Dima uwikazi wangu, kwaviya seika kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">weye wi Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">mwambule mndima ywako akukwiya msuhi.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Zumbe Chohile, niwonela mbazi miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">kwaviya nakwitanga msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Mwinke mndima ywako chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">kwaviya kwako weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">malombezo yangu nayaonya kwako.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Zumbe Chohile, weye wi ywedi na mta kulekeila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">kumema ungi kwa wadya wose wakukwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Zumbe Chohile, tega gutwi wive amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">tegeleza indilo yangu uniwonele mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Mwe idizuwa dye izinkuto zangu nahwitange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">kwaviya weye nonihitule.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Zumbe Chohile, hagatigati he milungu hahana akwinga weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">hahana ntendwa za kuliganywa ne izako.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Zumbe Chohile, wantu wose umbile mwe izisi naweze kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">na kuvika kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">nawaditunye idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Kwaviya weye wi mkulu naho nodamanye mbuli za kwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">weye ichedu ni weye Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Zumbe Chohile, nihinya isila yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">nami nanijende mwe ichindedi chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">ninka moyo hewikukanganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">vileke nidahe kukuvikila.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Zumbe, Chohile ywangu nahutogole kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">nanitambalise idizina dyako kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Kwaviya ungi wako ukulisa kwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">Kunambula kulawa kwe idibome hedine uhelo wakugona wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Zumbe Chohile, wata kweduvya wanebunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">bunga dya wantu manyakwili dyaunga dinikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">wantu hewe kukutunya weye.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Mna weye Zumbe, wi Chohile ywa mbazi na wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">hwi mhufu ywa kwihiwa, mna kumema ungi na ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Nihitukila naho unifile mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">ninka nguvu naho nambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">umwambule mwana ywa msuntaviya ywako.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Ninka chilagiso cha wedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">chani wankondo wangu wachiwone vileke wengile soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">kwaviya Weye Zumbe Chohile kunambiza na kunitondowaza.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi za Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Zumbe Chohile kazenga mzi wakwe mwe magulu yakukile,<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Zumbe Chohile azunga izinchili za Sayuni kujinka wikazi wose wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Wantu walonga mbuli zikukile mwako, Weye mzi wa Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />“Nanike lukumbusa lwa Lahabu na Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">mwa wadya wanimanyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">wantu wa Filisiti na Tilo na Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">haheza nanigambe yuno elekagwa muno.”<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Mwa Sayuni wantu nawalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">“Yuno na yudya welekagwa umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">na Uyo Ekulanga Vitendese mwenye namtogeze.”<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Zumbe Chohile nawandike ludongo lwa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">na kuwahanganya umo kugamba welekwa momzi wa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Umo wakatowa magunda nawagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">“Mo umzi wa Sayuni numo mna inkongelo yo kujimbikwa kwangu.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo ya kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Zumbe Chohile, mwambula ywangu msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">na chilo chose naila kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Malombezo yangu yabule kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">tega gutwi wive indilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Kwaviya nna nkunto zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">ujima wangu wihajihi na kubanika.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Miye nisaviya na wadya wehaguhi na kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">sitenda saviya msokezi hena nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Sikwa hamwenga na wadya wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">saviya wachinjigwe wagonile mwe izimbnila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">awo hukuwakumbuka vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">awo wasentigwe hale na weye.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Kunidula mwe bome tali vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">mwe lwina lwa ziza ditendese.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Uzami wa amaya yako utendesa mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">kunisulumiza kwa mawimbi ya kwihiwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Kunisente na wambuya zangu wa hajihi kujinka wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">kunitenda ihizo mwawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">Sigwizwa sikudaha kuchupuluka,<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />meso yangu yengila luzuyu lwa chinyulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">Zumbe Chohile, nakwitanga chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">kuno sichulusa imikono yangu kwako nalombeza.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Togola, weye walagisa mpituko zako mwe wantu wabanike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Togola, wadya wafile wadaha kwinuka na kukutogola?<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Togola, ungi wako watambaliswa mwe mbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">hegu ukanuni wako hantu ho ubanasi?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Togola, mpituko zako nayamanyike hantu he chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">hegu ntendwa zako zo uwagilwa mwe isi ijaligwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Mna miye nakwilila weye, Weye Zumbe Chohile ywangu unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">chila mtondo nalombeza kwako.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Zumbe Chohile, ni mbwani wanilemela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">na kuhitukila hale na miye?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Kukongela ubwanga wangu sisulumizwa kenga nibanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">singilwa ni nkama zako sifa chevu.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Maya yako yazamisa mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">kunebunga kwako kukutisa kunibalanga,<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />msi wose yanitandama saviya nkulujumbu ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">yanifinankiza vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Kunusiza wambuya zangu na wadya hungisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">chiza chitenda nuyo mbuyangu ywa hajihi kujinka wose.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo isi ikatenda mwe nkunto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Zumbe Chohile, nanicheme mwe ungi wako mkulu kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">kwa mlomo wangu nanivilikize ukanuni wako umanyike mwe ivyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Simanya kugamba ungi wako wekala chipindi chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">kugamba ukanuni wako naubunkulwe kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Weye walongaga, “Sidamanya lagano na yudya mntu nisagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">simwelisiza mndima ywangu Daudi,<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />‘Nanitogeze icheleko chako kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">na kutogeza useuta wako mwe ivyeleko vyose.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Zumbe Chohile, izimbingu zatogola mpituko zako ne ivintu umbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">iviya na ukanuni wako, mwe mdugano wa wakanuni.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Kwaviya ni yuhi kulanga kwe imbiingu akudaha kuliganywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">na Zumbe Chohile? Mwe ivyumbe vyose vya kwembingu hahana chikwinga weye Zumbe Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />mwe mdugano wa wakanuni Chohile ogoheswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">ogofya kujinka vyose vikumzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Zumbe Chohile, Mta Nguvu Zose, ni yuhi esaweye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">Weye Zumbe Chohile, weye wi mta nguvu na ukanuni wako wakuzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Weye walongoza bahali ikujumbwanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">umo amawimbi yakwe yakayuganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">weye wayanyamaza.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Ni weye umhondile zoka Lahabu niyo atenda saviya mntu akomigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">kwa udahi wako mkulu kuwahuda awankondo wako.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Imbingu ni yako, isi nayo ni yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">kumba isi hamwenga na vyose viyumo.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Waumbaga chenya na kwamwenyemzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">Magulu ya Toboli na Helimoni yachemela idizina dyako kwa chinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Udahi wako ni mkulu, udahi wako una nguvu zitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">udahi wako ukulilisa.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Uchindedi na uwagilwa ni chegamo cho ulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">mbazi na ukanuni vyakulongoila.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Ujimbiko wi mwa wadya wahinile kukutogola kwa chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">wakujenda mo ung'azi wako, Weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Welelwa msi wose kwachausa che idizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">na kwa uwagila wako wachumilwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Kwaviya weye wi ung'azi na nguvu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">kwa wedi wako kuchitenda wahuda.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Heye, nchinga yetu ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">seuta ywetu kalawa kwako weye Mkuka ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagano ya Chohile kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Mwe ichikale walongaga mwe uwoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">mwa awantu wako wakukile, ukagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">“Simwinka nguvu mkankalu, simkweza mbwanga mgakati mwa wantu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Mndima ywangu Daudi simtenda seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">simjela mavuta yangu yakukile.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Mkono wangu naumdahize mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">nguvu zangu nazimtende atoge.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Wankondo wakwe hawadahe kumdanta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">hahana mntu mwavu akunga amzile.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Naniwahonde awankondo wakwe kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">na kuwakoma wadya wakumsulumiza.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Ukanuni wangu uchintile nautende hamwenga naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">mazuwa yose nanimtende mhuda.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Useuta wakwe naniwangamule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">kulawa kwe ibahali kubula kwe imito.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Uyo nanigambe, ‘Weye wi Tate na Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">Luwe lwa Wambula wangu.’<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Nami nanimsagule atende mwelekwa ywangu ywa nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">mkulu kujinka maseuta wose mweisi.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Mazuwa yose nanike ungi wangu kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">ne idilagano dyangu kwakwe naditoge kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Nanijenyeze ulweleko lwakwe kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">welekwa wakwe nawatende maseuta mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />“Mna, hegu awelekwa wakwe wanaleka izisigilizi zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">hawanatimile imiko yangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />uneva wanabalanga amalagizo yangu na hawatozize imiko yangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />aho naniwakantile amasa yawo kwa nkome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">naniwatowe kwachausa cho ubanasi wawo,<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />mna sanuse ungi wangu kwa Daudi hegu kuhituila ukanuni wangu utende udanti.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Miye sanileke kudamanya viya chivane, naho sanihitu chiya imilomo yangu ilongile.”<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />“Selisa nkanana imwenga du kwa ukuka wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">nami sanimgambile Daudi udanti,<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />awelekwa wakwe nawajendeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">ne ichigoda chakwe cho useuta nachikalise kulongozi kwangu saviya zuwa,<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />nachidindimale kale na kale saviya mnenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">mukuzi mkanuni ko ulanga.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndilo ya haluse</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Mna weye kumwihiwa vitendese seuta ywako asagulwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">kumbela na kumlemela.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Kuleka viya chivane na miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">naho kukijela uzavu ichilemba mwe malumbi.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Kubogozola iviwambaza vyo umzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">ne izingome zakwe zose kuzihitusa mahame.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Wantu wose wakujinka hajihi naye wampakula ugoli wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">katenda mta kubelwa ni wantu wakwikala hajiha naye.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Kuwenka uhuda awankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">wadya wose wakumsulumiza kuwatenda welelwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Iviziha vyakwe kuvitenda mafilifinte,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">naho humwinkile wambizi mwe nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Ugoli wakwe kuusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">ichigoda chakwe cho useuta kuchigwisa hasi.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Kuhunguza amazuwa yakwe yo ubwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">kumgubika soni.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malombolezo ya ukombolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Zumbe Chohile, nowefise kale na kale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Maya yako nayake saviya moto kubula ini?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Zumbe Chohile kumbuka ujihi wo wikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">mntu kumumba vyabule!<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Ni yuhi akudaha kwikala asekubanika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">Ni yuhi akudaha kweambula mwenye mwe nguvu za mbila?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Zumbe Chohile, ungi wako we nkongo wikuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">uwo mo ukanuni wako wamwelisizaga Daudi?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Zumbe kumbuka ivyo mndima ywako asezengwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">ivyo hujijimiza mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">mahuluto ya wantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Zumbe Chohile, wankondo wako wamhuluta seuta ywako usagule!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">Wambela yudya uhakile mavuta hohose naite.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile kale na kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">Taile! Taile!<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya Musa mndima ywa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Zumbe Chohile, weye kutenda hantu hetu ha kwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">mwe ivyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Hwinati kumba amagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">hegu kumba isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">kukongela chikale ni weye Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Wawagamba wantu, “Uya mwa amalumbi”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">wantu chatenda malumbi.<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Kwaviya kwako mihilimo elufu imwenga ni saviya zuwa dimwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">dyomboke kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">naho ni saviya ncheleza ya chilo.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Wawazola wantu na nkulujumbu ya file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">awo wenga saviya sozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">Chisaviya maluwa yakubwalika mtondo,<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />hata hegu mtondo yabwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">chisingi yanyuluka.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Chikomwa kwachausa cha amaya yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">Chazingiza kwa kwihiwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Amasa yetu kuyaika kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">masa yetu ya chinyele wadaha kuyawona.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Wikazi wetu mazuwa yose yamema maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">chabinda imihilimo yetu kwa kulomboleza.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Mazuwa yetu yo ujima ni mihilimo milongo mfungate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">unevu china nguvu ni mihilimo milongo mnane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">mna iyo ni ya kusulumba na nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">yasunguza kujinka, suwe naswi chajinka.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Amanyize inguvu ya amaya yako ni yuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Kwaviya maya yako ni makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">saviya nkama chikungwa chikogohe.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Chihinye kuwaza amazuwa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">vileke chipate moyo wa ubala.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Zumbe Chohile, chiwonele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">maya yako nayasile ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Wafile mbazi awandima wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Chimemeze ungi wako hewine udumo chila mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">vileke chidahe kuchema kwa mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">na kwelelwa mazuwa yetu yose.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Chinke mbwedo seiviya viligane na amazuwa chisulumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">seiviya kuligana ne imihilimo chitumbwazike.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Ntwendwa zako ziwoneke mwa awandima wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">ung'azi wako kwa awana wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Wedi wa Zumbe Chohile ywetu utende mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">udindimaze izindima ze imikono yetu.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s">Chohile ni mwamizi ywetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Akwikala hantu hatondowale hakwe Uyo Ekulanga Vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">nasigaile mwe kudimwa ni Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose,<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />nanidahe kumgamba, “Weye wi mwamizi ywangu ne ingome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">Chohile ywangu, hwikiya msuhi wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Kwaviya uyo nanambule mwe mtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">na manyonje yehise.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Nakugubike kwa mazoya yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">hasi ha amawawa yakwenopate sumkilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">ukanuni wakwe nautende nchinga na ngome yako.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Nechilo hawogohe kutiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">hegu kwebungwa kwa chipumpa nomsi,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />hawogohe buli dikulaila nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">hegu file ikulaila nomsi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Hata hegu wantu elufu imwenga wanagwela hampezo hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">mlongo elufu mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">mna weye hawakulumize.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Weye nokaule du ivyo wantu wavu wakukantilwa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Hegu unamtenda Zumbe Chohile nchinga yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">Uyo Ekulanga Vitendese kutenda wikazi wako,<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />elo, hopate ubanasi wowose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">naho file haisogele he ikaya yako.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Kwaviya nawalagize awandima wakwe wa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">wakwamile mwe izisila zako zose.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />Nawakuguhe mwe imikono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">chani usekwekowadika chako mwe yuwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Nojate simba nkali na nyoka zina sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">nosiginte simba nkulu na nyoka zina usungu.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Chohile agamba, “Naniwambule wadya wose wakununga miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">naniwadime wadya wose wanimanyize kugamba miye ni Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Umo ananitanga, miye nanimwitike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nanitende hamwenga naye mwe nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nanimwambule na kumtunya.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Nanimjeleke ekalise wikazi mtali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">miye nanimwambule.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya kumtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Ni vyedi kumhongeza Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">na kudichemela idizina dyako, Weye Wikulanga Vitendese,<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />kutambalisa ungi wako mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">ukanuni wako chipindi cha chisingi,<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />kwa limba dina nyuzi mlongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">na kwa izwi dya kilangu.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya ntendwa zako zinelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">nanizicheme kwa chinyemi izindima zako udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Ntendwa zako zikulisa, weye Zumbe! Kaula ivyo zili nkulu izifanyanyi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">Fanyanyi zako zizamisa!<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Mhezi hakumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">humbwinya hadikukombaganya,<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />hata hegu wantu wavu watima saviya mani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">na wata masa wachumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">nawabalangwe kale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />mna Zumbe Chohile, wimkulu kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Zumbe Chohile, chindedi wankondo wako nawakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">wose wakudamanya yehiye nawahumwe.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Weye unanguvu enga mbogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">kunijidila mavuta matana yakusangalaza.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Meso yangu yawona awankondo wangu wakahudwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">magutwi yangu yeva indilo yawo wakudamanya wavu.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Wata uwagilwa nawadindimale saviya mti wa mtende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">nawatende saviya miti ya mwyelezi ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />Awo ni saviya miti ihandigwe mwe Inyumba ya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">nawadindimale mwe izinyuwa ze Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu,<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />awo nawajendeleze kweleka ntunda mo udalahala wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">nawatende wabisi naho wamema nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Wadahe kutambalisa kugamba Chohile kachuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">luwe lwangu, mndani mwakwe hamna ubunyanyi.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s">Chohile ni Seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Zumbe ni seuta, kevika ung'azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Zumbe kevika ukulu na kwenyinya ukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Isi ikwa hantu hatogile haikudaha kusogela.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Ichigoda chako cho useuta chitoga kukongela chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">weye nawiyuko kukongela kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Zumbe Chohile mito ilavya amaizwi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">bahali zilavya maizwi ya amawimbi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">mito yalavya chivumilo chakwe vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Uyo ni mkulu kujinka chivumilo cha mazi yabohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">ni mkulu kujinka mawimbi ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">Zumbe Chohile akwikala kulanga ni mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Zumbe Chohile, sigilizi zako hazikuhitukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">ne Inyumba yako ikuka vidala, kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s">Chohile mkanti ywa wantu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Zumbe Chohile, ukulihiza chikoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">Weye Chohile ukulihiza chikoda kwelavyanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">elo walagise kugamba wawakantila!<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Weye mkanti ywe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">inuka uwalihize wata kwefenya saviya vikuwagila!<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Zumbe Chohile, kubula ini wantu wavu nawajendeleze kutendeka weyaho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">Kubula ini Zumbe wantu wavu nawajendeleze kweduvya?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Wose wakudamanya wavu nawalonge milosi ya kweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">na kulonga kwa wefenyi.<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Zumbe Chohile, wawakoma awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">wawasulumiza wadya usagule watende wako.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Wakoma wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawo na wajeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">na kuwachija wabanikilwe ni watatizawo.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Awo nawo wagamba, “Zumbe Chohile hakuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Chohile ywa Yakobo hakukombaganya.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Nyuwe wahezi mgati mwa awantu fanyanyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">nyuwe mahumbwinya, nampate ubala ini?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Togola, adamanye idigutwi hakudaha kwiva?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Aumbile idiziso hakudaha kuwona?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Akukantila awantu mwe izisi hakudaha kuwakwahila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Akuwahiya wantu aswese fanyanyi?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Zumbe Chohile, kamanya izifanyanyi za awantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">kamanya kugamba hayakuwagila chintu.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Zumbe Chohile, ujimbiko wi mwa yudya akukantilwa ni weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">mtu ukuhinya kwa sigilizi zako!<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />Chani zuwa dya nkunto apate utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">kubula wantu wavu wasimbilwe bome.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, hawalemele awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">hawase wadya wakumtimila.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Kwaviya nkanto nazilavigwe kwa uwagila vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">na wachumile myoyo wose nawaitimile.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Ni yuhi nanambize kumtowa mntu mwavu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Ni yuhi endile intendele yangu mwa mta masa?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Hegu Zumbe Chohile, hanambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">nasisunguza kwita kwe kwikala hantu hanyamale ha file.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Umo nafanyanye kugamba, “Chohile ywangu nagwa”,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">ungi wako weye Chohile unegamiza.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Kwangadika ko umoyo wangu yakajenyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">weye wanihoza na kunibwedeza.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Weye hukudaha kujesanya na wakanti mayakwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">wakutula miko ya kugombela wantu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Walungana vileke wawebunga wata uwaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">wawakantila hewena mlema wakomwe.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Mna Zumbe Chohile ni sumkilo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">Chohile ywangu nchinga yangu anamila.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Uyo nawavuzize uwavu wawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">nawabinde kwachausa cha uwavu wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Zumbe Chohile ywetu nawakome pele!<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya kumtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Soni chimchemele Zumbe Chohile kwa mbwedo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">Chimtoile nchelejele kwa chinyemi luwe lwa wambula wetu!<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Chize kulongozi kwakwe chimhongeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">na kumchemela kwa mbwedo na nchemo za ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Kwaviya Zumbe ni Chohile mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">sekulu mwe imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Ivyegamo vyose vye isi vimwemikono yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">vinenengwe vya amagulu ni vyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Ibahali ni yakwe nuyo aidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">iviya kaumba isi kwa imikono yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Soni chimwinamile na kumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">chimfike madi Chohile Mumbi ywetu!<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Kwaviya nuyo Chohile ywetu na suwe chiwantu wakwe akudima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">ngoto zikutunduliwa hasi hakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Tegelezani viya akulonga vino dyelo,<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />“Msekuitenda imyoyo yenyu midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">saviya wadamanye wadalahala wenyu kudya Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">saviya wadamanye mwe idizuwa diya kudya kwenyika ya Masa. <verse eid="PSA 95:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />Wababa zenyu wanijezaga na kunihima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">hata hegu wawonaga ntedwa niwadamanyize.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Nachihiwaga icheleko chiya kwa mihilimo milongo mine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">Nagambaga, ‘Wano ni wantu wabanike imyoyo yawo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">Walemela kutimila izisigilizi zangu.’<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Elo, neihiwaga, niyo nelisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">‘Hawengile ahantu hangu ho kuhumula mpwii.’”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s">Chohile Seuta Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Mchemeleni nchemo mpya Zumbe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile nyuwe wantu mweisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile na kutogola idizina dyakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">Tambalisani wambula wakwe chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Tambalisani ung'azi wakwe mwa awantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">ntendwa zakwe za mpituko mwa awantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Zumbe Chohile ni mkulu awagilwa kutogolwa kujinka wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">uyo ogohigwa kujinka milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Kwaviya milungu yose ya awantu sicho chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">mna Zumbe Chohile aumbaga izimbingu.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Ntunyo na ukulu vikulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">nguvu na ung'azi vimndani mwa ahantu hakwe hakukile.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Nyuwe wantu winkeni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">mwinkeni ntogolani na nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile mkuka vikuligana ne idizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">igalani malavyo naho mwize mwe Inyumba yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Mvikileni Zumbe Chohile mo ukuka wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">isi yose izingize kulongozi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Wagambileni awantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">“Zumbe Chohile alongoza Isi kaika itogile haikudaha kusogezwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">nawakantile awantu wose kwa uwagilwa.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Mbingu zitowe nchelejele, isi yelelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">ibahali ivumile na vyose vimndani mwakwe,<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />nkonde zelelwe hamwenga na vyose vimndani mwakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">Vikaheza imiti yose ne izimbago vicheme kwa chinyemi,<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />Kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile akwiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Akwiza kuikantila isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Nawakantile awantu wose kwa ukanuni wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s">Chohile Sekulu Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Zumbe Chohile ni seuta! Isi yelelwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">Visiwa vyose vibwede!<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Maingu na ziza vyamzunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">uwagila na nkanto nuwo umwegamo we ichigoda chakwe cho useuta.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Moto walongola kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">na kuwatikimya awankondo wakwe ntendele zose.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Lumwemwe lwakwe lwamulika mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">isi iwona na kuzingiza.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Magulu yalujuka saviya nta kulongozi kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">kulongozi kwa Zumbe ywe isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Izimbingu zatambalisa uwagilwa wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">na awantu wose wawona ung'azi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Wose wakuvikila matukulu wajelwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">wadya wakweduvila matukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">mvikileni Chohile, nyuwe milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Wantu wa Sayuni weva na kutowa nchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">ivijiji vya Yuda vyelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">kwachausa che izinkanto zako weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Zumbe Chohile ni weye sekulu ywe isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">udahi wako utendese kujinka milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Zumbe Chohile awaunga wadya wakwihiwa wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">uyo adima uwikazi wa awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">na kuwambula mwe nguvu za wantu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Ulangazi wakwe walangaziza wata uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">na wantu wachumile myoyo welelwe.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Nyuwe wata uwagila mmwelelwe Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">ditogoleni idizina dyakwe dikukile.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s">Chohile Sekulu ywe Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile nchemo mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kwaviya kadamanya mbuli za mpituko!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">Kwa nguvu zakwe na ukuka wakwe vimwinka uhuda.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Zumbe Chohile kautenda wambula wakwe umanyike mwe izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">naho kalagisa uwagila wakwe kwa awantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Kakumbuka ungi wakwe no ukanuni wakwe mwa Waizulaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Ntendele zose ze isi ziuwona uwambula wa Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Isi yose imhongeze Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">imtogole kwa nchemo na nchelejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">mtogoleni kwa nchemo na maizwi ya chinyemi!<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile kwa vilangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">mchemeleni kwa lungole na magunda,<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />Towani nchelejele kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile seuta ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">nyemulani kwa magunda na maizwi ya mahembe.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Bahali ivumile na chila chintu chimndani mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">isi na vyose vikwikala mndani mwakwe vicheme!<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Mito itowe magasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">magulu yacheme hamwenga kwa chinyemi kulongozi kwa Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />kwaviya eza kukantila isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">Nawalongoze awantu wa mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">kwa uwagilwa na ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s">Chohile nuyo seuta mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Zumbe Chohile ni seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">wantu wose wazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">ekala mwe ichigoda cho useuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">hagati he vyumbe vikwitangwa makelubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">ne isi yazingiza.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Zumbe Chohile ni mkulu mwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">uyo katunyiswe mwa awantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Chila mntu atogola idizina dyakwe idyo ni kulu dyogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">uyo ni mkuka!<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Seuta mta nguvu ukunga uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">weye kulagisa ukanuni, mwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">kudamanya uwagila na viligane.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Mtogoleni Zumbe, Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">mkavikile ahantu hakwe ho kwikiya iviga vyakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">Uyo nuyo mkuka.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Musa na Haluni wendaga nawo awalavyantambiko wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Samwilu nuyo nakalombeza kwa zina dya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">wamwitangaga niyo awahitula.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Alongaga nawo kulaila mwe nguzo ya ingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">watozaga izisigilizi zakwe ne imiko yakwe awenkile.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Zumbe, Chohile yetu, ni weye uwahitule awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">kuwagisa kugamba weye wi Chohile akulekeila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">hatahegu kuwakantila kwachausa cha masa yawo.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Mtogoleni Zumbe, Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">naho mvike mo ulugulu lwakwe lukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">kwaviya Zumbe, Chohile ywetu ni mkuka.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya kumtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe wantu wose mweisi!<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Mvikileni Zumbe Chohile kwa kwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">soni kulongozi kwakwe kwa nchemo za chinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Manyani kugamba Zumbe, nuyo Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">Nuyo achumbile, suwe chiwantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">nuyo akuchidima.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Ingilani mwe izinchili ze Inyumba yakwe kwa ntogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">hitani mwe izinyuwa zakwe mkeduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mhongezeni na kutogola idizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">ungi wakwe wekala kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">ukanuni wakwe wekalisa mwe ivyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s">Lagano dya Seuta</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Nanicheme mo ungi wako no uwagila wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">nanicheme ntogozi kwa weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Nanisinyise wikazi hewine lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">nawize kwangu ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Nanikale kwa uchumi wa moyo mwe inyumba yangu,<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />naho sanileke akudamanya wavu eze kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">Ntendwa za wantu hewene uzumizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">sanidamanye izintendwa zawo.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Sanijesanye na mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">nanenegese masa.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Akumsezenga mnyawe nanimkomele hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">sanimjijimize mta wefenyi na kweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Naniwakaule kwa wedi wantu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">vileke wadahe kwikala na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">hewene mlema nawo nawanisankanile.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Mdanti yoyose hekale mnyumba mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">hahana akulonga mbuli za lulimi nekale kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Chila zuwa naniwabalange wavu wose mwe isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">nanimuse chila akutenda yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">mo umzi wa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mntu mta nkunto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Zumbe Chohile, wive amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:1">ndilo yangu ya kulombeza wambizi ikubwile!<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Usekwefisa hale na miye chipindi cha nkunto!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">Unitegele gutwi dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">usunguze kunihitula umo hakulombeza.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Kwaviya amazuwa yangu yomboka saviya mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">mavuha yangu yahya saviya kala dya moto.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Sihondwa mo umoyo enga mani yanyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">sina nkwina ya nkande.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Kulawana ne chinyulu mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">sisigala mafuha ne nkanda.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Sitenda saviya kungwi dya kwedijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">saviya kungwi kwe mahame.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Hagona sikupata ntongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">sitenda saviya kadege kechedu kwe hala dya nyumba.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Wankondo wangu wanitila msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">waniihiwa enga kugamba ni wachilalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">wakaditanga idizina dyangu mwa amaligito yawo.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Maivu yatenda niyo ikande yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">mesozi nayahanganya na chiya hunywa,<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />kwachausa cha amaya yako yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">kwaviya kuninula na kunidula hale.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Amazuwa yangu ni saviya chizuli cha chisingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">nanyuluka saviya mani.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Mna weye Zumbe Chohile, wi seuta kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">ntogozi zako zo ukulu zajendeleza mwe ivyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Nowinuke na kuiwonela mbazi Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kwaviya ni chipindi cha kulagisa wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">chipindi chizumilike chibula.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Kwaviya mayuwe yakwe ni ya yombe kulu kwa awandima wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">idilumbi dyakwe dyenye wadiwonela mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Wantu wose nawadyogohe idizina dya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">maseuta wose mweisi nawautunye ukulu wako,<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />umo Zumbe Chohile naizenge uhya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">na kwelaviza ung'azi wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />umo netikile amalombezo ya wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">hayalemele amalombezo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Wandikani imbuli ino kwachausa che icheleko chikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">vileke awo hewenati kwelekwa wadahe kwiza kumtogola Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />Zumbe Chohile kakaula hasi kulaila ahantu hakwe hakukile he kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">asinyaga isi kulawa kwembingu,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />etegeleze ndilo yo usungu ya awafungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">na kuwalekeila wadya wakantilwe file.<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Elo, zina dya Zumbe Chohile naditambaliswe uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">ne izintogozi zakwe uko Yelusalemu,<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />umo awantu wose ne iziseuta nawadugane hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">wamsankanile Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Chohile kanihuza izinguvu nichei mwesila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">wikazi wangu kautenda mjihi.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Naho nilongile, Chohile usekuniguha nichei sinati kudalahala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">Weye Zumbe Chohile wekala vyeleko na vyeleko.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Waumbaga isi chikale chijinkile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">kwa mikono yako mwenye kudamanya imbingu.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Vyose ivyo navyusike, mna weye nosigaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">vyose navisakale saviya suche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">Weye novihituile saviya suche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">navyo navyusigwe.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Mna weye nuyudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">mihilimo yako haina udumo.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Wana wetu nawekale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">na kwa wamizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">welekwa wawo nawekale mpeho kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s">Ungi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Miye namtogola Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">vyose vimndani mwangu vitogole idizina dyakwe dikukile.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Miye namtogola Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">naho nisekujala wedi wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Anilekeila amasa yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">anihonya amanyonje yangu yose.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Ambula ujima wangu mwe mbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">anijimbika kwa ungi na mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Akumemeza viya vyose ukunga kwa vintu vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">vileke ubwanga wangu uvuzwe uhya saviya gushu.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Zumbe Chohile adamanya uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">awenka uwagila wadya wose wakuzilwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Alagisaga izisila zakwe kwa Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">niyo awaleka Waizulaeli wawone ntendwa zakwe zikulise.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Zumbe Chohile ni mta mbazi na ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">hakusunguza kwihiwa, kamema ungi.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Uyo hachikwahile mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">naho hakuchiwonela maya kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />Uyo hachikantile kuligana na amasa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">naho hachilihize kuligana no wihi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Saviya izimbingu zikulanga vitendese ne isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">nivyo uwedi wakwe ulozese kwa wadya wakumvikila.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Saviya ulailo wa zuwa wili hale na uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">nivyo Chohile aikiye hale amasa yetu na suwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Saviya tati yamtu eli na mbazi kwa wanawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">nivyo Zumbe Chohile akuwawona mbazi wadya wakumvikila.<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />Kwaviya kavimanya ivyo chumbigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">akumbuka kugamba suwe chimalumbi.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Wikazi wa mntu nisaviya mani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">Chachakula saviya luwa dya kwenkonde,<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />mpungile yadinyulusa, vikaheza dyausika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">ahantu dyendile hadiwoneke vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Mna kukongela kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">ungi wa Zumbe Chohile wimwawadya wakumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">uwagila wakwe mwa awelekwa wawo wose,<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />kwa wadya wose wakutoza Idilagano dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">na wakanuni wakutimila sigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Zumbe Chohile kaika ichigoda chakwe cho useuta kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">useuta wakwe walongoza mwe vyose.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe wandima wakwe wakulu wata nguvu wa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">nyuwe wakankalu mkutimila sigilizi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">nyuwe mkutimila ulosi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe vyumbe vyose vya kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">nyuwe wandima wakwe wose mkudamanya viya akunga.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Miye namtogola Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe vyumbe vyakwe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">chila hantu hakwe akulongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">Miye namtogola Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s">Mtogoleni mumbi Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Miye namtogola Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Chohile ywangu, weye wi mkulu vitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Kwevika ntunyo na ung'azi,<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />kwegubika ulangazi saviya suche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">kutandaza izimbingu saviya hema,<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />na kuzika izinguzo ze izigolofa zakwe mwe mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">Ayatenda amaingu yatende lingisha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">atamba mlanga akegalwa ni nkung'unto.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Awatenda nkung'unto awandima wakwe wa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">na awandima wakwe watende myali ya moto.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Isi kaika mwe ivyegamo vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">naho haikudaha kusogezwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Isi kuigubika kwa bahali saviya suche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">mazi yagubikaga amagulu.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Umo uyakwahile amazi niyo yasumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">yeze yeve umbumo wako yatimula nguluko.<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />Yakwela kulanga kwa amagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">na kusela kwa amakolongo, kubula ahantu hadya ungile.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Kuyekiya mhaka heyekudaha kuujinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">hayajeze kuigubika isi vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Azitenda soko zijuluze mazi kwamakolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">yaguluka mgati mwa amagulu.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Awenka mazi awanyama wose wa kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">mpundamiliya zakoma nchilu.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Wadege wazenga masasa yawo mwe imiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">wachima mwa amatambi na kuchema.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Kunyesa fula mlanga mwa amagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">ne isi imemezwa vintu udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Atenda mani yahote kwachausa cha wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">na mimeya kwachausa cha wantu wahande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">wepatile nkande kulawa mwe isanga,<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />na kulavya divai ikuwelela moyo wa mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">mavuta ya mzaituni kukuluguta mo uso wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">na nkande ikuchinka nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Miti ya Zumbe Chohile yanyesezwa vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">heye mielezi ya Lebanoni ahandile mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Wadege wazenga masasa yawo umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">mpungu zazenga masasa yawo mwe miti ikwitangwa misonobali.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Ngulugulu zekala mwe magulu matali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">nyuwe ni masumkilo ya pelele.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Kadamanya mnenge uhime imihilimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">zuwa dimanya ichipindi chakwe cho kuhunga.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Kwigala chiza kutenda chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">wanyama wose wa kumbago wajenda.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Simba zabuma zikacheseka maingo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">zalonda nkande ilavigwe ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Zuwa dikatontomoka, zauya uko zilaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">zauya na kugona mwa amalundu yawo.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Vikaheza wantu wafosa kuse wakudamanya ndima zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">wadamanya ndima zawo kubula chisingi.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Zumbe Chohile kumba vintu vilozese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Kwa umanyi kuvidamanya vyose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Isi imema vyumbe umbile.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Hadya hana bahali nkulu naho nyangalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">imema vyumbe hevikuwazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">vintu vina ujima vikulu na vidodo.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Uko meli zaita na kuya, numo eli Lewiatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">umbile asezige umo mndani.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Wose awo wagoja weye uwenke nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">wakatenda na sala.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Walogota chochose nowenke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">unagubula umkono wako, weguta vinonile.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Mna unamkanda mgongo, wengilwa ni nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">unausa umuye wako, wabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">na kuya mwamalumbi umo walaile.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Ukawenka muye wako, waumbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">weye wautenda uhya uso we isi.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Ung'azi wa Zumbe Chohile wikale kale na kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Zumbe Chohile nelelwe mwe izintendwa zakwe!<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Akaula mweisi, iyo yazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">akufya amagulu ayo yalavya mosi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Nanimchemele Zumbe Chohile wikazi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">nanicheme ntogozi kwa Zumbe Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">chipindi chose hatenda ni mjima.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Ubwede ukufanyanya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">ntogozi zangu zalawa kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Mna wata masa wamlawe mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">wakudamanya yehiye wasekutendeka vituhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Miye namtogola Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Namtogola Zumbe!<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s">Chohile na awantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Mhongezeni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">tambalisani idizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">wagambileni wantu wose viya adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Mchemeleni ntogozi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">wagambileni wantu ntendwa zakwe za mpituko.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Mtogoleni kwaviya nyuwe mwi wakuka wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">wagambileni wadya wose wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile welelwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Mlondeni Zumbe Chohile ne izinguvu zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">londani uso wakwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Kumbukani izintendwa zakwe zikwehela atendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">mpituko zakwe na nkanto alavize,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />nyuwe welekwa wa Bulahimu mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">nyuwe wana wa Yakobo wantu asagule.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Uyo nuyo Zumbe Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">nkato zakwe zi mweisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Hakujala idilagano dyakwe aikiye kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">ulosi alagize mwe vyeleko elufu.<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />Lagano adamanye na Bulahimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">cheliso amwelisize Isaka.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />Zumbe Chohile kaiga lagano na Yakobo ditende lagizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">nadikale mwa Waizulaeli kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />Akagamba, “Nahwinke weye isi ya Kanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">itende yako mwenye.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Wantu wa Chohile wendaga wajeche mo uwazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">nendile hawamanyikise</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">naho wendaga wajeni mweisi ya Kanani,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />wadwangayaga kulawa mwesi imwenga kwiya mwesi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">kulawa useta umwenga kwita useuta mtuhu.<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Mna Chohile halekile mntu yoyose awazileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">kwachausa chenyu awakwahilaga maseuta,<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />akagamba, “Msekuwalumiza wandima wangu nisagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">msekuwakufya waoni wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Zumbe Chohile egalaga gumbo mwe isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">na kubalanga inkande yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Mna niyo atuma mntu kulongozi kwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Yusufu uyo atagigwe saviya mtumwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Wamzubula iviga vyakwe kwa minyolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">isingo yakwe yanyinyagwa kwa chuma,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />kubula yadya akongile kulonga yachinte,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile umbunkula ni mchindedi.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Vikaheza seuta ywa Misili niyo amwiva na kuzumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">chilongozi ywa awantu niyo amlekeila.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Kamtenda chilongozi mo ulongozi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">mkulu mwe ivintu vyose ananavyo,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />awalongoze amasekulu we hasi ha seuta viya akunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">na kuwahinya wadalahala ubala.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Izulaeli niyo engila mwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakobo niyo ekala saviya mjeni mweisi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Zumbe Chohile kawatenda awantu wakwe welekane vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">kawatenda wakankalu kujinka wankondo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Nuyo awatendile awantu wa Misili waweihiwe Waizulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">niyo wawadamanya mbuli zihiye awandima wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Vikaheza niyo amtuma Musa mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">hamwenga na Haluni uyo asagule.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Wantu awo waidi wadamanyaga vilagiso vikwehela mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">vmpituko mweisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Chohile ahosaga ziza mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">mna Wamisili hawatimile izisigilizi za Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Ahituilaga amazi yawo kutenda sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">vyahosa yakoma izisamaki zawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Isi yawo niyo yamema majula chila hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">ayo yengilaga kubula kwe ivyumba wakugona ivilongozi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Chohile alongaga niyo kwalaila mabunga ya si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">na masawa mweisi yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Fula kaihituila itenda ya mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">na lumwemwe luhangane na mbaula mweisi yawo yose,<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />niyo abalanga imizabibu yawo ne imiti yawo ye imtini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">kagwisa hasi imiti yawo yose mweisi.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Alongaga, sije niyo zeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">njeda hezikuwazika,<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />niyo wadya chila mani mwe isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">zitafuna ulozo wose mwe isanga yawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Vikaheza kawakoma awelekwa wawo wose wa nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">mwelekwa ywa nkongo wo ubwanga wawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Niyo awalavya Waizulaeli mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">wakatenda na hela zilozese na zahabu ilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">hahana hata mnyonje yumwenga kulawa mwa amakabila yawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Wantu wa Misili welelwa umo Waizulaeli wakahalawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">kwaviya nendile wakawogoha.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Chohile niyo atanda ingu diwagubike awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">na moto uwamulikile nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Walombeza, niyo awegaila nkwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">kawegusa nkande ilaile kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Katula luwe, mazi niyo yajuluzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">yaguluka kwedijangwa enga mto.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Kwaviya akumbukaga ulosi wakwe ukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">amgambilaga Ibulahimu mndima ywakwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Elo, niyo awalavya awantu wakwe kwa chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">wantu asagule wachema nchemo za kwelela.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Awenkaga si za wantu watuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">niyo awenka izinkonde za awakaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">zitende zawo,<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />chani watoze amalagizo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">na kutimila izisigilizi zakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s">Wedi wa Zumbe Chohile kwa wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile! Mhongezeni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Ni yuhi akudaha kutamwila ntendwa nkulu za Zumbe Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Na kutambalisa vichintile ntogozi zakwe?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Wajimbikwa wadya wakutimila sigilizi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">wakudamanya vikuwagila mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Zumbe Chohile, nikumbuka umo ukawambiza awantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">unambize umo ukawambula.<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />Vileke nelelwe kuchumilwa kwa awantu wako usagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">nidahe kwehenga mwe chinyemi che isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">na kweduvya hamwenga na awantu wako.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Chikola masa, saviya watendile wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">chibananga naho chidamanya wihi.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Umo wakale wetu wendaga Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">hawakombaganyaga izintendwa zikwehela za Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">wajala nkanana zilozize ivyo uwalagise ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">mna wamhitukaga Mta nguvu zose kwe ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Hata ivyo Chohile saviya alongaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">vileke alagisa inguvu yakwe nkulu.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Aikwahilaga ibahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">niyo yanyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">kawalongoza awantu wakwe wadeluke saviya hantu hanyaile.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Awambulaga mwe imkono ya wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">awakombolaga kulawa mwa awankondo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Mazi yawagubikaga awankondo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">hachulupuke hata yumwenga.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Niyo awantu wakwe wazumila viya alongaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">na kuchema ntogozi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Mna niyo wasunguza kujala ivyo awatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">wedamanyiza mbuli hawagojize ulangilizi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Kwedijangwa wamemwa ni tama zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">wamjezaga Chohile kwenyika,<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />elo, niyo awenka chiya walombeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">mna niyo awegaila unyonje wihise.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Uko kwedilago wawadila finju Musa na Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">wandima wakukile wa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Isanga niyo yagubuka na kummela Dasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">iwafinankiza Abilamu na awantu we idibunga dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Moto niyo wawalaila awatimizi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">ni wawatikimya awantu awo awavu.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Uko Sinai waumbaga tukulu dya ndama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">na kudivikila iditukulu idyo dilawane na zahabu itile kulujulwa,<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />wahituilaga Ung'azi wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">nakuwinka tukulu dya njeku ikudya mani.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Wamjala Chohile awambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">uyo adamanye ntendwa nkulu uko Misili,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />mpituko mwe isi ya Hamu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">Na mbuli za kutisa uko kwe Ibahali ya Shamu!<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Chohile agambaga nawakome awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">hata ivyo, Musa mndima ywa Chohile engilaga hagati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">niyo achinda amaya ya Chohile asekuwakoma.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Vikaheza niyo waibela idya isi intana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">hawazumile ulosi alongaga.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Wang'ung'uzikaga mwa amahema yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">naho hawamwetegeleze Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Elo, niyo elisa akawagamba vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">nawakome kwedijangwa,<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />nawazagaze awelekwa wawo mwa awantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">na kuweneza mwe isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Vikaheza uko Peoli wantu wa Chohile niyo welunga mwe kumvikila Baali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">na kudya ntambiko zilavigwe kwa milungu heine ujima.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Wamsonga maya Zumbe Chohile kwa ntendwa zawo zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">Chohile niyo awegaila unyonje wihise.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Mna Finehasi niyo achimala na kumlihiza yudya akoile amasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">unyonje uwo niyo wachindwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Imbuli iyo yakumbukwa kwa ntunyo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">kukongela ichipindi icho ne imihilimo yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Kwa amazi ya Meliba, wamjelaga maya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">mabuli yehiye niyo yamgwela Musa kwachausa chawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />Kwaviya waihituka iloho ya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">Musa niyo alonga milosi heikuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Hawawakomile awantu hewemmanyize Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">saviya Zumbe Chohile awalagize,<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />mna niyo wehanganya nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">na kutimila izimbuli zawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Wavikila matukulu ye imilungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">ayo niyo zatenda mtego wa kuwakoma.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Niyo wawalavya ntambiko wana wawo wa chilume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">na wachiche kwa amatukulu ya Kanani.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Wakoma wantu hewene lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">wana wawo na wachiche wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">wawalavyaga ntambiko kwa amatukulu ya Kanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">isi niyo yengila uzavu kwa isakame yawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Wejela uzavu wenye kwa mbuli za wavu watendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">kwa ntendwa zo uchilanga wadamanya.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo ewemukila maya awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">kaweihiwa awantu wakwe asagule.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Niyo awenkiza kwa awantu hewemmanyize Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">awo wakuweihiwa niyo wawalongoza.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Wankondo wawo niyo wawafinyankiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">na wawenka ndima za kuwakunkusa chinguvu.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Nkanana zilozize Chohile awambulaga awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">mna wowo niyo wasagula kumhituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">niyo wajendeleza mo uwavu wawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Mna niyo akaula amasulumizo yawo umo eze eve indilo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Kwachausa chawo niyo akumbuka Lagano dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">na kulawana no ungi wakwe utendese niyo aselwa ni maya yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Niyo awatenda wawonelwe mbazi ni wose wawatahile.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Zumbe Chohile ywetu chambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">chichisanye vituhu kulawa mwa awantu hewekumvikila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">vileke chihongeze na kutogola idizina dyako dikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na kweduvya mwe izintogozi zako.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">kukongela haluse na kale na kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Wantu wose wagambe, “Taile!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogola Chohile kwa Wedi Wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />“Mhongezeni Zumbe Chohile kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">ungi wakwe ni wa kale na kale!”<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Wadya wakombolwe ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">wavuzagize kulonga imlosi ino, nyuwe nyose mwambulwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">Kawambulani kulawa kwa awankondo wenyu,<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />wadya achisanye kulawa kwe izisi ze chijeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa ulailo wa zuwa na uselo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa chenya na kwamwenyemzi.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Awo wangadikaga kwedijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">hawawone sila ikuwabuza kwe mzi wakudaha kwikala.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Wendaga na sala na nchilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">niyo waswesa nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Niyo wamwilila Zumbe Chohile mwe izinkunto zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">uyo niyo awambula mwa amatumbwaziko yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Niyo awalongoza mwe sila iligane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">kubula kwe mzi wadahile kwikala.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Elo, wamhongeze Zumbe Chohile kwa ungi wakwe hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">na kwa ntendwa zakwe zikuwehela wantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Kwaviya awanywesa wata nchilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">na kuwegusa wata sala kwa vintu vyedi.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Watuhu wekalaga mwe chiza na mwe ziza ditendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">wafungwa wasulumizwa mwe minyolo,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />kwaviya nendile wayakanda mgongo amalagizo ya Chohile mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">na kulemela sigilizi za Uyo Ekulanga.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Kawakunkusa mwe ndima ndala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">wekobadika mna hahana yoyose awambize.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Niyo wamwilila Zumbe Chohile mwe izinkunto zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">uyo niyo awambula mwe ichinyulu chawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Niyo awalavya mwe ichiza ne ichinyulu chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">na kukanta imnyolo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Elo, wamhongeze Zumbe Chohile kwa ungi wakwe hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">na kwa ntendwa zakwe zikwehela atendile kwa wantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Kwaviya katula izinyivi ze shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">na kukanta imihindo ye chuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Awo watenda wahezi kwachausa cha amasa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">wasulumizwa kwachausa cho uwavu wawo,<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />hawaungile kudya nkande yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">wasigala hadodo wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Niyo wamwilila Zumbe Chohile mwe izinkunto zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">uyo niyo awambula mwa amasulumizo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Awahonyaga awo kwa ulosi wakwe alagize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">na kuwambula mwe file.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Elo, mhohongezeni Zumbe Chohile kwa ungi wakwe hewikusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">na ntendwa zikwehela adamanye mwawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Walavye ntambiko za kuhongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">watamwile ntendwa zakwe zose kwa nchemo za kwelelwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Wadya watambaga mwe ibahali kwa meli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">na kudamanya mayombe yawo mwe mazi yazize,<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />wawonaga izindima adamanye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">ntendwa zakwe zikwehela mwe ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Kwaviya alagizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">na kwinula luzimu lwinule mawimbi kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Wadulagwa ko ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">vikaheza hasi kwe imizimilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">ukankalu wawo ni wasila mwe imbuli iyo,<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />wasebedukaga na kuyumbadika saviya wakozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">ubala wawo nio waduma.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Niyo wamwilila Zumbe Chohile mwe inkunto yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">uyo niyo awambula mwa amasulumizo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Niyo atondowaza nkung'unto kwa kutakalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">mawimbi mwe ibahali niyo yatondowala.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Nendile welelwa kwaviya naitondowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">uyo niyo awalongoza kubula kwe bandali nawakaunga.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Elo, wamhongeze Zumbe Chohile kwa wedi wakwe hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">na kwa ntendwa zakwe zikuwehela wantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Wamtunye uyo mwe mdugano wa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">na kumtogola mwe chitala cha wadalahala.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Zumbe Chohile ahituilaga imito itenda jangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">naho anyazaga soko za mazi zitenda hantu hanyaile.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Sanga ikulavya ulozo itenda chihala cha munyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">kwachausa cha masa ya wantu wendile wakekala umo.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Ahituilaga majangwa yatenda mabwawa ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">hantu hanyaile hatende soko za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Aletaga wantu wata sala wekale umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">awo niyo wazenga mzi na kwikala umo.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Walimaga na kuhanda mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">iyo yelekaga ntunda zilozese.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Awajimbikaga awantu wakwe niyo watenda na wana walozese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">naho hahunguze amafyo ye imifugo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Elo, uwazwa wawo wize uhunguke na kuhwelesa kwa kuzilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">file na kusulumizwa na chinyulu,<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />uyo awalagisaga ubezi awakulu wa awankondo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">kawatenda wangadike mwe nyika heine sila.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Mna uyo awahonyaga wachiwa mwe izinkunto zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">na kujenyeza awantu we izikaya zawo saviya mafyo ya ngoto.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Wachumi wa moyo nawawone na kwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">mna wavu wose nawanyamazwe imilomo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Yoyose mta ubala akuziva izimbuli zino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">afanyanye ungi mkulu wa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi ukebungwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Zumbe Chohile umoyo wangu ukulumbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:1">nanicheme na kutogola kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Inuka weye gunda na zeze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">Naniyasetule mavukuvuku.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Zumbe Chohile, nahutogole mgati mwa awantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">Nahutunye mwa awantu we izisi.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Kwaviya ungi wako ni mkulu, ubula kulanga kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">ukanani wako wabula ko ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Zumbe Chohile utogolwe, kulanga kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">ung'azi wako utendeke mwe isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Uchambule na kuchambiza kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">vileke wadya ukungisa wadahe kukombolwa.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Chohile kalonga kulawa ahantu hakwe hakukile, kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">“Haluse naniisange vihande Shekemu kwa uhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">idikolongo dya Sukoti nanidihime vihande hande.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Giliyadi ni yangu, Manase ni yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">Efulaimu ni nkofia yangu ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">na Yuda ni nkome yangu yo useuta.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Moabu ni zungu dyangu dya kunawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">umo Edomu nanidule kwapa dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">na uko Filisiti nanitowe lukunga lwa uhuda mwe nkondo.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Ni yuhi akunga anigale kubula kwemzi una ngome?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">Ni yuhi akunga anilongoze kubula Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Suyo weye Chohile, uchilemele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Wenawe hukujesanya vituhu na wagomba nkondo wetu?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Chambize mokuhigana na awankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">kwaviya wambizi wa mntu ni wa bule.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Kwa wambizi wa Chohile nachihude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">kwaviya uyo nawahume awankondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s">Mafuzumo mwe Nkunto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Nakutogola weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:1">usekunyamala,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />kwaviya wantu wavu na wadanti wanebunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">waniziga mbuli zo udanti,<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />naho wanilonga milosi ikuniihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">wanebunga hehene luhosa.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Icho wakuniliha umbuya wangu mwawo ni kunilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">mna miye nawalombezeza wajimbikwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Waniliha yehiye kwa wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">wihi kwa umbuya wangu.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Wankondo wangu wagamba, “Sagula mntu mwavu amhige,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">mlahi ywakwe mwenye amkantile mwe chitala.”<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Umo akantilwa abwilwe na mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">na amalombezo yakwe yakantilwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Mazuwa yakwe yo ujima yasunguze kusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">ulongozi wakwe enkigwe mntu mtuhu.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Wanawe wasigwe hewene tati yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">mkaziwe atende mwasigwa!<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Wanawe wangadike wakalombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">wabalazwe mwa amahame ye izinyumba zawo.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Mntu akumdai atahe iviya vyakwe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">naho wajeni watahe chila chintu apatile mwe izindima adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Asekutendeka hata yumwenga ywa kumdamanyiza yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">hegu ywa kuwawonela mbaza wana asize umo akabanika.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Cheleko chakwe chisile kufa luhombwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">mazina yawo yajalwe mwe icheleko chikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Wavu wa wababa zakwe usekujalwa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">masa ya mami yakwe yasekujeza kulekeilwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Zumbe Chohile masa yawo yakumbuke mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">vileke wasile kufa luhombwa wajalwe mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Kwaviya hawajezaga kudamanya yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">mna kambalaza mchiwa msokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">kawakoma wachiwa na wafile chevu.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Kaungisa kuligita, ligito niyo dyampata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">haungile kujimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">elo, uijimbiko utende hale naye.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Aligitaga wantu watuhu saviya akuvala izisuche zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">ligito niyo dyamwingila mo mwili wakwe saviya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">mwa amavuha yakwe saviya mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Naitende saviya suche azingigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">saviya msipi atalizwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Zumbe Chohile wakantile awankondo wangu mwe isila iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">wose wakulonga mbuli zihiye seizo mwangu!<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Elo, weye Zumbe Chohile nambiza saviya walongaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">nambula kwachausa cha wedi wako.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Kwaviya miye ni mchiwa msokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">moyo wangu ulumizwa mndani.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Najinka enga chizuli chikukonga kwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">sifiliswa saviya sije.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Mavindi yangu yalegela kwa kuleka kudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">umwili wangu uhwahwatila kwa kuswesa mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Wantu wakanisinya wanibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">wakaniwona wasingisa imitwi yawo ko ubezi.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Zumbe Chohile ywangu nambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">nambula kuligana no ungi wako!<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Wankondo wangu wamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">kugamba ni weye unambule.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Wadaha waniligite, mna weye wanijimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">wananebunga nawajelwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">mna mndima ywako nelelwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Walahi wangu wahayuswe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">na kugubikwa ni soni saviya suche.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Nahuhongeze weye Zumbe Chohile kwa milomo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">nahumtogole mwe wantu walozize,<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />kwaviya wawagombela wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">na kuwambula ujima wawo mwa wadya wakuwakantila.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe na seuta ywakwe asagule</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Zumbe Chohiile amgamba sekulu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">“Ikala mkono wangu wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">kubula aho naniwaike awankondo wako hantu ukwikiya iviga vyako.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Zumbe Chohile nangamule inguvu yo useuta wako kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">nolongoze mgati mwa awankondo wako.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Mwe idizuwa nowite kuwatowa awankondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">wantu wako nawakubase kwa kunga wenye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">Ukatenda kuvikwa ung'azi ukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">kulawa kwa amavukuvuku ya mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">nauhokele mnyuzu wo ubwanga wako.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Zumbe Chohile kelisa, uyo hahituile fanyanyi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">“Weye notende mlavyantambiko kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">kwa mliganyo wa Melikizedeki.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Zumbe Chohile entendele yangu yakulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">umo anakwelwa ni maya nawahonde maseuta.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Nawakantile awantu mwe izisi zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">akachisanya vimba na kuwahonda maseuta we isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Seuta nanywe amazi ya akamto hankanda he isila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">elo nenule umtwi wakwe kwa uhuda.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa Chohile kwa ntendwa zakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Kwa moyo wangu wose nanimhongeze Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">mwe balaza ya wakanuni na mwe mdugano wa wantu wakumvikila Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Ntendwa za Zumbe Chohile zikulisa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">Wose wakuwagizwa nizo wazifanyanyisa.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Ndima zakwe zimema ukulu na ukuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">ndima zakwe zekala kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Katende mpituko zakwe zisekujalwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Zumbe Chohile ni ywedi na mta mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Awenka nkande wadya wakumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">mazuwa yose hakujala lagano dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Kawalagisa awantu wakwe udahi we izindima zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">kawenka izisi za wantu watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Ndima zose adamanye ni zo ukanuni na uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">ulangilizi wakwe wose ni chindedi.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Malagizo yakwe yekala kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">yadamanywa kwa ukanuni na uchumi.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Kawakombola awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">kalagiza lagono dyakwe dya kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">zina dyakwe dikuka naho ni dyakogofya.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Kumvikila Zumbe Chohile ni nkongelo yo ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">wose wakutimila imiko yakwe akili zawo ni zedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Ntogozi zakwe zekala kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s">Ujimbiko wa mntu ywa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Mtogole Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Ujimbiko ni wa yudya mntu akumvikila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">yudya akuwagilwa vitendese ni izisigilizi za Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Welekwa wawo nawatende na udahi mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">cheleko cha wantu wakanuni nachijimbikwe.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Mwe inyumba yakwe namtende na ugoli ulozese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">ukanuni wakwe wekale kale ne kale.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Ulangazi wawalangaziza wakanuni mwe ichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">yudya mta kulekeila mta mbazi na uwagila.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Yedi nayamwizile mntu mta chisekwesekwe na kukopesha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">akudamanya mbuli zakwe kwa uwagila.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Mta uwagila hadunduge chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">mta uwagila nakumbukwe kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Hogohe umo akeva mbuli zihiye, moyo wakwe utoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">aika msuhi wakwe kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Moyo wakwe uchuma hatende na nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">mo udumo nawone awankondo wakwe wakahudwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Awenka wachiwa majeleko kwa chisekwesekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">uwagila wakwe wekala kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">natende na nguvu na kutunywa.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Mntu mwavu nawone na kwihizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">nehiwe na kuhalawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">tama ya mwavu nayagile hale.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Nyuwe wandima wa Zumbe Chohile mtogoleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">ditogoleni idizina dya Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Zina dya Zumbe Chohile dijimbikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">kukongela dyelo na kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Kukongela ulailo wa zuwa kubula uswelo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">zima dya Zumbe Chohile ditogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Zumbe Chohile alongoza mwe izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">ung'azi wakwe wikulanga kwe imbingu.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Ni yuhi akwinga Zumbe Chohile ywetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">Uyo ekala kulanga vitendese,<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />mna akaula hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:6">awone imbingu ne isi.<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Awenula wachiwa mwe malumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">awenula hewene chintu mwe zalazala,<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />awekaza hamwenga na mazumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">hamwenga na wakulu wa wantu wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />amwinka mvyele hene cheleko kutondowala kunyumba kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">akatenda na wana wata chinyemi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s">Mpituko za Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Umo awantu wa Izulaeli walawaga kweisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">awelekwa wa Yakobo kulawa mwa wakulonga longa dya chijeni,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Yuda niyo atenda wikazi ukukile wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Izulaeli niyo yatenda yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Ibahali ize iwone niyo yasumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">mazi yo umto wa Yolodani niyo yauya kunyuma.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Magulu yapilika pilika saviya ndolome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">wagulu wapilika pilika enga wana ngoto.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Ni chibwani chikulaile weye bahali vikuleka wasumka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Na weye mazi ya Yolodani ni bwani chilekeile ukauya kunyuma?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Nyuwe magulu, ni mbwani chiwahosizeni mkapilika pilika saviya ndoloe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Nyuwe wagulu ni mbwani mpilika pilika enga wana ngoto?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Weye isi zingiza kulongozi kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">kulongozi kwa Chohile ywa Yakobo,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />uyo ahituile luwe kutenda sima dya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">luwe lutogese kutenda soko ya mazi.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s">Chohile Yumwenga Ywa Chindedi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">wakutogolwa sawo suwe, mna utogolwe weye ichedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">kwachausa cha ungi na ukanuni wako.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Kwambwani wantu hewekumanyize wauze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">“Chohile ywenyu ekuhi?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Chohile ywetu ekwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">uyo adamanya chochose chikumwelela.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Mna imilungu yawo idamanywa kwa chumbu na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">isanwa kwa mikono ya wantu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Yana milomo mna hayakudaha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">yana meso mna hayakudaha kuwona.<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />Yana magutwi mna hayakudaha kwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">yana mpula mna hayakudaha kuhefya.<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />Yana mikono mna hayakudaha kuhahasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">yana viga mna hayakudaha kujenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">naho amakongomelo yawo hayakudaha kulavya izwi.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Wadya wakuyadamanya nawatenda sa ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">wadya wakuzikiya msuhi iviya wenga seizo.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">ikani msuhi wenyu kwa Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">Uyo nuyo nawambizeni na nchinga yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Nyuwe welekwa wa Haluni, mwikiyeni msuhi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">uyo nuyo nawambizeni na nchinga yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Nyuwe mkumvikila, ikani msuhi wenyu kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">uyo nuyo nawambizeni na nchinga yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Zumbe Chohile achikumbuke na kuchijimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">nawajimbike awetu wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">nawajimbike awalekwa wa Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />Uyo namjimbike chila mntu akumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">mkulu na mdodo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Zumbe Chohile awajenyezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:14">nyuwe na awana wenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Mjimbikwe ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">Mumbi ywe imbingu ne isi!<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Mbingu zikulanga vitendese niza Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">mna isi kawenka wantu.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Wabanike hawakumtogola Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">hegu wadya wakusela hantu hanyamale.<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Mna suwe nachimjimbike Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">vino haluse na kale na kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi ya mntu Ahonyigwe mwe unyonje</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Namunga Zumbe Chohile kwaviya kaniva idizwi dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kaniva amalombezo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Kwaviya kanitegeleza gutwi dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">nanimwitange mazuwa yose yo ujima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Hatali za file nazinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">vya mbila vinebunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">nasimemwa ni nkunto na chiholozi.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Vikaheza niyo namwilila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">“Weye Zumbe Chohile nakweila unambule!”<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Zumbe Chohile kamema wedi na ukanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Chohile ywetu ni mta mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Zumbe Chohile awadima wakunyanyahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">umo nendile mwe nkunto zitendese anambulaga.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Miye sitondowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kanidamanyiza yedi.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Zumbe Chohile kunambula mwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">kunihangusa amesozi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">kuhonya iviga vyangu nisekwekobadika.<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Elo, nadaha kujenda kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">mwe isi ya wata ujima.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Nasizumila, elo niyo nagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">“Miye sisulumizwa vitendese.”<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Mwe izinkunto zanga nagambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Wantu wose ni wadanti.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Nanimvuzize mbwani Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">kwa wedi wakwe wose anitendele?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Nanimlavize ntambiko ya divai kwa kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">nanilombeze kwa zina dyakwe Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Nanizichintize izindagano zangu kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">kulongozi kwa wantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />File ya wantu wakukile inayombe kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:15">kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">chindedi miye ni mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">miye ni mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">mwana ywa msuntaviya, ywako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">kunambula mwe file.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Nahulavize ntambiko ya kuhongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">na kuditanga idizina dya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Nanichintize amalagane yangu kwako Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">kulongozi kwa wantu wose,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />mwe izinyuwa ze Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile hagati ha Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi za Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Mtogole Zumbe Chohile nyuwe wantu wose mwe izisi zose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">Mtogole uyo, nyuwe wantu wose.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Kwaviya ungi wakwe mwetu ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">ukanuni wa Zumbe Chohile wekala kale na kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s">Kuhongeza kwa Uhuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Mhongezeni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">ungi wakwe ni wa kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Wantu wa Izulaeli wagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">“Ungi wakwe ni wa Kale na kale.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Welekwa wa Haluni wagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">“Ungi wakwe ni za kale na kale”<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Wantu wose wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile wagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">“Ungi wakwe ni wa kale na kale.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Mwa amasulumizo yangu simwitanaga Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">uyo niyo anihitula kwa kunilekeila.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na miye sanogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">mntu naanitende mbwani?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na miye, nuyo akunambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">wankondo wangu naniwawone wakahundwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Nivyedi ukamgulukila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">ukaleka kwika msuhi kwa mntu.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Nivyedi ukamgulukila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">ukaleka kwikiya msuhi masekulu wa wantu.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Wantu we izisi zose nendile wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">mna nawabalangaga kwa nguvu ya Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Nawanizunguluka ntendele zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">mna nawabalangaga kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Nawanizunguluka saviya tuluma dya nyuchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">mna niyo wasunguza kubanika saviya miwa ikuhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">nawabalangaga kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Nasebungiswe hadodo nihudwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">mna Zumbe Chohile kanambiza.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Zumbe Chohile ni nguvu yangu nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">uyo mwenye nuwo uwambula wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Maizwi ya chinyemi na uhuda zavumila mlanga mwa wantu wata uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">“Umkono wa kulume wa Zumbe Chohile utenda ntendwa nkulu!<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Nguvu zakwe zichigaila uhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">udahi wakwe utenda mbuli nkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Sanibanike mna nanitende mjima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">miye nanitambalise ntendwa adamanye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Zumbe Chohile, kanisulumizisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">mna hanilekile nibanike.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Nivuguila izinchili zo uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">miye naningile na kumhongeza Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Ino ni nchili ya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">wata uwagila awodu wadaha kwingila.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Nahuhongeza, kwaviya kunihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">kutenda wambula wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Yuwe dilemelwe ni wazesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">ditenda yuwe kulu dya chegamilo.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Zumbe Chohile kadamanya vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">vino vyehela mwa ameso yetu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Dino ni zuwa dyo uhuda wa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">chitowe nchelejele na kwelelwa!<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Zumbe Chohile chambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">Zumbe Chohile, chinke kuchumilwa!<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Ujimbiko ni wa yudya akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Kulawa mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile chakujimbika.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Zumbe nuyo Chohile, uyo nachilangazize ulangazi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">Mkatenda na mahuto mwe imikono yenyu, damanyani ngasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">kubula kwe impembe ya amazabahu.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Weye wi Chohile ywangu, nahutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">weye wi Chohile ywangu nahuhongeze.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Mhongezeni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">ungi wakwe ni wa kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Wajimbikwa wadya wose wachumile mo uluijendo lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">wakujenda kwa kutimila sigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Wajimbikwa wadya wakutimila imiko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">wakumlonda kwa myoyo yawo yose,<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />awo hewekudamanya mbuli yoyose ihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">wakutimila viya akunga Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Zumbe Chohile kuchinka sigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">vileke chizitimile kwa ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Nahaunga ulujendo lwangu lwachumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">mwe kutimila amalagizo yako!<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Uneva nnatoza amalagizo yako yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">sanijelwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Nahutogole kwa moyo uchumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">umo hahina imiko yako yose yo uwagila.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Nanimile amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">usekujeza kunasa!<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutimila sigilizi ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Mbwanga natunduliye uwikazi wakwe kutenda wedi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Kwa kuiyalongoza kuligana no ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Nahikiliza kunyanyahala kwa moyo wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">usekunile nihituke amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Sitoza ulosi wako mo umoyo wanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">vileke nisekukola masa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Ujimbikwe weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">nihinya amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Kwa milomo yangu nanitamwile amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">zikulawa mo umlomo wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Nelelwa kutimila amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">saviya mntu akwelelwa ugoli ulozize.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Naniyafanyanye amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">na kutimila viya unihinyize.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Nanelelwe amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">naho sanihufye ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinyemi mwe Malagizo ya Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Unitendele miye mndima ywako kwa chisekwesekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">vileke nikale na kutoza ulosi.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Finyula ameso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">vileke nidahe kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">mbuli zikwehela mwa amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Miye ni mjeni muno mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">usekunifisa amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Umoyo wangu wangadika kwa nkwina ikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">waunga umanye izinkanto zako chipindi chose.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Wawakwahila wata kweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">waligitwa wadya wose hewekutimila amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Nusiza ubezi na utilizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">kwaviya natimila amalagizo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Masekulu wekala hamwenga na kunizigiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">mna miye nanitimile amahinyo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Malagizo yako yanelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">ayo yaninka ulangilizi.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutoza sigilizi za Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Sigonezwa hasi he malumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">dima ujima wangu kuligana na ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Sikugambila izisila wenawe niyo wanihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">nihinya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Nihinya nimanye imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">miye nimanye izimpituko zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Untu wangu usakazwa ni chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">nitogeza kuligana no ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Unegeze sila za wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">unihinye kwa wedi isigilizi yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Sisagula sila ya chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">moyo wangu utoza imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Sing'ang'anila imiko yako, Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">usekunileka nijelwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Nanitimile amalagizo yako ye imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">kwaviya waninka umanyi utendese.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kupata umanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Zumbe Chohile, nihinya kutimila amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">miye naniyatoze kubula udumo.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Ninka umanyi, miye nanitoze imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">na kuitimila kwa moyo wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Nilongoza mwe sila ya malagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">kwaviya nayelelwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Onyekeza umoyo wangu utimile imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">usekunionyekeza mwe mbuli zangu mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Chinda ameso yangu nisekusinya mbuli zo uhezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">dima uwikazi wangu kuligana ne izisila zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Chintiza viya ulongile kwa mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">ndagano ulongile mwa wadya wose wakukutimila weye.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Nusiza soni ikunogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">kwaviya imiko yako ni yedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Kaula ivyo hubesa nitimile amalagizo yako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">Ninka ujima mhya kwaviya mo ukanuni wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwikiya msuhi Imiko ya Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Zumbe Chohile, nilagisa ungi wako hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">naho unambule kuligana na ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Aho, nanidahe kumhitula yoyose akunihuluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">kwaviya nekiya msuhi wangu mwe ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Nidahizo kulonga chindedi chipindi chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">kwaviya naikiya msuhi mo ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Nitimile imiko yako mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Nanikale hatende silekeilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">kwaviya natimila amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Nanitambalise amalagizo yako kulongozi kwa maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">naho saniwone soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Kwaviya nelelwa mwe kutimila amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">kwaviya nayaunga.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Naitunya na kuyunga imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">miye naniyafanyanye amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msuhi mwe imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Kumbuka ulosi kwa miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">kwaviya kuninka msuhi miye mndima ywako.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Hatenda mwe masulumizo msuhi wangu nuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">kwaviya ndagano yako yaninka ujima.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Wata kweduvya wanisezenga hehena kusokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">mna sanileke imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Zumbe Chohile, nakumbuka imiko yako ya chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">iyo yanisangalaza.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Nemukwa ni maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">umo hawona wantu wavu watula imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">nemukwa ni maya.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Malagizo yako niyo inkongelo ye izinchemo zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">hohose hwikala.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Zumbe Chohile, nechilo nakumbuka idizima dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">miye nanitimile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Yano yatenda mazwela yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:56">natoza amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutimila miko ya Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Zumbe Chohile, weye wi chihendo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">selisa kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Silombeza kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">niwonela mbazi kuligana na viya ulongile!<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Sifanyanya izisila zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">elo, suya natimila amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Nanisunguze kudamanya hehena kukawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Wantu wavu wenika mitengo wanigwize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">mna miye sikujala imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Chilo cha minane nenuka na kukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">kwachausa cha malagizo yako yawagile.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Miye ni mbuya ywa wadya wose wakukuvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">na wadya wakutimila amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Zumbe Chohile isi imema ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">nihinya amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujejeje we Isigilizi ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Kunitendela yedi miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">saviya walongaga, weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Nihinya umanyi na kulamula vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">kwaviya sika msuhi mwe imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Umo hwinati kunisulumiza nasaga isila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">mna haluse natimila ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Weye wi ywedi, icho ukutenda ni chedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">nihinya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Hata hegu wata kweduvya waniziga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">mna miye natoza imiko yako kwa moyo wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Myoyo yawo imema uhezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">mna miye nabweda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Nkanto itenda yedi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">kwaviya initenda nihine imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Miko wikiye ni yedi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">kujinka ugoli wose we mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwagila we Imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Ni weye unumbile, mikono yako inidamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">ninka umanyi vileke nihine imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Wakukuvikila nawaniwone na kwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">kwaviya msuhi wangu wi moulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Zumbe Chohile, sivimanya nkanto zako zichuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">kunikantila kwa ukanuni wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Ungi wako hewine udumo unitondowaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">kuligana ne indagano kwa mndima ywako.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Niwonela mbazi vileke nitende na ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">kwaviya nabweda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Wata kweduvya wajelwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">kwaviya waniziga mbuli zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">mna miye nanifanyanye imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Wose wakukuvikila weze kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">wose wamanyize izisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Moyo wangu usekutenda na lema mwe imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">vileke nisekujelwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malombezo kwachausa cha kwambulwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Sisokela vidala kwa kugoja unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">msuhi wangu nawika mo ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Meso yangu yafifiya hagoja ndagano yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">miye nauza, “Nawize ini unitondowaze?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Sitenda mankunyankunya saviya vunje dimwe mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">mna vyose sijaile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Miye mndima ywako nanigoje kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Wadya wakunisulumiza nowakantile ini?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Wata kweduvya wanisimbila mabome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">vikuhigana ne imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Imiko yako yose ni yo ukanuni na chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">unambize kwaviya wantu wanilaha kwa udanti.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Kenga wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">mna silekile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Nidamanyiza yedi kuligana no wedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">miye nanitimile imiko yako ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzumizi mo ulosi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Zumbe Chohile, ulosi wako ni wakale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">wachimala utogile kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Ukanuni wako naujendeleze mwe ivyeleko vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">isi kuika hantu hakwe, nayo yakela mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Imiko yako yekala kubula dyelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">kwaviya vintu vyose vyakuasankanila.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Hegu nendile sikubweda imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">nasangadika mwe nkunto zangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Sanijeze kujala imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">kwaviya kuninka ujima kujinkila izo.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Nambula kwaviya miye ni ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">kwaviya silonda imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Wantu wavu wagoja wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">mna miye nafanyanya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Sibunkula kugamba chila chintu chabula udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">mna imiko yako haina mihaka.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyunga imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Nayungisa imiko yako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">Naifanyanya msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Imiko yako ininka umanyi utendese kujinka awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">kwaviya naitoza mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Miye simanya kujinka wadya wose wanihinyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">kwaviya nafanyanya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Nna umanyi kujinka wadalahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">kwaviya natimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Sechinda iviga vyangu nisekutimila sila zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">vileke nidahe kutoza ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Silekile imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">kwaviya kunihinya weye mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Milosi yako ibuka mwile kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">imwile kujinka uchi!<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />Mwe imiko yako napata ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">elo nehiwe chila lujendo lwihiye.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko ya Zumbe yalangaza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Ulosi wako ni ta ya kunilongoza iviga vyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">na ulangazi mwe isila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Selisa na kwekamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">kugamba nanitimile imiko yako ikuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Zumbe Chohile, sisulumizwa vidala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">niwonela mbazi uwikazi wangu kuligana na ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Zumbe Chohile, hokela ntogozi za kweungila zo umlomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">kwa kunihinya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Hamwenga na kugamba uwikazi wangu nauwambaza mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">mna sanijale imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Wantu wavu wanitegela mtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">mna silekile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Imiko yako nulisi wangu kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">heye ni mbwedo wo umoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Sekamba kwa moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">kutimila imiko yako kubula udumo.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutondowala mwe Imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Naweihiwa wata kukanganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">mna nayunga imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Weye wi sumkilo dyangu na nchinga yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">sika msuhi wangu mo ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Halaweni hangu, nyuwe mkudamanya yehiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">Vileke nitimile imiko ya Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Ninka udahi saviya ulongile, miye nanitende na ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">usekuleka msuhi wangu ubanike!<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Nidahiza miye nikale mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">nanitimile imiko yako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Wawalemela wadya wose hewekutimila imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">kwaviya udanti wawo ni wa bule.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Wavu wose mwe isi wawadula saviya ntaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">elo, miye nayunga imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Nazingiza kwa kukogoha weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">simema nkama kwachausa che izinkanto zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutimila imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Sidamanya mbuli zedi zichumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">usekunileka mwemikono ya wankondo wangu!<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Nelisiza wambizi miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">usekuleka wata kweduvya wanilumize.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Meso yangu yafifiya, nagoja wambula wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">nagoja uchintize ulosi wako we chindedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Nitendela miye mndima ywako kuligana na ungi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">unihinye imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Miye ni mndima ywako, ninka umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">vileke nimanye imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Zumbe Chohile, vino haluse ni chipindi chako cha kudamanya chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">kwaviya wantu hawakutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Kwaviya nayunga imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">heye kujinka zahabu ichiligwe vyedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Elo, nanitimile imiko yako yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">nehiwa sila zose zihiye.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubesa kutimila imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Imiko yako yehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">elo, naniitoze.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Malangilizo ya amahinyo yako yaleta ulangazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">yawenka ubala wantu hewemanyize chintu.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Sigubula umlomo wangu na kutweta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">nabesa vitendese nitimile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Nihitukila naho niwona mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">saviya ukuwadamanyiza wadya wakukunga.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Longoza izinkacho zangu kuligana na ulosi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">usekuleka masa yoyose yanilongoze.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Nambula mwe wihi wa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">vileke nidahe kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Nilangaza kwa ulangazi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">naho nihinya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Meso yangu yetika mesozi saviya mto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">kwaviya wantu hawakutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujejeje we imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Zumbe Chohile, weye wimta uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">nkanto zako zawagila.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Imiko yako uchinkile yawagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">ichinta kikanuni.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Sihiwa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">kwaviya wankondo wangu wabela imilosi yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Ndagano zako zichinta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">miye mndima ywako nazunga.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Miye ni mdodo naho nabelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">mna sikujala imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Uwagila wako ni wakale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">ne imiko yako ni chindedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Nkunto na chinyulu vinipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">mna imiko yako yanelela.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Imiko yako yawagila mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">yaninka umanyi vileke nidahe kuta mjima.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kukombolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Nakwitanga kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">nihitula weye Zumbe Chohile, miye nanitimile imiko yako yose!<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Nakwitanga unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">miye nanitoze imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Zuwa hedinati kutontomoka, nakulombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">sika msuhi wangu mo ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Chilo chose sifinya ngohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">vileke nidahe kufanyanya amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Kwa mbazi zako weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">nifila mbazi uhonye uwikazi wangu kuligana ne imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Wadya wakwika mizungu ihiye wehajihi na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">mna wehale ne imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Mna weye Zumbe Chohile wihajihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">imiko yako yose ni yachindedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Kukongela chikale sihina amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">kuyaika vileke yekale kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Kaula sulumizo dyangu unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">kwaviya sijaile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Nigombela na kunambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">uninke ujima kuligana na ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Wambula wako wihale na wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">kwaviya hawakulonda amalagizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Zumbe Chohile, mbazi zako ziloza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">nilagisa mbazi zako na kunambula kuligana na viya ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Wankondo wakunisulumiza waloza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">mna miye saniileke imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Umo hawasinya hewekuzumila, nehiwa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">kwaviya hawakutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Kaula ivyo hunga amalagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">Zumbe Chohile, ninka ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">kuligana no ungi wako!<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Milosi yako yose ulongile ni chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">malagizo yako yose yachuma, yekala kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutimila imiko ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Masekulu wanebunga hehena luhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">mna miye natunya imilosi yako kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Nelelwa ulosi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">saviya mntu atahile vintu vya yombe kulu kwe nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Nemukwa ni maya na kwihiwa udanti vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">mna naunga imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Chila zuwa nakutogola nkanana mfungate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">kwachausa che imiko yako iwagile.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Wakunga imiko yako wana utondowazi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">hahana chintu chikudaha kuwagwisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Zumbe Chohile, nakugoja unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">miye nanitimile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Natimila imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">kwaviya yaniwagila vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Natimila imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">kwaviya sila zangu zose zimanyika kwako.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Ndilo yangu ya wambizi ikubwile, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">ninka umanyi kuligana na ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Malombezo yangu yabule kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">nambula kuligana na ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Nanilonge ntogozi zako ulo na ulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">kwaviya wanihinya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Nanicheme ulosi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">kwaviya imiko yako yose yawagila.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Mazuwa yose wemalanye kunambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">kwaviya natimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Zumbe nabesa unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">imiko yako niyo hubweda.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Ninka ujima vileke nidahe kukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">ne imiko yako inambize.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Sangadika saviya ngoto yagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">nilonda miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">kwaviya sijaile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Mwe nkanto zangu namwitangaga Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">uyo niyo anihitula.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Zumbe Chohile unambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">mwe milomo ya wantu wakulonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">na lulimi lukudanta.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Nyuwe wantu wadanti, namwinkigwe chintu chani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">Namsulumizwe vivihi?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Namsulumizwe kwa misale ikutwa ya wakankalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">kwa nkala za moto ukwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">za mti wa mhingo<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Naniluwone kwaviya ni mjeni mwe imizi ya Meshaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">hegu nekala mwa amahema ya Kedeli!<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Sikalisa mazuwa yalozese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">mwa wadya wakuwihiwa utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Miye ni mntu ywa utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">mna halonga, wowo waunga chikomane.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s">Chohile ni mwamizi ywetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Nikaule kulanga kwa amagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">wambizi wangu naulawe kuhi?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Wambizi wangu walawa kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">Mumbi ywe imbingu ne isi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Hakuleke ugwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">mwamizi ywako hakusinka.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Mwamizi ywa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">hakusinka hegu kugona.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Zumbe Chohile ni mwamizi ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">entendele yako ya kulume kukwamila.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Zuwa hadikoke nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">hegu mnenge haukulumize nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Zumbe Chohile nakuchinde na chila wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">namile uwikazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Zumbe Chohile nakwamile ukengila na ukafosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">kukongela haluse na kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi za Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Naselelwa weze wanigambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“Chite kwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Iviga vyetu vichimala mndani mwe inchili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:2">weye Yelusalemu,<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Yelusalemumzi uzengigwe vitogese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">vileke utozane hamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Uko nuko amakabila ya Izulaeli yakwita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">kumhongeza Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">kuligana na amalagizo wenkigwe Waizulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Uko nuko kune ivigoda vye inkanto vye inyumba ya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">vigoda vya kulamuila vye chiseuta vya inyumba ya Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Ulombezezeni umzi wa Yelusalemu utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">Wose wakukunga wachumilwe.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Mndani mwe iviwambaza vyako mtende na utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">mndani mwe izingome zako mtende mpeho.<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Kwachausa cha wantu we ikaya yangu na walukolo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">nagamba, “Utondowazi utende mwako!”<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Kwachausa che Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">nakulombezeza uchumilwe.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza chimbazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Zumbe Chohile meso yangu yakukaula weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">ukwikala kulanga kwe imbingu.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Saviya wandima wakumwikiya msuhi sekulu ywawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">saviya msuntaviya akumwikiya msuhi kwa mkaza sekulu ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">nivyo chikukwiya msuhi weye Zumbe Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">kubula hadya nochifile mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Chifile mbazi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">kwaviya chijijimiza ubezi ulozese.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Chihulutiswa ni wata kweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">chibeleswa ni wata kwefenya.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s">Chohile ni mwamizi ywa wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Hegu Zumbe Chohile hatendile ntendele yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">hegu Chohile hatendile intendele yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">longani nyose mwi muno mwa Yelusalemu!<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />“Hegu Chohile hatendile ntendele yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">umo awankondo wetu wamemukwe ni maya,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />nawachimela chichei wajima,<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />nachizolwa ni nkulujumbu ya mazi ya bohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">mazi yalozize nayachigubika,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />nkulumbuzo ya mazi yabohole nayachizola.”<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Zumbe Chohile atogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">uyo hechilekile chikomwe ni wankondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Chichupuluka saviya kadege mwe mtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">mtego uvunwa, naswi chichulupuka!<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Wambizi wetu ni mwedizina dya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">aumbile imbingu ne isi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s">Utondolo wantu wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Wadya wekiye msuhi wawo kwa Zumbe Chohile ni saviya lugulu lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">hausingisike watoga kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Saviya magulu yakuizunguluka Yelusalumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">nivyo Zumbe Chohile akuwazunguluka awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">kukongela haluse na kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Useuta wa wantu wavu hawikalise mwe isi ya wata uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">vileke wata uwagila nawo wanase kudamanya wavu.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Zumbe Chohile watendele yedi wantu wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">wadya wachumi wa myoyo.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Mna wadya wakuhituka na kutimila sila zawo zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Zumbe Chohile nawabalaze hamwenga na wakudamanya wavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Utondowazi utende mwa awantu wa Izulaeli!<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Umo Zumbe Chohile eze achivuze Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">chendaga saviya wantu wakulota sozi!<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Chelewa na kuseka kwa chinyemi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Wantu we izisi ntuhu niyo wagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“Zumbe Chohile kawatendela mbuli nkulu.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Zumbe Chohile kachitendela mbuli nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">suwe chelelwa vidala.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Zumbe Chohile chivuzize awantu wetu watahigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">saviya mito ikupata mazi vituhu mwe idijangwa dya Negebu.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Wakuhanda kuno waila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">nawavune kwa nchemo za mbwedo.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Wadya wose wakwita kuhanda mbeyu kuno waila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">nawauye kwa chinyemi wakatenda wenula ulozo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa wedi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Nyumba haina zengingwe ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">wazesi wazenga vya bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">mzi haunamilwe ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">wakuwamila wacheleza vya bule.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Mwetumbwadisa vya bule kusunguza kwinuka mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">na kukawa kugona mkatumbwazikila nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Zumbe Chohile awenka nkande wose akuwaunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">hata umo wagona.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Wana ni jeleko kulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">wana ni ujimbiko kulawa kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Saviya misale mwe mikono ya mgomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">wana welekwe ni mntu achei mbwanga mdodo,<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Kajimbikwa yudya idizyaka dyakwe dimema misale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">Hahudye ni wankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">umo akadugana na awankondo wakwe kwechitala.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s">Jeleko kwa wadya wakumtunya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Ujimbiko ni wa wawadya wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">wakwikala kwa kutimila imiko yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Nopate ntunda ze indima yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">ujimbiko na kuchumilwa navitende vyako.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Mkaziwo natende saviya mzabibu ukweleka ntunda zilozize mnyumba mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">wanawo nawatende saviya masukuzi ya mizaituni kuzunguluka imeza yako.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Nivyo akunga ajimbikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">mntu akumvikila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Zumbe Chohile akujimbika kulawa Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">Uwone kuchumulwa kwa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">mazuwa yose yo wikazi wako!<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />Nakungila wikazi mtali uwone wezukulu wako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Utondowazi utende mwa Izulaeli!<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo kuwalanga wankondo wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Situmbwadiswa vidala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">kukongela ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">chila mntu mwa Izulaeli agamba,<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />“Situmbwadiswa vidala kukongela ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">mna wadundunga kunihuda.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Wanilumiza vihiye mo mgongo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">niyo watenda malilinti saviya mlimi akulima nkonde.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Mna Zumbe Chohile ni mkanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">kakanta izisigi za awo awantu wehiye.”<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Wadya wose wakuihiwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">wahayuswe na kuvuzwa kunyuma kwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Watende saviya nyasi mlanga mwe hala dya nyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">ikunyuluka hainati kukula,<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />hahana akwetumbwadisa kuzichisanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">hegu kuzinula saviya machisa.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Hahana akujinka hajihi akunga awagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“Zumbe Chohile awajimbikeni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Awajimbike kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Kulawa mwe mwina we izinkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">sikwitanga weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Wive indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">tegela gutwi idizwi dye idilombezo dyangu!<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Uneva weye Zumbe Chohile wakumbuke amasa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">ni yuhi nakadaha kwenega inkanto?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Mna kwako kuna kulekeilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">elo weye wogohigwa.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Namgoja Zumbe Chohile, miye nakugoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">mo ulosi wakwe naika msuhi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Namgoja Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kujinka ivyo wamizi wakugoja kuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">heye kujinka wamizi wakugoja kuche.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Weye Izulaeli, mwikiye msuhi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwaviya ungi wakwe haukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">naho kwakwe kuna ukombolwa uchintile.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Uyo mwenye nawakombole Waizulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">kulawa mwa amasa yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kutondowala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Zumbe Chohile moyo wangu haukweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">miye suyo mtu ywa kwefyenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">sikwetumbwadisa mwe mbuli nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">hegu mbuli za zikwehela kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Mna setondowaza na kwenyamaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">saviya mwana onkile kale akutondowala mweviga vya nine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">nivyo nami nitondowale.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Weye Izulaeli mwikiye msuhi Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">kukongela haluse na kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi ye Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Zumbe Chohile mkumbuke Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">ne izinkunto zose ajijimize.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Kelisa cheliso kwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">na kwika nazili kwa uyo Mta Nguvu ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />“Saningile mwe inyumba yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">hegu kugona molusazi lwangu,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />sanigone hegu kusinka,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />kubula hadya hunga huzengele hantu hakwikala weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">weye Chohile Mta Nguvu ywa Yakobo.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Uko Efulata chevaga izimbuli ze idishanduku dye Idilagano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">chidibwila kwezinkonde za Yealimu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Niyo chagamba, “Chiteni kwe Inyumba ya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">chikavike kulongozi kwe ichigoda chakwe cho useuta chokwiya iviga.”<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Inuka weye Zumbe Chohile kulawa ahantu hako ho kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">inuka hamwenga ne Idishanduku dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">chilagiso che izinguvu zako, wikale umo kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Walavyantambiko wako watende wakanuni mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">wakanuni wako wacheme kwa chinyemi!<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Kwa chausa cha Daudi mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">usekumlemela yudya ujeile mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Zumbe Chohile kamwelisiza Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">cheliso cha chindedi, icho hachitenkulwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“Nanimtende seuta yumwe ywa wanawo mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">alongoze weye ukaheza.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Uneva wanawo wanatoza idilagano dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">ne imiko hunga niwahinye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">iviya wana wawo we chilume nawatende maseuta kale na kale saviya weye.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Zumbe Chohile kausagula umzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">kaunga utende ni wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />“Hano naho nanikale kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">nuwo wikazi wangu kwaviya sihasagula.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Naniujimbike umzi wa Sayuni kwa kumwinka chila chintu ukunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">naniweguse kwa nkande wachiwa wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Naniwajimbike walavyantambiko wakwe mwe chila chintu wakudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">na awantu wakwe nawacheme na kutowa nchelegele za chinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Aho nanimtende seuta mkulu yumwe ywa awelekwa wa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">saviya ta ikwaka nanimdahize seuta nisagule.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Wankndo wako naniwajele soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">mna useuta wakwe nanijendeleze kuutogeza.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s">Wedi wa umwe mwe walukolo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Ni mbuli yedi naho ikuwagila vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">walukolo kwikala hamwenga wakafanyanyiza chalumwe!<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Ni saviya mavuta ya yombe kulu yajidigwe momtwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">yakujuluzika mwe izindevu, yajuluzika mwe izindevu za Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">kubula mo ukosi we inkazu yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Ni saviya mnyuzu wo ulugulu lwa Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">ukulagala mlanga mwa awagulu wa Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">Uko nuko Zumbe Chohile alongile nawajimbike awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">na ujima hewina uhelo.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s">Mwitango wa kumtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">nyuwe nyose wandima wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">nyuwe nyose mkusankana nechilo mwe Inyumba yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Inulani imikono yenyu kuhinga ahantu hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">na kumtogola Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Zumbe Chohile aumbile imbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">ne isi awajimbikeni kulawa Sayuni!<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Ditogoleni idizina dyakwe, nyuwe wandima wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />nyuwe mkusankana mndani mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">mwe izinyuwa ze Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">dichemeleni ntogozi idizina dyakwe kwaviya vyawagila.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kamsagula Yakobo atede ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">wantu wa Izulaeli watende ugoli wakwe mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Simanya kugamba Zumbe Chohile ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">Zumbe ywetu ni mkulu kujinka milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Zumbe Chohile adamanya chochose akunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">kwembingu na mweisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">mwe ibahali ne imizumilizo yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Nuyo akuhosa maingu yakwele kulawa uhelo we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">adamanya lumwemwe hamwenga na fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">na kwigala nkung'unto kulawa aho aikiye.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Nuyo akomile welekwa wa nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">wa wantu na wanyama uko kweisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Uko adamanyaga vilagiso na mpituko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">kumkantila seuta na wandima wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Nuyo atowaga si zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">kakoma maseuta wata nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na Ogu seuta ywa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na maseuta wose wa Kanani.<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />Aguhaga izisi zawo na kuwenka awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">chani zitende wa Waizulaeli.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Zumbe Chohile, zina dyako dyekala kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">nokumbukwe ni ivyeleko vyose.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Zumbe Chohile nawagombele wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">na kuwawonela mbazi wandima wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Milungu ya wantu we izisi ntuhu idamanywa kwa mayuwe ya chumbu na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">idamanywa kwa mikono ya wantu.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Amatukulu yawo yana milomo mna hayakudaha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">yana meso mna hayakudaha kuwona.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Yana magutwi mna hayakudaha kwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">naho hayakudaha kuhema.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Wadya wakuidamanya nawaligane nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">seivyo wose wakuikiya msuhi.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe walavyantambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Nyuwe Walawi, mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">nyuwe mkumvikila mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">mtogoleni uyo akwikala Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya kumhongeza Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Mhongezeni Zumbe Chohile kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Mhongezeni Chohile mkulu ywe imilungu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Mhongezeni Zumbe mkulu ywa mazumbe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Uyo ichedu nuyo akudamanya mbuli nkulu zikwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Kwa umanyi wakwe kaumba imbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />nuyo atantalike isi mlanga mwe mizumilizo ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />nuyo aumbile idizuwa no mnenge ne izintondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />zuwa dilangaze nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />mnenge ne izintondo vilangaze nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />nuyo akomile welekwa wa nkongo mwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />niyo awalavya Waizulaeli mwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />kwa mkono wakwe una udahi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Nuyo aisangile haidi ibahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />niyo awajisa awantu wa Izulaeli hagatigati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />mna niyo amfinankiza Falao na awagomba nkondo wakwe mwe Ibahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />nuyo awalongoze awantu wakwe kwedijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />nuyo akomile maseuta wata nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />nuyo akomile maseuta wamanyikise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />niyo amkoma Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />na seuta Ogu ywa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />niyo ataha izisi zawo na kuwenka awantu utende ulisi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />zitende za Izulaeli mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />nuyo achikumbuke mo usokezi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />niyo achambula mwa awankondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale,<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />nuyo akwinkiza nkande kwa chila chumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Mhongezeni Chohile ywa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">kwaviya ungi wakwe ni wakale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s">Malombolezo ko ujeni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Mpezo mwe imito ya Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">chekalaga na kulomboleza chize chikumbuke Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Mwe imiti ye idya isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">chihasika amazeze yetu.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Wose wachitahile wachigamba chiwachemele nchemo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">wankondo wetu waunga nchemo ya chinyemi, wachigamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">“Chichemeleni nchemo imwenga ya Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Nachidahe vivihi kuchema nchemo za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">mwesi ya chijeni?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Nnakujala weye Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">elo mkono wangu wa kulume uswese udahi wa kutowa zeze vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Lulimi lwangu luzamise sinakutunyize weye Yelusalemu wikulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">uneva sina kukumbuke weye mbwedo wangu ukulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">uneva sina kutunyize weye Yelusalemu hukwelela vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Zumbe Chohile, usekujala yadya wachidamanyize wantu wa Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">zuwa diya Waizulaeli watahigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">Wagambaga, “Bogozolani amazengo yose yo umzi wa Yelusalemu!”<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Nyuwe wantu wa Babeli nambalangwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">Kajimbikwa yudya akunga achilihizize chikoda mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">kwa yadya uchitendele.<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Kajimbikwa yudya nawaguhe wanawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">na kuwasapuila mlanga mwe.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya kuhongeza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Nakutogola weye Zumbe Chohile, kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">nachema ntogozi zako kulongozi kwe imilungu.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Nafika madi kuhinga kwe Inyumba yako ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">miye naniditogole idizina dyako kwachausa cho ungi na ukanuni wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwaviya kudikuza idizina dyako no ulosi wako mwe ivintu vyose.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Umo hwitange kunihitula, kunijenyeza udahi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Maseuta wose mwe isi wakutogole weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">kwaviya wawiva ulosi wako.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Awo nawacheme ntogozi ze izitendwa zako, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">kwaviya ukulu wako ukulisa.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Hatahegu Zumbe Chohile ekulanga, awakaula wasokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">mna wata kweduvya wawamanya kulawa hale.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Hata hajinkila mwe nkunto weye wanidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">wawahiga wankondo wangu wata maya vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">wanihonya kwa udahi wako mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Zumbe Chohile chintiza umwalo wako wose unigambile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">weye Zumbe Chohile ungi wako wekala kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s">Chohile kamanya mbuli zose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Zumbe Chohile, kunizuza na kunimanya chila chintu.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Kumanya chila mbuli hudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">kumanya izifanyanyi zangu kulawa hale.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Waniwona hajenda hegu hagona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">kumanya izisila zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Hata sinati kulonga mbuli yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">weye Zumbe Chohile kumanya chiya hunga nilonge.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Wi chila ntendele yangu, kulongozi na kunyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">wanamila kwa udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Umanyi wako ukulisa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">ukulisa sikudaha kuumanya.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Nisumkile kuhi uko hwikuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">Nite kuhi uko sahubwile?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Uneva hakwela kulanga kwembingu, weye wiyuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">hasela hasi kwa wabanike, weye wiyuko.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Uneva nnakwela kubula ulailo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">hata hekala uhelo we bahali,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />hata uko wiyuko unilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">mkono wako wa kulume wanegamiza.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Hegu nachigambile chiza chinigubike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">hegu ulangazi unizunguluke utende chilo,<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />kwako chiza sicho chiza, chilo nachilangaze saviya msi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kwaviya chiza nisaviya ulangazi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Kwaviya niweye unumbile ivitago vya mndani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">kunilungamanya mwe inda ya mnala.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Nakutogola kwaviya sumbwa vikwehela na vya maula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">ntendwa zako ni za kwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">miye sivimanya ivyo,<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Mavuha yangu hayefisize kulongozi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">umo haumbwa mwe inda ya mnala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">umo halungamanywa mwe inda ya mnala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">hakula chinyele weye nakuvimanya kugamba niyaho.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />Weye kuniwona nichei sinati kwelekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">mazuwa yo ujima wangu wose unipangile kuyawandika mwechitabu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">umo hedinati kutendeka hata zuwa dimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Zumbe Chohile, fanyanyi zako ni nkulu vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">hazikudahika kuwazika.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Hegu naziwazize naziloza kujinka msanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">Henuka nichei hamwenga na weye.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Zumbe Chohile, najelejeza wantu wavu wakomwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">Nahaungisa wakomi wahalawe hangu!<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Walonga mbuli zihiye kukulanga weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">walonga wihi kulanga idizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Zumbe Chohile, nisekuweihiwa wadya wakukwihiwa weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">Nisekuwonela maya wadya wakukuhituka?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Naweihiwa vitendese awo wakukwiihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">nawawona ni wankondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Zumbe Chohile, nizuza umanye umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">nihima umanye izifanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Ukaule mndani mwangu uneva ulujendo lwanga lwiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">unilongoze mwe sila yo ujima wa kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya kudimwa ni Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Zumbe Chohile nambula mwe wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:1">nidima na wantu wakweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Waika mizungu ihiye mwe myoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">mazuwa yose watigiza nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Izindimi zawo ni nkali saviya nyoka, milosi ikulawa mwe imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">nisaviya usungu wa myombo.<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Zumbe Chohile, nidima mwe mikono ya wantu wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">nika mpeho kulawa mwe wantu wehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">wakwika mwalo wa kunigwisa.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Wata kweduvya wenika mitego vileke wanigwize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">watantalika sigi za lwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">wenika mitego mwe isila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Zumbe Chohile, miye nagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">“Weye wi Zumbe Chohile ywangu”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">Unive indilo yangu na kunambiza.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Zumbe Chohile Mwambula ywangu mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">kunidima mwe nkondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Zumbe Chohile, usekuwenka wantu wavu kuchumilwa mwe viya wakunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">wanasekweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Usekuwaleka awankondo wanihude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">mbuli wanizigilize kwa milomo yawo ziwawiye wenye.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Wagwelwe ni nkala za moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">wadulwe mo moto mwe mabome tali ditendese wasekwinuka vituhu'<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Wakuwazigiliza watuhu wasekuchumilwa mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">file ziwagwele wantu wata kweduvya.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />Sivimanya kugamba Zumbe Chohile awenka wachiwa uwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">na kuwagombela hewene chintu.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Chindedi wata uwagila nawaditogole idizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">wakanuni nawekale kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya chisingi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Zumbe Chohile nakwitanga weye, sunguza wize kwangu unambize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Wive idizwi dyangu umo hakwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Lombezo dyangu dibule kwako saviya ufumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">kwinula mikono yangu kulanga kutende saviya ntambiko ya chisingi.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Zumbe Chohile, ika mwamizi mo umlomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">dima imilomo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Usekuuwonyekeza umoyo wangu kwe mbuli ihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">nnasekuzwela ntendwa zihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">hamwenga na wantu wakudamanya wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">naho nsekudya nkande ze izingasu zawo.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Mntu mta uwagila anitowe kwa ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">anilangilize kwa kunikwahila, ni mavuta mo mtwi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">mtwi wangu hauilemele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">hata ivyo malombezo yangu mazuwa yose yahigana na wakutenda wavu.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Umo masekulu wawo wakadulwa hasi kulawa mwe izinyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">wantu wavu nawamanye kugamba milosi yangu yendaga ya chindedi.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Saviya nkuni zisabantulwe mwe isanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">nivyo amavuha yetu yamwaganiswe mwe mlomo wa mbila.<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Mna miye nakukaula weye Zumbe, Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">sisumkila kwako, usekunileka nibanike.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Unidime mwe imitego wanitegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">unenegeze mwa amatasi ya wantu awavu.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Wantu wehi wagwizwe mwe imitego yawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">umo miye hajinka unenegeze.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Namwilila Zumbe Chohile kwa izwi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:1">nenula izwi dyangu kwa Zumbe Chohile anifile mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Negala fuzumo dyangu kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">namgambila nkunto yangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Umo nifile chevu, ni weye umanyize izisila zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">Mwe izisila hujenda wantu wenenikila mitego.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Kaula kulume kwangu uwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">hahana hata yumwe akunambiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">Hahana akwetumbwadisa kwachausa changu.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Elo, nakwilila weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">nagamba “Weye wi sumkilo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">fungu dyangu mweisi ya wata ujima.”<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Tegeleza indilo yangu unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaviya miye ni msokezi vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">Nambula mwa awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaviya awo wanihuma nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Nivugula mwe ichifungo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">vileke huhongeze mwe mdugano wa awantu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Wantu wakanuni nawelunge na miye kwachausa cha wedi wako kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s">Lombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Zumbe Chohile wive lombezo dyangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">Kwaviya weye wawagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">naho wimkanuni soo unambize.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Usekunikantila miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">kwaviya hahana mta ujima akuwagila kulongozi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Wankondo wangu wanitimila, wanigwisa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">wanitenda nikale mwe chiza saviya wantu wabanike chikale.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Loho yangu ifa chevu vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">moyo wangu ufanene kwa woga.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Nakumbuka mazuwa ye chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nafanyanya mwe izindima zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nasungulumanya ndima zidamanywe ni imikono yako.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Nachulusa imikono yangu kwako kuno nalombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">nna nchilu, saviya sanga inyalise.<verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Zumbe Chohile, sunguza nihitula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Sihwelesa usekunefisiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">hegu sivyo nanitende sawadya wakusela kwa wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Elo, mtondo nigaila ulosi wa ungi wako hewine udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaviya msuhi wangu siwika kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">Lombezo dyangu nadionyekeza kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">nilagisa sila yakujinkila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaviya sikwikiya msuhi weye.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Zumbe Chohile unambule mwe wankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">kwaviya sisumkila kwako.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Nihinya nitende viya ukunga nitende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">kwaviya weye wi Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">loho yako yedi inilongoze mwesi ideleke.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Zumbe Chohile, kwachausa che idizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">nambula ujima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">kwa uwagila wako, nilavya mwe nkunto.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Kwachausa cho ungi wako kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">wakome awankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">wabalange wose wakunisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">kwaviya miye ni mndima ywako.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s">Ntogozi kwa Chohile kwa uhuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Ajimbikwe Zumbe Chohile, mwamizi ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">Akuihinya imikono yangu nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">akuhinya awadole wangu kutowana,<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />uyo ni mwamizi ywangu, uyo ni ngome naho ni mwambula ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">nchinga yangu hugulukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">uyo awanyanyahaza wantu we izisi ntuhu hasi he iviga vyangu.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Zumbe Chohile, mntu ni chintu chani vikuleka umtunduliye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">mwili ni chintu chani vikuleka waufanyanya?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Mntu ni saviya muye du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">mazuwa yakwe yenga chizuli chikujinka.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Zumbe Chohile, tula izimbingu zako usele hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">donta amagulu vileke yalavye mosi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Mulika lumwemwe lwa mbaula uwatimulaganye awankondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">taila mifulo yako uwabalaze.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Chulusa mkono wako kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">nikombola na kunambula mwe mazi matali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">kulawa mwe nguvu za wajeni,<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />awo walonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">wachulusa mikono wehebwanta lulimi.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Zumbe Chohile, nahuchemele nchemo mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">nanitowe limba dina nyuzi mlongo umo hakuchemela,<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />weye wawenka maseuta wambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">na kumwambula mndima ywakwe Daudi mwe bamba dya file.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Nikombola na kunambula mwe mikono ya wajeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">awo wamemile udanti mwe imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">mikono yawo yatambalisa udanti.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Wabwanga wetu mo ubwanga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">nawatende saviya mimeya itunduliwe vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">wachiche wetu watende saviya nguzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">zizilingwe kuhamba idizumba dya seuta.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Magulu yetu yameme ulozo wa chila namna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">Ngoto zetu kwezinkonde nazeleke milongo na maelufu.<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Ludimo lwetu nalubuluze mizigo izamise.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">Iviwambaza havibogozoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">hakutende na kutahigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">hegu ndilo ya nkunto mwe izisila zetu.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Chinyemi ni cha wantu we seivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">ujimbiko wimwe wadya Zumbe ni Chohile ywawo.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu na wedi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Nahutogole weye Chohile ywangu na seuta ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">nahutunye kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Chila zuwa nahutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">na kudikutunya idizina dyako kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Zumbe Chohile ni mkulu naho awagila kutogoleswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">ukulu wakwe haukuhimika.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Cheleko chimwenga nachitogole izindima zako kwa cheleko chituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">nawatamwile ntendwa zako nkulu.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Nawalonge ung'azi wo ugoli wo ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">nanifanyanye mwe izindima zako zikwehela.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Wantu nawatamwile udahi we izindima zako zikutisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">miye nanitambalise ntendwa zako nkulu.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Wantu nawatambalise ntogozi zako wakakumbuka uwedi wako utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">naho nawacheme kwa chinyemi mo uwagila wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Zumbe Chohile ni mta mbazi na kulekeila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">hakusunguza kwihiwa, kamema ungi.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Zumbe Chohile ni ywedi kwa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">naho ana mbazi kwa chila chintu adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Zumbe Chohile, vyose uvyumbile navikutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">wakuka wako nawakuhongeze.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Nawatamwile ung'azi wo useuta wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">na kutambalisa ukulu wako,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />vileke wantu wose wamanye ntendwa zako nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">no ung'azi wo useuta wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Useuta wako ni useuta wa kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">udahi wako wekela vyeleko vyose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Zumbe Chohile ni mkanuni mo ulosi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">ni mta ungi kwa chila chintu adamaye.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Zumbe Chohile awadahiza wose wata nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">na kuwenula wadya wagwele.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Meso ya vyumbwa vyose yasinya wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">weye wavinka nkande zawo mwe ichipindi chakwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Wakunjula mkono wavinka nkande vintu vyose vina ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">wachintiza chila chikungwa ni chila china ujima.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Zumbe Chohile awagila mwe izisila zakwe zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">naho ni mkanuni mwe chila chintu adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Zumbe Chohile ehajihi na wadya wose wakumwitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">wose wakumwitanga kwa ukanuni.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Uyo enkiza chila chintu chikungwa mwe wadya wakumtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">eva indilo yawo na kuwambula.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Zumbe Chohile awamila wose wakumunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">mna wavu wose nawakome.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Mazuwa yose nanimtogole Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">Chila chumbe aumbile, chitogole idizina dyakwe dikukile kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogola Chohile Mwambula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">Miye nanimtogole Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Nanimtogole Zumbe Chohile mo wikazi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">nanimchemele ntogozi Zumbe Chohile ywangu wikazi wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Usekwika msuhi wako kwa masekulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">kwaviya ni wantu wakubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">awo hawakudaha kukwambula.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Umo wakabanika wahituka msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">idizuwa idyo mizungu yawo yose yaduma.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Ujimbiko ni kwa wadya wose wambizi wawo ni Chohile ywa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">wadya msuhi wawo wimwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo,<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />Mumbi ywe imbingu ne isi ne ibahali na vyose vimndani mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">Zumbe Chohile ni mkanuni kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Uyo awenka uwagila wadya wabunyanywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">naho awenka nkande wata sala.<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />Zumbe Chohile awadahiza matuntu wadahe kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Zumbe Chohile awenula wazamilwe ni mizigo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Zumbe Chohila awaunga wata uwagila.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Zumbe Chohile adima wajeni wakwikala mwe isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">awambiza wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo na wabanikilwe ni watati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">mna abalanga izisila za wantu wavu.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Zumbe Chohile ni seuta kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Chohile ywako weye Sayuni, vyeleko vyose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogola Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Kwaviya ni vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">kumchemela ntogozi Chohile ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">kwaviya ni mta mbazi naho awagila kuchemelwa ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Zumbe Chohile nuyo akuuzenga umzi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">naho awachisanya Waizulaeli wamwaganikane.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Ahonya wafile chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">na kufunga izinkwenje zawo.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Awaza izintondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">na kuzinka mazina zose.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Zumbe ywetu ni mkulu naho ni mta udahi utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">umanyi wakwe haukuhimika.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Zumbe Chohile awadahiza wata kunyanyahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">mna wakweduvya awadula hasi.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile kwa kumhongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">mchemeleni Chohile ywetu kwa magunda.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Uyo agubika imbingu kwa maingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">anyesa fula mwe isanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">na kutenda mani yahote mwa awagulu.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Awenka nkande wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">naho ayenka nkande machinda ya kungulu yakaila sala.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Chinyemi chakwe hachimwe nguvu za falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">iviya chinyemi chakwe hachimwe ukankalu wa wagomba nkondo,<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />mna awagilwa ni wadya wakumvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">wadya wakwika msuhi wawo mo ungi wakwe hewine udumo.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Mtogole Zumbe Chohile weye Yelusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Mtogole Chohile ywako weye Sayuni!<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Kwaviya katogeza imihindo ye izinchili zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">naho awajimbika awantu wakwikala umo mndani.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />Nuyo akwika utondowazi mwe imihaka yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">naho akwigusa kwa ngano yedi.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Atuma ulosi wakwe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">chiya akulonga chasunguza kudamanywa.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Atanda balafu saviya sufi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">amwaganisa mnyuzu saviya maivu.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Anyesa fula ya mayuwe saviya mpalamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">hahana akudaha kujijimiza umpeho wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Atuma lagizo dyakwe balafu yalujuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">avumiza nkung'unto, mazi yaguluka.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Amgambila Yakobo ulosi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">amwinka Izulaeli malagizo ne izisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Hatendile mbuli seizo kwa wantu wowose mwe izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">izinkanto zakwe hawazimanyize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wose wamtogole Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">mtogoleni nyuwe mkwikala kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Mtogoleni nyuwe wandima wakwe wose wa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">mtogole uyo, nyuwe wose vyumbe vya kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Mtogoleni uyo, nyuwe zuwa na mnenge, mtogoleni uyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">nyuwe ntondo zose zikung'ala.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Mtogoleni uyo, nyuwe mbingu zikulanga vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">na nyuwe mazi mlanga mo ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Viditogole idizina dya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">kwaviya alagizaga vyose niyo vyaumbwa,<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />kwa lagizo dyakwe kaika ivintu vyose hantu hakwe kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">kalavya lagizo hadikuhitukila kale na kale.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, kulawa mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">nyuwe vyumbe vikulu mwe bahali ne imizumilizo yose ye ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />lumwemwe lwa mbaula na fula ya mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">balafu na maingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">na nkung'unto vyachintiza malagizo yakwe,<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile, nyuwe nyose wagulu na magulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">miti ya ntunda na mielezi yose,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />wanyama wose wa kumbago na wakudimwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">wakubuluzika na wadege wakupuluka,<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />mtogole uyo, seuta ywe isi na wantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">masekulu na wakulu wose,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />wabwanga na wandele, wadalahala na wana.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Wantu wose waditogole idizina dya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">kwaviya zina dyakwe ichedu dikulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">Ukulu wakwe wi mlanga mwe isi na kwembingu.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Kawenka uhuda awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">elo wantu wakwe wose wamtogoleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">wana wa Izulaeli wantu we hajihi naye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya ntogozi kwa wedi wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Mchemeleni Zumbe Chohile nchemo mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">mtogoleni mwe mdugano wa wantu wakwe wakanuni.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli elelwani kwachausa cha Mumbi ywenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">wantu wa Sayuni mtende na chinyemi kwachausa cha seuta ywenyu.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Waditogole idizina dyakwe kwa ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">wamchemele kwa ngoma na zeze.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile awagilwa ni wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">uyo awahamba wasokezi kwa uhuda.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Wantu wakanuni webwede ichinyemi icho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">hata wakagona wacheme ntogozi.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Wachema kwa izwi kulu kumtogola Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">wakatenda na sime ikukanta kwidi mwe imikono yawo,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />vileke walihize chikoda mwa awantu mwe izisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">na kuwakantila wantu hewemmanyize Chohile,<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />wawatalize maseuta wawo kwa minyolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">wakulu wawo kwa mpingu za chuma,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />vileke wawakantile izinkanto zikigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Uwo nuwo uhuda wa awakanuni wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya kumtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Mtogoleni Chohile muno mwe Inyumba yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">mtogoleni mwe izimbingu zakwe nkulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Mtogoleni kwachausa cha ntendwa zakwe nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">mtogoleni kwachausa cho ung'azi wakwe mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Mtogoleni kwa lungole lwa magunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">mtogoleni kwa zeze na kilangu.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Mtogoleni kwa ngoma na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">mtogoleni kwa miluli na limba.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Mchemeleni kwa kutowa vilangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">mtogoleni kwa kutowa vilangu vikwilisa.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Chila china muye chimtogole Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Mtogoleni Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>